module

public import Mathlib
public import VariationalSW.Auto.SteinInterpolation

/-!
# An L⁴ estimate of Carleson–Sjölin type

This file was automatically generated by Claude.

## Setting

Let `Φ : ℝ → ℝ` be smooth and let `a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ` (variables `(s, u)`) be a smooth amplitude
with compact support (`ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a)`, `HasCompactSupport`). For `λ > 0`
and `g : ℝ → ℂ` we consider the oscillatory integral operator
`csOp Φ a λ g (x, u) = ∫ exp (i λ u Φ (x - y)) a (x - y, u) g y dy`, a function on `ℝ × ℝ`
(with Lebesgue measure). The mixed Hessian of the phase `u (Φ(x - y₁) + Φ(x - y₂))` of the
square `(csOp g)²` in `(x, u)` and `(y₁, y₂)` has determinant
`± u (Φ''(s₁) Φ'(s₂) - Φ''(s₂) Φ'(s₁))`, `sᵢ = x - yᵢ`, which vanishes on the diagonal
`y₁ = y₂`; the nondegeneracy hypothesis below says that it vanishes there only to first order.

## Main results

* `csOp_L2`: if `a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ [α, β]` and `Φ' ≠ 0` on `[α, β]`, then
  `‖csOp Φ a λ g‖_{L²(ℝ²)} ≤ C λ^{-1/2} ‖g‖_{L²(ℝ)}` for all `λ ≥ 1` and `g ∈ L²`.
* `csOp_L4`: if `α < β`, `a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ [α, β]`, `a s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u|` (with `c₀ > 0`) and
  `c |s - t| ≤ |Φ''(s) Φ'(t) - Φ''(t) Φ'(s)|` for `s, t ∈ [α, β]` (with `c > 0`), then
  `‖csOp Φ a λ g‖_{L⁴(ℝ²)} ≤ C λ^{-1/2} (log λ)^{1/2} ‖g‖_{L⁴(ℝ)}` for all `λ ≥ 2`, `g ∈ L⁴`.
* `csOp_Lq_mid`: under the hypotheses of both theorems, for `2 < q < 4`,
  `‖csOp Φ a λ g‖_q ≤ C λ^{-1/2} (log λ)^{1 - 2/q} ‖g‖_q` (`λ ≥ 2`).
* `csOp_Lq_high`: under the hypotheses of `csOp_L4`, for `4 < q < ∞`,
  `‖csOp Φ a λ g‖_q ≤ C λ^{-2/q} (log λ)^{2/q} ‖g‖_q` (`λ ≥ 2`).

The constants are not explicit. The statements depend only on Mathlib and the definition
`csOp`; the proofs of the last two results use `riesz_thorin` from
`VariationalSW.Auto.SteinInterpolation` (Riesz–Thorin interpolation between the `L²`, `L⁴` and the
trivial `L^∞` bounds, followed by a density argument).

## Proof

* **Non-stationary phase** (`csKernel_decay`): a bound `O(μ⁻⁴)`, uniform over families, for
  `∫ e^{iμuψ(r)} B(r, u) d(r, u)` when `u² ψ'² + ψ² ≳ 1` on the support of `B` and the
  derivatives of `ψ` and `B` are bounded. It is proved by integrating by parts four times with
  the transposed vector field of `(u ψ' ∂_r + ψ ∂_u) / (u² ψ'² + ψ²)` (`cs_ibp`); uniformity is
  handled by the classes `csGood` of families with uniformly bounded partial derivatives.
* **`L²`**: `TT*` (`cs_TTstar`) reduces matters to the kernel
  `∫∫ e^{iλu(Φ(x-y) - Φ(x-y'))} a ā dx du`, which is `O((1 + λ|y - y'|)⁻⁴)` since
  `|Φ(s) - Φ(t)| ≳ |s - t|` on `[α, β]`; Schur's test (`cs_schur`) concludes.
* **`L⁴`**: `‖T g‖₄² = ‖(T g)²‖₂` and `(T g)² = T₂ (g ⊗ g)`, where `T₂` is the two-dimensional
  operator with phase `u (Φ(x - y₁) + Φ(x - y₂))`. After localizing `a` to short `s`-intervals
  (smooth partition of unity `csChi`), `g ⊗ g` is decomposed dyadically in `|y₁ - y₂| ≈ δ`
  (`δ = ℓ 2^{-m} ≳ λ⁻¹`, separately for both signs of `y₁ - y₂`), plus a remainder
  `|y₁ - y₂| ≲ λ⁻¹` and a far part on which the amplitude vanishes (`cs_partition`). On a
  dyadic piece the kernel of `T₂* T₂` obeys the anisotropic bound
  `(1 + λ² |Δσ|²)⁻¹ (1 + λ² δ² |Δτ|²)⁻¹` (`σ = y₁ + y₂`, `τ = y₁ - y₂`, `cs_L4_kernel`); this
  rests on the geometric lower bound `|Γ(s) - Γ(s')| ≳ |Δσ| + δ |Δτ|` for
  `Γ(s₁, s₂) = (Φ(s₁) + Φ(s₂), Φ'(s₁) + Φ'(s₂))` (`cs_geom_lower`), which is where the degeneracy
  `|y₁ - y₂|` of the determinant enters, and on the matching upper bounds (`cs_upper`). Schur's
  test gives `‖T₂ G‖₂ ≲ λ⁻¹ δ^{-1/2} ‖G‖₂`, and `‖G‖₂² ≲ δ ‖g‖₄⁴` (`cs_diag_bound`); the
  remainder is estimated trivially. Each of the `O(log λ)` pieces contributes
  `O(λ⁻¹ ‖g‖₄²)`, so `‖(T g)²‖₂ ≲ λ⁻¹ log λ ‖g‖₄²`. Exploiting the orthogonality of the dyadic
  pieces would improve `(log λ)^{1/2}` to `(log λ)^{1/4}`; this is not done here.
* **Density**: all estimates are first proved for bounded compactly supported `g` and then
  extended by truncation and Fatou's lemma (`cs_density`).

## References

* L. Carleson, P. Sjölin, *Oscillatory integrals and a multiplier problem for the disc*,
  Studia Math. 44 (1972).
* L. Hörmander, *Oscillatory integrals and multipliers on FL^p*, Ark. Mat. 11 (1973).
* E. M. Stein, *Harmonic Analysis* (1993), Ch. IX §1 (the two-dimensional `L⁴` argument).
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace Auto

open MeasureTheory Complex Set Filter Topology
open scoped ContDiff ENNReal NNReal

noncomputable section

/-- Partial derivative in the first variable of a function on `ℝ × ℝ`. -/
def csD1 (f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ := fderiv ℝ f z (1, 0)

/-- Partial derivative in the second variable of a function on `ℝ × ℝ`. -/
def csD2 (f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ := fderiv ℝ f z (0, 1)

/-- A family of functions `f i` is `csGood U k` if on the sets `U i` it is `k` times
differentiable (in the sense of iterated partial derivatives) with all partial derivatives of
order `≤ k` bounded on `U i`, uniformly in `i`. -/
def csGood {ι : Type*} (U : ι → Set (ℝ × ℝ)) : ℕ → (ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) → Prop
  | 0, f => (∀ i, ContinuousOn (f i) (U i)) ∧ ∃ C, ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, ‖f i z‖ ≤ C
  | k + 1, f => (∀ i, DifferentiableOn ℝ (f i) (U i)) ∧ csGood U k f ∧
      csGood U k (fun i => csD1 (f i)) ∧ csGood U k (fun i => csD2 (f i))

variable {ι : Type*} {U : ι → Set (ℝ × ℝ)}

theorem csGood_succ_le {k : ℕ} {f : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (h : csGood U (k + 1) f) :
    csGood U k f := h.2.1

theorem csGood_mono : ∀ {n k : ℕ} {f : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ}, csGood U n f → k ≤ n → csGood U k f
  | 0, k, f, h, hk => by
    have : k = 0 := by omega
    subst this; exact h
  | n + 1, k, f, h, hk => by
    rcases Nat.lt_or_eq_of_le hk with hk | hk
    · exact csGood_mono h.2.1 (by omega)
    · subst hk; exact h

theorem csGood_continuousOn {k : ℕ} {f : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (h : csGood U k f) (i : ι) :
    ContinuousOn (f i) (U i) := (csGood_mono h (Nat.zero_le k)).1 i

theorem csGood_bdd {k : ℕ} {f : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (h : csGood U k f) :
    ∃ C, ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, ‖f i z‖ ≤ C := (csGood_mono h (Nat.zero_le k)).2

theorem csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {f' : ℝ × ℝ →L[ℝ] ℂ} {z : ℝ × ℝ}
    (h : HasFDerivAt f f' z) : csD1 f z = f' (1, 0) := by
  simp [csD1, h.fderiv]

theorem csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {f' : ℝ × ℝ →L[ℝ] ℂ} {z : ℝ × ℝ}
    (h : HasFDerivAt f f' z) : csD2 f z = f' (0, 1) := by
  simp [csD2, h.fderiv]

theorem csGood_congr (hU : ∀ i, IsOpen (U i)) :
    ∀ (k : ℕ) {f g : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ},
    (∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, f i z = g i z) → csGood U k f → csGood U k g
  | 0, f, g, hfg, ⟨h1, C, h2⟩ =>
    ⟨fun i => (h1 i).congr (fun z hz => (hfg i z hz).symm), C,
      fun i z hz => (hfg i z hz) ▸ h2 i z hz⟩
  | k + 1, f, g, hfg, ⟨h1, h2, h3, h4⟩ => by
    have hev : ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, f i =ᶠ[𝓝 z] g i := fun i z hz =>
      Filter.eventuallyEq_of_mem ((hU i).mem_nhds hz) (fun y hy => hfg i y hy)
    refine ⟨fun i => (h1 i).congr (fun z hz => (hfg i z hz).symm), csGood_congr hU k hfg h2,
      csGood_congr hU k ?_ h3, csGood_congr hU k ?_ h4⟩
    · intro i z hz; simp only [csD1]; rw [(hev i z hz).fderiv_eq]
    · intro i z hz; simp only [csD2]; rw [(hev i z hz).fderiv_eq]

theorem csGood_const : ∀ (k : ℕ) (c : ℂ), csGood U k (fun _ _ => c)
  | 0, c => ⟨fun _ => continuousOn_const, ‖c‖, fun _ _ _ => le_rfl⟩
  | k + 1, c => by
    refine ⟨fun _ => differentiableOn_const _, csGood_const k c, ?_, ?_⟩
    · have : (fun (_ : ι) => csD1 (fun _ => c)) = fun _ _ => (0 : ℂ) := by
        funext i z; simp [csD1]
      rw [this]; exact csGood_const k 0
    · have : (fun (_ : ι) => csD2 (fun _ => c)) = fun _ _ => (0 : ℂ) := by
        funext i z; simp [csD2]
      rw [this]; exact csGood_const k 0

theorem csGood_add (hU : ∀ i, IsOpen (U i)) :
    ∀ (k : ℕ) {f g : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ}, csGood U k f → csGood U k g →
    csGood U k (fun i z => f i z + g i z)
  | 0, f, g, ⟨hf1, C, hf2⟩, ⟨hg1, D, hg2⟩ =>
    ⟨fun i => (hf1 i).add (hg1 i), C + D,
      fun i z hz => (norm_add_le _ _).trans (add_le_add (hf2 i z hz) (hg2 i z hz))⟩
  | k + 1, f, g, ⟨hf1, hf2, hf3, hf4⟩, ⟨hg1, hg2, hg3, hg4⟩ => by
    refine ⟨fun i => (hf1 i).add (hg1 i), csGood_add hU k hf2 hg2, ?_, ?_⟩
    · refine csGood_congr hU k ?_ (csGood_add hU k hf3 hg3)
      intro i z hz
      have h1 := ((hf1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
      have h2 := ((hg1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
      change _ = csD1 (f i + g i) z
      rw [csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (h1.add h2), csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt h1,
        csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt h2]
      rfl
    · refine csGood_congr hU k ?_ (csGood_add hU k hf4 hg4)
      intro i z hz
      have h1 := ((hf1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
      have h2 := ((hg1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
      change _ = csD2 (f i + g i) z
      rw [csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (h1.add h2), csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt h1,
        csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt h2]
      rfl

theorem csGood_mul (hU : ∀ i, IsOpen (U i)) :
    ∀ (k : ℕ) {f g : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ}, csGood U k f → csGood U k g →
    csGood U k (fun i z => f i z * g i z)
  | 0, f, g, ⟨hf1, C, hf2⟩, ⟨hg1, D, hg2⟩ =>
    ⟨fun i => (hf1 i).mul (hg1 i), C * D, fun i z hz => by
      rw [norm_mul]
      exact mul_le_mul (hf2 i z hz) (hg2 i z hz) (norm_nonneg _)
        ((norm_nonneg _).trans (hf2 i z hz))⟩
  | k + 1, f, g, hf, hg => by
    obtain ⟨hf1, hf2, hf3, hf4⟩ := hf
    obtain ⟨hg1, hg2, hg3, hg4⟩ := hg
    refine ⟨fun i => (hf1 i).mul (hg1 i), csGood_mul hU k hf2 hg2, ?_, ?_⟩
    · refine csGood_congr hU k ?_
        (csGood_add hU k (csGood_mul hU k hf2 hg3) (csGood_mul hU k hg2 hf3))
      intro i z hz
      have h1 := ((hf1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
      have h2 := ((hg1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
      change _ = csD1 (f i * g i) z
      rw [csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (h1.mul h2), csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt h1,
        csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt h2]
      simp [smul_eq_mul]
    · refine csGood_congr hU k ?_
        (csGood_add hU k (csGood_mul hU k hf2 hg4) (csGood_mul hU k hg2 hf4))
      intro i z hz
      have h1 := ((hf1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
      have h2 := ((hg1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
      change _ = csD2 (f i * g i) z
      rw [csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (h1.mul h2), csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt h1,
        csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt h2]
      simp [smul_eq_mul]

theorem csGood_inv (hU : ∀ i, IsOpen (U i)) {q₀ : ℝ} (hq₀ : 0 < q₀) :
    ∀ (k : ℕ) {f : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ}, (∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, q₀ ≤ ‖f i z‖) → csGood U k f →
    csGood U k (fun i z => (f i z)⁻¹)
  | 0, f, hlow, ⟨hf1, _, _⟩ =>
    ⟨fun i => (hf1 i).inv₀ (fun z hz => norm_pos_iff.mp (hq₀.trans_le (hlow i z hz))),
      q₀⁻¹, fun i z hz => by
        rw [norm_inv]; exact inv_anti₀ hq₀ (hlow i z hz)⟩
  | k + 1, f, hlow, hf => by
    obtain ⟨hf1, hf2, hf3, hf4⟩ := hf
    have hne : ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, f i z ≠ 0 := fun i z hz =>
      norm_pos_iff.mp (hq₀.trans_le (hlow i z hz))
    have hIH := csGood_inv hU hq₀ k hlow hf2
    have hder : ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, HasFDerivAt (fun z => (f i z)⁻¹)
        ((-((f i z) ^ 2)⁻¹) • fderiv ℝ (f i) z) z := fun i z hz =>
      (hasDerivAt_inv (hne i z hz)).comp_hasFDerivAt z
        ((hf1 i).differentiableAt ((hU i).mem_nhds hz)).hasFDerivAt
    have key : ∀ (g : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ), csGood U k g →
        csGood U k (fun i z => (-1 : ℂ) * (g i z * ((f i z)⁻¹ * (f i z)⁻¹))) := fun g hg =>
      csGood_mul hU k (csGood_const k (-1)) (csGood_mul hU k hg (csGood_mul hU k hIH hIH))
    refine ⟨fun i z hz => (hder i z hz).differentiableAt.differentiableWithinAt, hIH, ?_, ?_⟩
    · refine csGood_congr hU k ?_ (key _ hf3)
      intro i z hz
      rw [csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (hder i z hz)]
      simp only [smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, csD1]
      field_simp
    · refine csGood_congr hU k ?_ (key _ hf4)
      intro i z hz
      rw [csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (hder i z hz)]
      simp only [smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, csD2]
      field_simp

/-- The second coordinate is a good function on uniformly bounded sets. -/
theorem csGood_snd {R : ℝ} (hR : ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, |z.2| ≤ R) :
    ∀ k : ℕ, csGood U k (fun _ z => ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ))
  | 0 => ⟨fun _ => (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp continuous_snd).continuousOn, R,
      fun i z hz => by simpa using hR i z hz⟩
  | k + 1 => by
    have hd : ∀ z : ℝ × ℝ, HasFDerivAt (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ))
        (Complex.ofRealCLM.comp (ContinuousLinearMap.snd ℝ ℝ ℝ)) z := fun z =>
      Complex.ofRealCLM.hasFDerivAt.comp z (hasFDerivAt_snd)
    refine ⟨fun i z _ => (hd z).differentiableAt.differentiableWithinAt, csGood_snd hR k, ?_, ?_⟩
    · have : (fun (_ : ι) => csD1 (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ))) = fun _ _ => (0 : ℂ) := by
        funext i z; rw [csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (hd z)]; simp
      rw [this]; exact csGood_const k 0
    · have : (fun (_ : ι) => csD2 (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ))) = fun _ _ => (1 : ℂ) := by
        funext i z; rw [csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (hd z)]; simp
      rw [this]; exact csGood_const k 1

/-- Functions of the first variable with bounded derivatives are good. -/
theorem csGood_fst :
    ∀ (k : ℕ) (h : ι → ℝ → ℝ), (∀ i, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (h i)) →
    (∃ C, ∀ i, ∀ j ≤ k, ∀ z ∈ U i, |iteratedDeriv j (h i) z.1| ≤ C) →
    csGood U k (fun i z => ((h i z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ))
  | 0, h, hh, ⟨C, hC⟩ =>
    ⟨fun i => (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp ((hh i).continuous.comp continuous_fst)).continuousOn,
      C, fun i z hz => by simpa using hC i 0 le_rfl z hz⟩
  | k + 1, h, hh, ⟨C, hC⟩ => by
    have hdiff : ∀ i, Differentiable ℝ (h i) := fun i =>
      (hh i).differentiable (by simp)
    have hd : ∀ i, ∀ z : ℝ × ℝ, HasFDerivAt (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => ((h i z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ))
        (Complex.ofRealCLM.comp ((ContinuousLinearMap.toSpanSingleton ℝ (deriv (h i) z.1)).comp
          (ContinuousLinearMap.fst ℝ ℝ ℝ))) z := fun i z =>
      Complex.ofRealCLM.hasFDerivAt.comp z
        (((hdiff i z.1).hasDerivAt.hasFDerivAt).comp z hasFDerivAt_fst)
    have hIH := csGood_fst k h hh ⟨C, fun i j hj z hz => hC i j (by omega) z hz⟩
    have hIH' := csGood_fst k (fun i => deriv (h i))
      (fun i => (contDiff_infty_iff_deriv.mp (hh i)).2)
      ⟨C, fun i j hj z hz => by
        rw [← iteratedDeriv_succ']; exact hC i (j + 1) (by omega) z hz⟩
    refine ⟨fun i z _ => (hd i z).differentiableAt.differentiableWithinAt, hIH, ?_, ?_⟩
    · have : (fun i => csD1 (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => ((h i z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ))) =
          fun i z => ((deriv (h i) z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
        funext i z; rw [csD1_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (hd i z)]; simp
      rw [this]; exact hIH'
    · have : (fun i => csD2 (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => ((h i z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ))) = fun _ _ => (0 : ℂ) := by
        funext i z; rw [csD2_eq_of_hasFDerivAt (hd i z)]; simp
      rw [this]; exact csGood_const k 0

/-- Translates of a smooth compactly supported function are good. -/
theorem csGood_translate :
    ∀ (k : ℕ) (f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) (c : ι → ℝ × ℝ), ContDiff ℝ ∞ f → HasCompactSupport f →
    csGood U k (fun i z => f (z + c i))
  | 0, f, c, hf, hfs => by
    obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := hf.continuous.bounded_above_of_compact_support hfs
    exact ⟨fun i => (hf.continuous.comp (continuous_id.add continuous_const)).continuousOn, C,
      fun i z _ => hC _⟩
  | k + 1, f, c, hf, hfs => by
    have hdiff : Differentiable ℝ f := hf.differentiable (by simp)
    have hfd : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fderiv ℝ f) := hf.fderiv_right (by simp)
    have hcs : ∀ v : ℝ × ℝ, HasCompactSupport (fun z => fderiv ℝ f z v) := fun v =>
      (hfs.fderiv (𝕜 := ℝ)).comp_left (g := fun L : ℝ × ℝ →L[ℝ] ℂ => L v) rfl
    have hcd : ∀ v : ℝ × ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun z => fderiv ℝ f z v) := fun v =>
      hfd.clm_apply contDiff_const
    refine ⟨fun i z _ => ((hdiff (z + c i)).comp z
      (differentiableAt_id.add (differentiableAt_const _))).differentiableWithinAt,
      csGood_translate k f c hf hfs, ?_, ?_⟩
    · have : (fun i => csD1 (fun z => f (z + c i))) =
          fun i z => (fun z => fderiv ℝ f z (1, 0)) (z + c i) := by
        funext i z; simp [csD1, fderiv_comp_add_right]
      rw [this]; exact csGood_translate k _ c (hcd _) (hcs _)
    · have : (fun i => csD2 (fun z => f (z + c i))) =
          fun i z => (fun z => fderiv ℝ f z (0, 1)) (z + c i) := by
        funext i z; simp [csD2, fderiv_comp_add_right]
      rw [this]; exact csGood_translate k _ c (hcd _) (hcs _)



/-! ### Integration by parts for the phase `exp(i μ u ψ(r))` -/

/-- The phase `exp(i μ u ψ(r))` at `z = (r, u)`. -/
def csPh (μ : ℝ) (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=
  cexp (I * (μ : ℂ) * ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ))

/-- `|∇(u ψ(r))|² = u² ψ'(r)² + ψ(r)²`. -/
def csQ (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=
  ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) ^ 2 * ((deriv ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) ^ 2 + ((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) ^ 2

/-- First coefficient of the transposed vector field. -/
def csC1 (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=
  ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * (csQ ψ z)⁻¹

/-- Second coefficient of the transposed vector field. -/
def csC2 (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ := ((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * (csQ ψ z)⁻¹

/-- The transposed vector field: `∫ e^{iμuψ} f = (i/μ) ∫ e^{iμuψ} csM ψ f`. -/
def csM (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=
  csD1 (fun z => csC1 ψ z * f z) z + csD2 (fun z => csC2 ψ z * f z) z

theorem csPh_norm (μ : ℝ) (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ‖csPh μ ψ z‖ = 1 := by
  unfold csPh
  rw [show I * (μ : ℂ) * ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) =
    ((μ * z.2 * ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * I by push_cast; ring]
  exact Complex.norm_exp_ofReal_mul_I _

theorem csPh_continuous (μ : ℝ) {ψ : ℝ → ℝ} (hψ : Continuous ψ) : Continuous (csPh μ ψ) := by
  unfold csPh
  fun_prop

theorem cs_eventuallyEq_zero {f c : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {z : ℝ × ℝ} (hz : z ∉ tsupport f) :
    (fun z => c z * f z) =ᶠ[𝓝 z] 0 := by
  have : (tsupport f)ᶜ ∈ 𝓝 z := (isClosed_tsupport f).isOpen_compl.mem_nhds hz
  filter_upwards [this] with y hy
  simp [image_eq_zero_of_notMem_tsupport hy]

theorem cs_differentiable_of_on {g : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {U K : Set (ℝ × ℝ)} (hU : IsOpen U)
    (hK : IsClosed K) (hKU : K ⊆ U) (hg0 : ∀ z ∉ K, g z = 0) (hd : DifferentiableOn ℝ g U) :
    Differentiable ℝ g := by
  intro z
  by_cases hz : z ∈ U
  · exact hd.differentiableAt (hU.mem_nhds hz)
  · have hzK : z ∉ K := fun h => hz (hKU h)
    have : g =ᶠ[𝓝 z] fun _ => 0 :=
      Filter.eventuallyEq_of_mem (hK.isOpen_compl.mem_nhds hzK) (fun y hy => hg0 y hy)
    exact (differentiableAt_const (0 : ℂ)).congr_of_eventuallyEq this

theorem cs_continuous_of_on {g : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {U K : Set (ℝ × ℝ)} (hU : IsOpen U)
    (hK : IsClosed K) (hKU : K ⊆ U) (hg0 : ∀ z ∉ K, g z = 0) (hc : ContinuousOn g U) :
    Continuous g := by
  rw [continuous_iff_continuousAt]
  intro z
  by_cases hz : z ∈ U
  · exact hc.continuousAt (hU.mem_nhds hz)
  · have hzK : z ∉ K := fun h => hz (hKU h)
    have : g =ᶠ[𝓝 z] fun _ => 0 :=
      Filter.eventuallyEq_of_mem (hK.isOpen_compl.mem_nhds hzK) (fun y hy => hg0 y hy)
    exact (continuousAt_const).congr this.symm

theorem cs_fderiv_zero_of {g : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {K : Set (ℝ × ℝ)} (hK : IsClosed K)
    (hg0 : ∀ z ∉ K, g z = 0) {z : ℝ × ℝ} (hz : z ∉ K) : fderiv ℝ g z = 0 := by
  have : g =ᶠ[𝓝 z] fun _ => 0 :=
    Filter.eventuallyEq_of_mem (hK.isOpen_compl.mem_nhds hz) (fun y hy => hg0 y hy)
  rw [this.fderiv_eq]; simp

theorem cs_integrable_of_continuous {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (hf : Continuous f) {R : ℝ}
    (hs : ∀ z, f z ≠ 0 → z ∈ Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R) : Integrable f := by
  refine hf.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport
    (HasCompactSupport.intro (isCompact_closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R) ?_)
  intro z hz; by_contra h; exact hz (hs z h)

theorem cs_section1_integrable {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (hf : Continuous f) {R : ℝ}
    (hs : ∀ z, f z ≠ 0 → z ∈ Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R) (u : ℝ) :
    Integrable (fun r => f (r, u)) := by
  refine (hf.comp (continuous_id.prodMk continuous_const)).integrable_of_hasCompactSupport
    (HasCompactSupport.intro (isCompact_closedBall (0 : ℝ) R) ?_)
  intro r hr; by_contra h
  apply hr
  have := hs _ h
  rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at this ⊢
  exact (norm_fst_le _).trans this

theorem cs_section2_integrable {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (hf : Continuous f) {R : ℝ}
    (hs : ∀ z, f z ≠ 0 → z ∈ Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R) (r : ℝ) :
    Integrable (fun u => f (r, u)) := by
  refine (hf.comp (continuous_const.prodMk continuous_id)).integrable_of_hasCompactSupport
    (HasCompactSupport.intro (isCompact_closedBall (0 : ℝ) R) ?_)
  intro u hu; by_contra h
  apply hu
  have := hs _ h
  rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at this ⊢
  exact (norm_snd_le _).trans this

theorem cs_hasDerivAt_fst {g : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (hg : Differentiable ℝ g) (r u : ℝ) :
    HasDerivAt (fun r => g (r, u)) (csD1 g (r, u)) r := by
  have h1 : HasDerivAt (fun r : ℝ => ((r, u) : ℝ × ℝ)) ((1 : ℝ), (0 : ℝ)) r :=
    (hasDerivAt_id r).prodMk (hasDerivAt_const r u)
  exact (hg (r, u)).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt r h1

theorem cs_hasDerivAt_snd {g : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (hg : Differentiable ℝ g) (r u : ℝ) :
    HasDerivAt (fun u => g (r, u)) (csD2 g (r, u)) u := by
  have h1 : HasDerivAt (fun u : ℝ => ((r, u) : ℝ × ℝ)) ((0 : ℝ), (1 : ℝ)) u :=
    (hasDerivAt_const u r).prodMk (hasDerivAt_id u)
  exact (hg (r, u)).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt u h1

/-- One integration by parts with the vector field `csM`. -/
theorem cs_ibp {μ : ℝ} (hμ : μ ≠ 0) {ψ : ℝ → ℝ} (hψ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ ψ)
    {U : Set (ℝ × ℝ)} (hU : IsOpen U) {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {R : ℝ}
    (hfU : tsupport f ⊆ U) (hfR : tsupport f ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R)
    (hQ : ∀ z ∈ U, csQ ψ z ≠ 0)
    (h1 : DifferentiableOn ℝ (fun z => csC1 ψ z * f z) U)
    (h2 : DifferentiableOn ℝ (fun z => csC2 ψ z * f z) U)
    (h1' : ContinuousOn (csD1 (fun z => csC1 ψ z * f z)) U)
    (h2' : ContinuousOn (csD2 (fun z => csC2 ψ z * f z)) U) :
    ∫ z, csPh μ ψ z * f z = (I / μ) * ∫ z, csPh μ ψ z * csM ψ f z := by
  set g₁ : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ := fun z => csC1 ψ z * f z with hg₁
  set g₂ : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ := fun z => csC2 ψ z * f z with hg₂
  have hK : IsClosed (tsupport f) := isClosed_tsupport f
  have hf0 : ∀ z ∉ tsupport f, f z = 0 := fun z hz => image_eq_zero_of_notMem_tsupport hz
  have hg₁0 : ∀ z ∉ tsupport f, g₁ z = 0 := fun z hz => by simp [hg₁, hf0 z hz]
  have hg₂0 : ∀ z ∉ tsupport f, g₂ z = 0 := fun z hz => by simp [hg₂, hf0 z hz]
  have hg₁d : Differentiable ℝ g₁ := cs_differentiable_of_on hU hK hfU hg₁0 h1
  have hg₂d : Differentiable ℝ g₂ := cs_differentiable_of_on hU hK hfU hg₂0 h2
  have hD1z : ∀ z ∉ tsupport f, csD1 g₁ z = 0 := fun z hz => by
    simp [csD1, cs_fderiv_zero_of hK hg₁0 hz]
  have hD2z : ∀ z ∉ tsupport f, csD2 g₂ z = 0 := fun z hz => by
    simp [csD2, cs_fderiv_zero_of hK hg₂0 hz]
  have hD1c : Continuous (csD1 g₁) := cs_continuous_of_on hU hK hfU hD1z h1'
  have hD2c : Continuous (csD2 g₂) := cs_continuous_of_on hU hK hfU hD2z h2'
  have hg₁c : Continuous g₁ := hg₁d.continuous
  have hg₂c : Continuous g₂ := hg₂d.continuous
  have hψc : Continuous ψ := hψ.continuous
  have hψd : Differentiable ℝ ψ := hψ.differentiable (by simp)
  have hψ'c : Continuous (deriv ψ) := hψ.continuous_deriv (by simp)
  have hphc : Continuous (csPh μ ψ) := csPh_continuous μ hψc
  have hsupp : ∀ (h : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ), (∀ z ∉ tsupport f, h z = 0) →
      ∀ z, h z ≠ 0 → z ∈ Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R := fun h hh z hz => by
    by_contra hc; exact hz (hh z (fun hm => hc (hfR hm)))
  -- decomposition of `f`
  have hdec : ∀ z, f z = ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₁ z +
      ((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₂ z := by
    intro z
    by_cases hz : z ∈ U
    · have hq := hQ z hz
      simp only [hg₁, hg₂, csC1, csC2]
      field_simp
      unfold csQ
      ring
    · have hzK : z ∉ tsupport f := fun h => hz (hfU h)
      simp [hf0 z hzK, hg₁0 z hzK, hg₂0 z hzK]
  have hμc : (μ : ℂ) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast hμ
  have hIμ : I * (μ : ℂ) ≠ 0 := mul_ne_zero I_ne_zero hμc
  -- first integration by parts, in `r`
  have hA : ∫ z, csPh μ ψ z * (((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₁ z) =
      -(1 / (I * μ)) * ∫ z, csPh μ ψ z * csD1 g₁ z := by
    have hi1 : Integrable (fun z => csPh μ ψ z *
        (((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₁ z)) := by
      refine cs_integrable_of_continuous (by fun_prop) (hsupp _ ?_)
      intro z hz; simp [hg₁0 z hz]
    have hi2 : Integrable (fun z => csPh μ ψ z * csD1 g₁ z) := by
      refine cs_integrable_of_continuous (by fun_prop) (hsupp _ ?_)
      intro z hz; simp [hD1z z hz]
    rw [Measure.volume_eq_prod, integral_prod_symm _ hi1, integral_prod_symm _ hi2,
      ← integral_const_mul]
    congr 1; funext u
    have hφ : ∀ r, HasDerivAt (fun r => csPh μ ψ (r, u))
        (csPh μ ψ (r, u) * (I * μ * ((u : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ r : ℝ) : ℂ))) r := by
      intro r
      have := (((hψd r).hasDerivAt.ofReal_comp).const_mul (I * (μ : ℂ) * ((u : ℝ) : ℂ))).cexp
      simpa [csPh] using this
    have hG : ∀ r, HasDerivAt (fun r => g₁ (r, u)) (csD1 g₁ (r, u)) r :=
      fun r => cs_hasDerivAt_fst hg₁d r u
    have hs1 := cs_section1_integrable (f := fun z => g₁ z * (csPh μ ψ z *
        (I * μ * ((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ)))) (by fun_prop)
      (hsupp _ (fun z hz => by simp [hg₁0 z hz])) u
    have hs2 := cs_section1_integrable (f := fun z => csD1 g₁ z * csPh μ ψ z) (by fun_prop)
      (hsupp _ (fun z hz => by simp [hD1z z hz])) u
    have hs3 := cs_section1_integrable (f := fun z => g₁ z * csPh μ ψ z) (by fun_prop)
      (hsupp _ (fun z hz => by simp [hg₁0 z hz])) u
    have key := integral_mul_deriv_eq_deriv_mul_of_integrable (fun r _ => hG r)
      (fun r _ => hφ r) hs1 hs2 hs3
    have e1 : (fun r => csPh μ ψ (r, u) * (((u : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ r : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₁ (r, u))) =
        fun r => (1 / (I * μ)) * (g₁ (r, u) * (csPh μ ψ (r, u) *
          (I * μ * ((u : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ r : ℝ) : ℂ)))) := by
      funext r; field_simp
    try simp only at e1 ⊢
    rw [e1, integral_const_mul]
    try simp only at key
    rw [key]
    have e2 : (fun r => csD1 g₁ (r, u) * csPh μ ψ (r, u)) =
        fun r => csPh μ ψ (r, u) * csD1 g₁ (r, u) := by funext r; ring
    rw [e2]; ring
  -- second integration by parts, in `u`
  have hB : ∫ z, csPh μ ψ z * (((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₂ z) =
      -(1 / (I * μ)) * ∫ z, csPh μ ψ z * csD2 g₂ z := by
    have hi1 : Integrable (fun z => csPh μ ψ z * (((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₂ z)) := by
      refine cs_integrable_of_continuous (by fun_prop) (hsupp _ ?_)
      intro z hz; simp [hg₂0 z hz]
    have hi2 : Integrable (fun z => csPh μ ψ z * csD2 g₂ z) := by
      refine cs_integrable_of_continuous (by fun_prop) (hsupp _ ?_)
      intro z hz; simp [hD2z z hz]
    rw [Measure.volume_eq_prod, integral_prod _ hi1, integral_prod _ hi2,
      ← integral_const_mul]
    congr 1; funext r
    have hφ : ∀ u, HasDerivAt (fun u => csPh μ ψ (r, u))
        (csPh μ ψ (r, u) * (I * μ * ((ψ r : ℝ) : ℂ))) u := by
      intro u
      have := ((((hasDerivAt_id u).ofReal_comp).const_mul (I * (μ : ℂ))).mul_const
        ((ψ r : ℝ) : ℂ)).cexp
      simpa [csPh] using this
    have hG : ∀ u, HasDerivAt (fun u => g₂ (r, u)) (csD2 g₂ (r, u)) u :=
      fun u => cs_hasDerivAt_snd hg₂d r u
    have hs1 := cs_section2_integrable (f := fun z => g₂ z * (csPh μ ψ z *
        (I * μ * ((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ)))) (by fun_prop)
      (hsupp _ (fun z hz => by simp [hg₂0 z hz])) r
    have hs2 := cs_section2_integrable (f := fun z => csD2 g₂ z * csPh μ ψ z) (by fun_prop)
      (hsupp _ (fun z hz => by simp [hD2z z hz])) r
    have hs3 := cs_section2_integrable (f := fun z => g₂ z * csPh μ ψ z) (by fun_prop)
      (hsupp _ (fun z hz => by simp [hg₂0 z hz])) r
    have key := integral_mul_deriv_eq_deriv_mul_of_integrable (fun u _ => hG u)
      (fun u _ => hφ u) hs1 hs2 hs3
    have e1 : (fun u => csPh μ ψ (r, u) * (((ψ r : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₂ (r, u))) =
        fun u => (1 / (I * μ)) * (g₂ (r, u) * (csPh μ ψ (r, u) *
          (I * μ * ((ψ r : ℝ) : ℂ)))) := by
      funext u; field_simp
    try simp only at e1 ⊢
    rw [e1, integral_const_mul]
    try simp only at key
    rw [key]
    have e2 : (fun u => csD2 g₂ (r, u) * csPh μ ψ (r, u)) =
        fun u => csPh μ ψ (r, u) * csD2 g₂ (r, u) := by funext u; ring
    rw [e2]; ring
  -- combine
  have hiA : Integrable (fun z => csPh μ ψ z *
      (((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₁ z)) := by
    refine cs_integrable_of_continuous (by fun_prop) (hsupp _ ?_)
    intro z hz; simp [hg₁0 z hz]
  have hiB : Integrable (fun z => csPh μ ψ z * (((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₂ z)) := by
    refine cs_integrable_of_continuous (by fun_prop) (hsupp _ ?_)
    intro z hz; simp [hg₂0 z hz]
  have hiC : Integrable (fun z => csPh μ ψ z * csD1 g₁ z) := by
    refine cs_integrable_of_continuous (by fun_prop) (hsupp _ ?_)
    intro z hz; simp [hD1z z hz]
  have hiD : Integrable (fun z => csPh μ ψ z * csD2 g₂ z) := by
    refine cs_integrable_of_continuous (by fun_prop) (hsupp _ ?_)
    intro z hz; simp [hD2z z hz]
  have hsplit : (fun z => csPh μ ψ z * f z) = fun z =>
      csPh μ ψ z * (((z.2 : ℝ) : ℂ) * ((deriv ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₁ z) +
      csPh μ ψ z * (((ψ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) * g₂ z) := by
    funext z; rw [hdec z]; ring
  have hsplit2 : (fun z => csPh μ ψ z * csM ψ f z) = fun z =>
      csPh μ ψ z * csD1 g₁ z + csPh μ ψ z * csD2 g₂ z := by
    funext z; simp only [csM]; ring
  rw [hsplit, integral_add hiA hiB, hA, hB, hsplit2, integral_add hiC hiD]
  have : -(1 / (I * (μ : ℂ))) = I / μ := by
    field_simp
    rw [I_sq]
  rw [← this]; ring


theorem csM_tsupport (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) : tsupport (csM ψ f) ⊆ tsupport f := by
  apply closure_minimal _ (isClosed_tsupport f)
  intro z hz
  by_contra h
  apply hz
  have h1 : fderiv ℝ (fun z => csC1 ψ z * f z) z = 0 := by
    rw [(cs_eventuallyEq_zero h).fderiv_eq]; simp
  have h2 : fderiv ℝ (fun z => csC2 ψ z * f z) z = 0 := by
    rw [(cs_eventuallyEq_zero h).fderiv_eq]; simp
  simp [csM, csD1, csD2, h1, h2]

/-- Iterates of the transposed vector field. -/
def csMiter (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) : ℕ → (ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ
  | 0, f => f
  | n + 1, f => csM ψ (csMiter ψ n f)

theorem csMiter_tsupport (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) :
    ∀ n, tsupport (csMiter ψ n f) ⊆ tsupport f
  | 0 => le_rfl
  | n + 1 => (csM_tsupport ψ _).trans (csMiter_tsupport ψ f n)

theorem csGood_M {ι : Type*} {U : ι → Set (ℝ × ℝ)} (hU : ∀ i, IsOpen (U i)) {k : ℕ}
    {ψ : ι → ℝ → ℝ} {f : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ}
    (hc1 : csGood U (k + 1) (fun i z => csC1 (ψ i) z))
    (hc2 : csGood U (k + 1) (fun i z => csC2 (ψ i) z))
    (hf : csGood U (k + 1) f) : csGood U k (fun i => csM (ψ i) (f i)) := by
  have h1 := (csGood_mul hU (k + 1) hc1 hf).2.2.1
  have h2 := (csGood_mul hU (k + 1) hc2 hf).2.2.2
  exact csGood_add hU k h1 h2

/-- **Non-stationary phase.** Uniform decay `O(μ⁻⁴)` of `∫ e^{iμuψ(r)} B(r,u) d(r,u)` for a family
of phases and amplitudes with uniformly bounded derivatives on open sets `U i` where the gradient
of `u ψ(r)` is bounded below. -/
theorem csKernel_decay {ι : Type*} (U : ι → Set (ℝ × ℝ)) (hU : ∀ i, IsOpen (U i))
    {R : ℝ} (hUR : ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, |z.2| ≤ R)
    (μ : ι → ℝ) (hμ : ∀ i, 0 < μ i) (ψ : ι → ℝ → ℝ) (hψ : ∀ i, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (ψ i))
    (hψb : ∃ C, ∀ i, ∀ j ≤ 5, ∀ z ∈ U i, |iteratedDeriv j (ψ i) z.1| ≤ C)
    {q₀ : ℝ} (hq₀ : 0 < q₀) (hQ : ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, q₀ ≤ ‖csQ (ψ i) z‖)
    (B : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) (hB : csGood U 4 B) (hBU : ∀ i, tsupport (B i) ⊆ U i)
    {R' : ℝ} (hBR : ∀ i, tsupport (B i) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R') :
    ∃ C, ∀ i, ‖∫ z, csPh (μ i) (ψ i) z * B i z‖ ≤ C / μ i ^ 4 := by
  obtain ⟨Cψ, hCψ⟩ := hψb
  have hψG : csGood U 4 (fun i z => ((ψ i z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ)) :=
    csGood_fst 4 ψ hψ ⟨Cψ, fun i j hj z hz => hCψ i j (by omega) z hz⟩
  have hψ'G : csGood U 4 (fun i z => ((deriv (ψ i) z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ)) :=
    csGood_fst 4 (fun i => deriv (ψ i)) (fun i => (contDiff_infty_iff_deriv.mp (hψ i)).2)
      ⟨Cψ, fun i j hj z hz => by
        rw [← iteratedDeriv_succ']; exact hCψ i (j + 1) (by omega) z hz⟩
  have huG := csGood_snd (U := U) hUR 4
  have hQG : csGood U 4 (fun i z => csQ (ψ i) z) := by
    refine csGood_congr hU 4 ?_ (csGood_add hU 4 (csGood_mul hU 4 (csGood_mul hU 4 huG huG)
      (csGood_mul hU 4 hψ'G hψ'G)) (csGood_mul hU 4 hψG hψG))
    intro i z _; simp only [csQ]; ring
  have hQiG := csGood_inv hU hq₀ 4 hQ hQG
  have hc1 : csGood U 4 (fun i z => csC1 (ψ i) z) :=
    csGood_mul hU 4 (csGood_mul hU 4 huG hψ'G) hQiG
  have hc2 : csGood U 4 (fun i z => csC2 (ψ i) z) := csGood_mul hU 4 hψG hQiG
  -- goodness of the iterates
  have hiter : ∀ n ≤ 4, csGood U (4 - n) (fun i => csMiter (ψ i) n (B i)) := by
    intro n
    induction n with
    | zero => intro _; exact hB
    | succ n ih =>
      intro hn
      have h := ih (by omega)
      have e : 4 - n = (4 - (n + 1)) + 1 := by omega
      rw [e] at h
      exact csGood_M hU (csGood_mono hc1 (by omega)) (csGood_mono hc2 (by omega)) h
  have hsupp : ∀ n i, tsupport (csMiter (ψ i) n (B i)) ⊆ tsupport (B i) :=
    fun n i => csMiter_tsupport (ψ i) (B i) n
  -- iterated integration by parts
  have hibp : ∀ n ≤ 4, ∀ i, ∫ z, csPh (μ i) (ψ i) z * B i z =
      (I / μ i) ^ n * ∫ z, csPh (μ i) (ψ i) z * csMiter (ψ i) n (B i) z := by
    intro n
    induction n with
    | zero => intro _ i; simp [csMiter]
    | succ n ih =>
      intro hn i
      rw [ih (by omega) i, pow_succ, mul_assoc]
      congr 1
      have hgood := hiter n (by omega)
      have e : 4 - n = (4 - (n + 1)) + 1 := by omega
      rw [e] at hgood
      have hp1 := csGood_mul hU _ (csGood_mono hc1 (by omega)) hgood
      have hp2 := csGood_mul hU _ (csGood_mono hc2 (by omega)) hgood
      have := cs_ibp (μ := μ i) (hμ i).ne' (hψ i) (hU i) (f := csMiter (ψ i) n (B i))
        ((hsupp n i).trans (hBU i)) ((hsupp n i).trans (hBR i))
        (fun z hz => norm_pos_iff.mp (hq₀.trans_le (hQ i z hz)))
        (hp1.1 i) (hp2.1 i) (csGood_continuousOn hp1.2.2.1 i)
        (csGood_continuousOn hp2.2.2.2 i)
      rw [this]
      rfl
  obtain ⟨C₀, hC₀⟩ := csGood_bdd (hiter 4 le_rfl)
  refine ⟨max C₀ 0 * (volume (Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R')).toReal, fun i => ?_⟩
  rw [hibp 4 le_rfl i, norm_mul, norm_pow, norm_div, norm_I, Complex.norm_real,
    Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (hμ i), div_pow, one_pow, div_mul_eq_mul_div, one_mul]
  gcongr
  have hint : Integrable ((Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R').indicator
      (fun _ => max C₀ 0)) := by
    refine (integrableOn_const ?_ ).integrable_indicator measurableSet_closedBall
    exact (measure_closedBall_lt_top).ne
  refine (norm_integral_le_of_norm_le hint (Filter.Eventually.of_forall ?_)).trans ?_
  · intro z
    rw [norm_mul, csPh_norm, one_mul]
    by_cases hz : z ∈ tsupport (B i)
    · have hzU : z ∈ U i := hBU i hz
      have hzR : z ∈ Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R' := hBR i hz
      rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hzR]
      try simp only [Nat.sub_self] at hC₀
      exact (hC₀ i z hzU).trans (le_max_left _ _)
    · have : csMiter (ψ i) 4 (B i) z = 0 :=
        image_eq_zero_of_notMem_tsupport (fun h => hz (hsupp 4 i h))
      rw [this, norm_zero]
      exact Set.indicator_nonneg (fun _ _ => le_max_right _ _) _
  · rw [integral_indicator_const _ measurableSet_closedBall]
    simp [mul_comm, Measure.real]


/-! ### Real-variable estimates for the phase -/

theorem cs_le_sub_of_deriv {g g' : ℝ → ℝ} {A : ℝ}
    (hg : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, HasDerivAt g (g' θ) θ)
    (hA : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, A ≤ g' θ) : A ≤ g 1 - g 0 := by
  have hcont : ContinuousOn g (Icc 0 1) := fun θ hθ => (hg θ hθ).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt
  have hdiff : DifferentiableOn ℝ g (interior (Icc 0 1)) := fun θ hθ =>
    (hg θ (interior_subset hθ)).differentiableAt.differentiableWithinAt
  have := (convex_Icc (0 : ℝ) 1).mul_sub_le_image_sub_of_le_deriv hcont hdiff
    (fun θ hθ => by
      rw [(hg θ (interior_subset hθ)).deriv]; exact hA θ (interior_subset hθ))
    0 (by simp) 1 (by simp) zero_le_one
  simpa using this

theorem cs_abs_sub_le_of_deriv {g g' : ℝ → ℝ} {A : ℝ}
    (hg : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, HasDerivAt g (g' θ) θ)
    (hA : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, |g' θ| ≤ A) : |g 1 - g 0| ≤ A := by
  have h1 : -A ≤ g 1 - g 0 := cs_le_sub_of_deriv hg (fun θ hθ => (abs_le.mp (hA θ hθ)).1)
  have h2 : -A ≤ -g 1 - -g 0 := cs_le_sub_of_deriv (g := fun θ => -g θ)
    (g' := fun θ => -g' θ) (fun θ hθ => (hg θ hθ).neg)
    (fun θ hθ => by have := (abs_le.mp (hA θ hθ)).2; linarith)
  rw [abs_le]; constructor <;> linarith

theorem cs_lipschitz_of_deriv {f : ℝ → ℝ} {T : Set ℝ} (hT : Convex ℝ T)
    (hf : Differentiable ℝ f) {M : ℝ} (hM : ∀ x ∈ T, |deriv f x| ≤ M) {x y : ℝ}
    (hx : x ∈ T) (hy : y ∈ T) : |f x - f y| ≤ M * |x - y| := by
  have := hT.norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_deriv_le (f := f) (fun z _ => hf z)
    (fun z hz => by rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]; exact hM z hz) hy hx
  simpa [Real.norm_eq_abs] using this

theorem cs_path_mem {T : Set ℝ} (hT : Convex ℝ T) {a a' : ℝ} (ha : a ∈ T) (ha' : a' ∈ T)
    {θ : ℝ} (hθ : θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1) : a' + θ * (a - a') ∈ T := by
  have := hT ha' ha (by linarith [hθ.2] : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 1 - θ) hθ.1 (by ring)
  convert this using 1; simp only [smul_eq_mul]; ring

/-- Upper bound for second-order differences `f(a)+f(b)-f(a')-f(b')`. -/
theorem cs_upper {f : ℝ → ℝ} {T : Set ℝ} (hT : Convex ℝ T) (hf : Differentiable ℝ f)
    (hf' : Differentiable ℝ (deriv f)) {M₁ M₂ : ℝ}
    (h1 : ∀ x ∈ T, |deriv f x| ≤ M₁) (h2 : ∀ x ∈ T, |deriv (deriv f) x| ≤ M₂)
    {a b a' b' δ : ℝ} (ha : a ∈ T) (hb : b ∈ T) (ha' : a' ∈ T) (hb' : b' ∈ T)
    (hτ : |b - a| ≤ δ) (hτ' : |b' - a'| ≤ δ) :
    |f a + f b - f a' - f b'| ≤
      M₁ * |(a + b) - (a' + b')| + M₂ * δ * |(b - a) - (b' - a')| := by
  set A : ℝ → ℝ := fun θ => a' + θ * (a - a')
  set B : ℝ → ℝ := fun θ => b' + θ * (b - b')
  have hAT : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, A θ ∈ T := fun θ hθ => cs_path_mem hT ha ha' hθ
  have hBT : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, B θ ∈ T := fun θ hθ => cs_path_mem hT hb hb' hθ
  have hder : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, HasDerivAt (fun θ => f (A θ) + f (B θ))
      (deriv f (A θ) * (a - a') + deriv f (B θ) * (b - b')) θ := by
    intro θ _
    have hA : HasDerivAt A (a - a') θ := by
      have := ((hasDerivAt_id θ).mul_const (a - a')).const_add a'
      simp only [id_eq, one_mul] at this; exact this
    have hB : HasDerivAt B (b - b') θ := by
      have := ((hasDerivAt_id θ).mul_const (b - b')).const_add b'
      simp only [id_eq, one_mul] at this; exact this
    exact ((hf (A θ)).hasDerivAt.comp θ hA).add ((hf (B θ)).hasDerivAt.comp θ hB)
  have key := cs_abs_sub_le_of_deriv hder (A := M₁ * |(a + b) - (a' + b')| +
      M₂ * δ * |(b - a) - (b' - a')|) (by
    intro θ hθ
    have hτθ : |B θ - A θ| ≤ δ := by
      have e : B θ - A θ = (1 - θ) * (b' - a') + θ * (b - a) := by simp only [A, B]; ring
      rw [e]
      calc |(1 - θ) * (b' - a') + θ * (b - a)| ≤ (1 - θ) * |b' - a'| + θ * |b - a| := by
            refine (abs_add_le _ _).trans ?_
            rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_of_nonneg (by linarith [hθ.2] : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 1 - θ),
              abs_of_nonneg hθ.1]
        _ ≤ (1 - θ) * δ + θ * δ := by
            gcongr
            · linarith [hθ.2]
            · exact hθ.1
        _ = δ := by ring
    have e : deriv f (A θ) * (a - a') + deriv f (B θ) * (b - b') =
        ((a + b) - (a' + b')) / 2 * (deriv f (A θ) + deriv f (B θ)) +
        ((b - a) - (b' - a')) / 2 * (deriv f (B θ) - deriv f (A θ)) := by ring
    rw [e]
    have l1 : |deriv f (A θ) + deriv f (B θ)| ≤ 2 * M₁ := by
      have := h1 _ (hAT θ hθ); have := h1 _ (hBT θ hθ)
      calc _ ≤ |deriv f (A θ)| + |deriv f (B θ)| := abs_add_le _ _
        _ ≤ 2 * M₁ := by linarith
    have l2 : |deriv f (B θ) - deriv f (A θ)| ≤ M₂ * δ := by
      have := cs_lipschitz_of_deriv hT hf' h2 (hBT θ hθ) (hAT θ hθ)
      have hM₂ : 0 ≤ M₂ := (abs_nonneg _).trans (h2 a ha)
      calc _ ≤ M₂ * |B θ - A θ| := this
        _ ≤ M₂ * δ := by gcongr
    calc _ ≤ |((a + b) - (a' + b')) / 2 * (deriv f (A θ) + deriv f (B θ))| +
          |((b - a) - (b' - a')) / 2 * (deriv f (B θ) - deriv f (A θ))| := abs_add_le _ _
      _ = |(a + b) - (a' + b')| / 2 * |deriv f (A θ) + deriv f (B θ)| +
          |(b - a) - (b' - a')| / 2 * |deriv f (B θ) - deriv f (A θ)| := by
          rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_div, abs_div, abs_two]
      _ ≤ |(a + b) - (a' + b')| / 2 * (2 * M₁) + |(b - a) - (b' - a')| / 2 * (M₂ * δ) := by
          gcongr
      _ ≤ _ := by
          have : 0 ≤ |(b - a) - (b' - a')| * (M₂ * δ) := by
            have hM₂ : 0 ≤ M₂ := (abs_nonneg _).trans (h2 a ha)
            have : 0 ≤ δ := (abs_nonneg _).trans hτ
            positivity
          nlinarith)
  have eA1 : A 1 = a := by simp [A]
  have eA0 : A 0 = a' := by simp [A]
  have eB1 : B 1 = b := by simp [B]
  have eB0 : B 0 = b' := by simp [B]
  simp only [eA1, eA0, eB1, eB0] at key
  calc _ = |f a + f b - (f a' + f b')| := by ring_nf
    _ ≤ _ := key


theorem cs_lipschitz_of_hasDerivAt {f f' : ℝ → ℝ} {T : Set ℝ} (hT : Convex ℝ T)
    (hf : ∀ x, HasDerivAt f (f' x) x) {M : ℝ} (hM : ∀ x ∈ T, |f' x| ≤ M) {x y : ℝ}
    (hx : x ∈ T) (hy : y ∈ T) : |f x - f y| ≤ M * |x - y| := by
  have := hT.norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_hasDerivWithin_le (f := f) (f' := f')
    (fun z _ => (hf z).hasDerivWithinAt)
    (fun z hz => by rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]; exact hM z hz) hy hx
  simpa [Real.norm_eq_abs] using this

theorem cs_sign_const {d : ℝ → ℝ} (hd : ContinuousOn d (Icc 0 1))
    (hpos : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, d θ ≠ 0) :
    ∃ ε : ℝ, |ε| = 1 ∧ ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, 0 < ε * d θ := by
  have h0 := hpos 0 (by simp)
  rcases lt_or_gt_of_ne h0 with h0 | h0
  · refine ⟨-1, by simp, fun θ hθ => ?_⟩
    by_contra hcon
    have hθd : 0 ≤ d θ := by linarith
    obtain ⟨t, ht, hdt⟩ := intermediate_value_Icc hθ.1 (hd.mono (Icc_subset_Icc le_rfl hθ.2))
      ⟨h0.le, hθd⟩
    exact hpos t ⟨ht.1, ht.2.trans hθ.2⟩ hdt
  · refine ⟨1, by simp, fun θ hθ => ?_⟩
    by_contra hcon
    have hθd : d θ ≤ 0 := by linarith
    obtain ⟨t, ht, hdt⟩ := intermediate_value_Icc' hθ.1 (hd.mono (Icc_subset_Icc le_rfl hθ.2))
      ⟨hθd, h0.le⟩
    exact hpos t ⟨ht.1, ht.2.trans hθ.2⟩ hdt

theorem cs_exists_sign (x : ℝ) : ∃ η : ℝ, |η| = 1 ∧ η * x = |x| := by
  rcases le_or_gt 0 x with h | h
  · exact ⟨1, by simp, by rw [abs_of_nonneg h]; ring⟩
  · exact ⟨-1, by simp, by rw [abs_of_neg h]; ring⟩

theorem cs_abs_lin_le {e₁ e₂ x y M : ℝ} (h₁ : |e₁| ≤ M) (h₂ : |e₂| ≤ M) :
    |e₁ * x + e₂ * y| ≤ M * (|x| + |y|) := by
  calc _ ≤ |e₁ * x| + |e₂ * y| := abs_add_le _ _
    _ = |e₁| * |x| + |e₂| * |y| := by rw [abs_mul, abs_mul]
    _ ≤ M * |x| + M * |y| := by gcongr
    _ = _ := by ring

/-- The **geometric lower bound**: for points on a short interval where the nondegeneracy
condition `c |s - t| ≤ |φ₂ s φ₁ t - φ₂ t φ₁ s|` holds (with `φ₁ = φ₀'`, `φ₂ = φ₁'`), the
differences of `φ₀` and `φ₁` at `(a, b)` and `(a', b')` control `|Δσ| + δ |Δτ|`. -/
theorem cs_geom_lower {φ₀ φ₁ φ₂ φ₃ : ℝ → ℝ} (h₀ : ∀ x, HasDerivAt φ₀ (φ₁ x) x)
    (h₁ : ∀ x, HasDerivAt φ₁ (φ₂ x) x) (h₂ : ∀ x, HasDerivAt φ₂ (φ₃ x) x)
    {T : Set ℝ} (hT : Convex ℝ T)
    {M c E₀ ℓ : ℝ} (hM : 0 < M) (hc : 0 < c)
    (hM1 : ∀ x ∈ T, |φ₁ x| ≤ M) (hM2 : ∀ x ∈ T, |φ₂ x| ≤ M) (hM3 : ∀ x ∈ T, |φ₃ x| ≤ M)
    (hND : ∀ s ∈ T, ∀ t ∈ T, c * |s - t| ≤ |φ₂ s * φ₁ t - φ₂ t * φ₁ s|)
    (hE : ∀ s ∈ T, E₀ ≤ φ₁ s ^ 2 + φ₂ s ^ 2)
    (hdiam : ∀ x ∈ T, ∀ y ∈ T, |x - y| ≤ ℓ)
    (hℓ1 : 4 * M ^ 2 * ℓ ≤ E₀) (hℓ2 : 4 * M ^ 2 * ℓ ≤ c) (hℓ3 : 128 * M ^ 4 * ℓ ≤ c * E₀)
    {a b a' b' δ : ℝ} (ha : a ∈ T) (hb : b ∈ T) (ha' : a' ∈ T) (hb' : b' ∈ T)
    (hδ1 : δ / 2 ≤ |b - a|) (hδ2 : |b - a| ≤ δ) (hδ1' : δ / 2 ≤ |b' - a'|)
    (hδ2' : |b' - a'| ≤ δ) (hsign : 0 < (b - a) * (b' - a')) :
    min (E₀ / 4) (M ^ 2) / ((1 + 16 * M ^ 2 / c) * M) *
        (|(a + b) - (a' + b')| + δ * |(b - a) - (b' - a')|) ≤
      |φ₀ a + φ₀ b - φ₀ a' - φ₀ b'| + |φ₁ a + φ₁ b - φ₁ a' - φ₁ b'| := by
  have hδ : 0 < δ := by
    rcases mul_pos_iff.mp hsign with h | h
    · have : 0 < |b - a| := abs_pos.mpr h.1.ne'; linarith
    · have : 0 < |b - a| := abs_pos.mpr h.1.ne; linarith
  have hℓ0 : 0 ≤ ℓ := (abs_nonneg _).trans (hdiam a ha a ha)
  obtain ⟨e₁, he₁d⟩ : ∃ e, e = φ₁ a := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨e₂, he₂d⟩ : ∃ e, e = φ₂ a := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have he₁ : |e₁| ≤ M := he₁d ▸ hM1 a ha
  have he₂ : |e₂| ≤ M := he₂d ▸ hM2 a ha
  have hEa : E₀ ≤ e₁ ^ 2 + e₂ ^ 2 := he₁d ▸ he₂d ▸ hE a ha
  obtain ⟨A, hAe⟩ : ∃ A : ℝ → ℝ, ∀ θ, A θ = a' + θ * (a - a') := ⟨_, fun _ => rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨B, hBe⟩ : ∃ B : ℝ → ℝ, ∀ θ, B θ = b' + θ * (b - b') := ⟨_, fun _ => rfl⟩
  have hAT : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, A θ ∈ T := fun θ hθ => hAe θ ▸ cs_path_mem hT ha ha' hθ
  have hBT : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, B θ ∈ T := fun θ hθ => hBe θ ▸ cs_path_mem hT hb hb' hθ
  have hAd : ∀ θ, HasDerivAt A (a - a') θ := fun θ => by
    rw [show A = fun θ => a' + θ * (a - a') from funext hAe]
    have := ((hasDerivAt_id θ).mul_const (a - a')).const_add a'
    simp only [id_eq, one_mul] at this; exact this
  have hBd : ∀ θ, HasDerivAt B (b - b') θ := fun θ => by
    rw [show B = fun θ => b' + θ * (b - b') from funext hBe]
    have := ((hasDerivAt_id θ).mul_const (b - b')).const_add b'
    simp only [id_eq, one_mul] at this; exact this
  have hAc : Continuous A := (show Differentiable ℝ A from fun θ =>
    (hAd θ).differentiableAt).continuous
  have hBc : Continuous B := (show Differentiable ℝ B from fun θ =>
    (hBd θ).differentiableAt).continuous
  have hφ1c : Continuous φ₁ := (show Differentiable ℝ φ₁ from fun x =>
    (h₁ x).differentiableAt).continuous
  have hφ2c : Continuous φ₂ := (show Differentiable ℝ φ₂ from fun x =>
    (h₂ x).differentiableAt).continuous
  have lip1 : ∀ x ∈ T, ∀ y ∈ T, |φ₁ x - φ₁ y| ≤ M * |x - y| := fun x hx y hy =>
    cs_lipschitz_of_hasDerivAt hT h₁ hM2 hx hy
  have lip2 : ∀ x ∈ T, ∀ y ∈ T, |φ₂ x - φ₂ y| ≤ M * |x - y| := fun x hx y hy =>
    cs_lipschitz_of_hasDerivAt hT h₂ hM3 hx hy
  -- the width `τ_θ = B θ - A θ`
  have hτθ : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, δ / 2 ≤ |B θ - A θ| ∧ |B θ - A θ| ≤ δ := by
    intro θ hθ
    have e : B θ - A θ = (1 - θ) * (b' - a') + θ * (b - a) := by rw [hAe, hBe]; ring
    rw [e]
    have h1θ : 0 ≤ 1 - θ := by linarith [hθ.2]
    rcases mul_pos_iff.mp hsign with h | h
    · rw [abs_of_pos h.1] at hδ1 hδ2; rw [abs_of_pos h.2] at hδ1' hδ2'
      rw [abs_of_nonneg (add_nonneg (mul_nonneg h1θ h.2.le) (mul_nonneg hθ.1 h.1.le))]
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hδ1' h1θ
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hδ1 hθ.1
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hδ2' h1θ
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hδ2 hθ.1
      constructor <;> linarith
    · rw [abs_of_neg h.1] at hδ1 hδ2; rw [abs_of_neg h.2] at hδ1' hδ2'
      rw [abs_of_nonpos (add_nonpos (mul_nonpos_of_nonneg_of_nonpos h1θ h.2.le)
        (mul_nonpos_of_nonneg_of_nonpos hθ.1 h.1.le))]
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hδ1' h1θ
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hδ1 hθ.1
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hδ2' h1θ
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hδ2 hθ.1
      constructor <;> linarith
  -- the determinant along the path
  obtain ⟨d, hde⟩ : ∃ d : ℝ → ℝ, ∀ θ, d θ = φ₁ (A θ) * φ₂ (B θ) - φ₂ (A θ) * φ₁ (B θ) :=
    ⟨_, fun _ => rfl⟩
  have hdlow : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, c * |B θ - A θ| ≤ |d θ| := by
    intro θ hθ
    have := hND (A θ) (hAT θ hθ) (B θ) (hBT θ hθ)
    rw [abs_sub_comm (A θ)] at this
    calc _ ≤ _ := this
      _ = |d θ| := by rw [← abs_neg, hde]; ring_nf
  have hdne : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, d θ ≠ 0 := fun θ hθ => by
    have h1 := hdlow θ hθ
    have h2 : 0 < c * |B θ - A θ| := mul_pos hc (by linarith [(hτθ θ hθ).1])
    intro h; rw [h, abs_zero] at h1; linarith
  have hdcont : ContinuousOn d (Icc 0 1) := by
    rw [show d = fun θ => φ₁ (A θ) * φ₂ (B θ) - φ₂ (A θ) * φ₁ (B θ) from funext hde]
    exact (by fun_prop : Continuous fun θ => φ₁ (A θ) * φ₂ (B θ) - φ₂ (A θ) * φ₁ (B θ)).continuousOn
  obtain ⟨ε, hε, hεd⟩ := cs_sign_const hdcont hdne
  obtain ⟨Δσ, hΔσ⟩ : ∃ x, x = (a + b) - (a' + b') := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨Δτ, hΔτ⟩ : ∃ x, x = (b - a) - (b' - a') := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  -- the function `f₂ = e₁ h₂ - e₂ h₁` and its derivative
  have hg₂ : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, HasDerivAt
      (fun θ => e₁ * (φ₁ (A θ) + φ₁ (B θ)) - e₂ * (φ₀ (A θ) + φ₀ (B θ)))
      ((a - a') * (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) +
        (b - b') * (e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ))) θ := by
    intro θ _
    have h1 := (h₁ (A θ)).comp θ (hAd θ)
    have h2 := (h₁ (B θ)).comp θ (hBd θ)
    have h3 := (h₀ (A θ)).comp θ (hAd θ)
    have h4 := (h₀ (B θ)).comp θ (hBd θ)
    exact (((h1.add h2).const_mul e₁).sub ((h3.add h4).const_mul e₂)).congr_deriv (by ring)
  obtain ⟨η, hη, hηΔ⟩ := cs_exists_sign Δτ
  have hg₂low : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1,
      c * δ * |Δτ| / 8 - 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ * |Δσ| ≤ ε * η * ((a - a') *
        (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) + (b - b') * (e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ))) := by
    intro θ hθ
    have hA := hAT θ hθ
    have hB := hBT θ hθ
    have hNbd : ∀ x ∈ T, |e₁ * φ₂ x - e₂ * φ₁ x| ≤ 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ := by
      intro x hx
      have e : e₁ * φ₂ x - e₂ * φ₁ x = e₁ * (φ₂ x - φ₂ a) + (-e₂) * (φ₁ x - φ₁ a) := by
        rw [he₁d, he₂d]; ring
      rw [e]
      have l1 := (lip2 x hx a ha).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hdiam x hx a ha) hM.le)
      have l2 := (lip1 x hx a ha).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hdiam x hx a ha) hM.le)
      have := cs_abs_lin_le (x := φ₂ x - φ₂ a) (y := φ₁ x - φ₁ a) he₁ (by rwa [abs_neg])
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (add_le_add l1 l2) hM.le
      linarith
    have hNdiff : |(e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ)) - (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) - d θ| ≤
        2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ * |B θ - A θ| := by
      have e : (e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ)) - (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) - d θ =
          (e₁ - φ₁ (A θ)) * (φ₂ (B θ) - φ₂ (A θ)) +
            (-(e₂ - φ₂ (A θ))) * (φ₁ (B θ) - φ₁ (A θ)) := by rw [hde]; ring
      rw [e]
      have l1 : |e₁ - φ₁ (A θ)| ≤ M * ℓ := he₁d ▸
        (lip1 a ha (A θ) hA).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hdiam a ha (A θ) hA) hM.le)
      have l2 : |-(e₂ - φ₂ (A θ))| ≤ M * ℓ := by
        rw [abs_neg, he₂d]
        exact (lip2 a ha (A θ) hA).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hdiam a ha (A θ) hA) hM.le)
      have l3 := lip2 (B θ) hB (A θ) hA
      have l4 := lip1 (B θ) hB (A θ) hA
      calc _ ≤ |(e₁ - φ₁ (A θ)) * (φ₂ (B θ) - φ₂ (A θ))| +
            |(-(e₂ - φ₂ (A θ))) * (φ₁ (B θ) - φ₁ (A θ))| := abs_add_le _ _
        _ = |e₁ - φ₁ (A θ)| * |φ₂ (B θ) - φ₂ (A θ)| +
            |-(e₂ - φ₂ (A θ))| * |φ₁ (B θ) - φ₁ (A θ)| := by rw [abs_mul, abs_mul]
        _ ≤ (M * ℓ) * (M * |B θ - A θ|) + (M * ℓ) * (M * |B θ - A θ|) := by
            gcongr
        _ = _ := by ring
    have hτ := hτθ θ hθ
    have hdl := hdlow θ hθ
    have hεdθ := hεd θ hθ
    have hεabs : ε * d θ = |d θ| := by
      rw [← abs_of_pos hεdθ, abs_mul, hε, one_mul]
    have hmain : |d θ| / 2 ≤ ε * ((e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ)) -
        (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ))) := by
      have hx : |ε * ((e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ)) - (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) -
          d θ)| ≤ 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ * |B θ - A θ| := by rw [abs_mul, hε, one_mul]; exact hNdiff
      have h1 := (abs_le.mp hx).1
      have h2 : 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ * |B θ - A θ| ≤ c / 2 * |B θ - A θ| := by
        gcongr; linarith
      linarith
    have e : ε * η * ((a - a') * (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) +
        (b - b') * (e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ))) =
        ε * η * (Δσ / 2) * ((e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) +
        (e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ))) + (η * Δτ) / 2 * (ε * ((e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) -
        e₂ * φ₁ (B θ)) - (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)))) := by
      rw [hΔσ, hΔτ]; ring
    rw [e, hηΔ]
    have hsum : |ε * η * (Δσ / 2) * ((e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) +
        (e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ)))| ≤ 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ * |Δσ| := by
      rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_mul, hε, hη, abs_div, abs_two]
      have h1 := hNbd _ hA; have h2 := hNbd _ hB
      have : |(e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)) + (e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ))| ≤
          4 * M ^ 2 * ℓ := (abs_add_le _ _).trans (by linarith)
      calc _ ≤ 1 * 1 * (|Δσ| / 2) * (4 * M ^ 2 * ℓ) := by gcongr
        _ = _ := by ring
    have hlow2 : c * δ / 4 ≤ |d θ| / 2 := by
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hτ.1 hc.le
      linarith
    have h3 : |Δτ| / 2 * (c * δ / 4) ≤ |Δτ| / 2 * (ε * ((e₁ * φ₂ (B θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (B θ)) -
        (e₁ * φ₂ (A θ) - e₂ * φ₁ (A θ)))) := by
      gcongr; exact hlow2.trans hmain
    linarith [(abs_le.mp hsum).1]
  have hf₂ := cs_le_sub_of_deriv (fun θ hθ => (hg₂ θ hθ).const_mul (ε * η)) hg₂low
  -- the function `f₁ = e₁ h₁ + e₂ h₂` and its derivative
  have hg₁ : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, HasDerivAt
      (fun θ => e₁ * (φ₀ (A θ) + φ₀ (B θ)) + e₂ * (φ₁ (A θ) + φ₁ (B θ)))
      ((a - a') * (e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ)) +
        (b - b') * (e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (B θ))) θ := by
    intro θ _
    have h1 := (h₁ (A θ)).comp θ (hAd θ)
    have h2 := (h₁ (B θ)).comp θ (hBd θ)
    have h3 := (h₀ (A θ)).comp θ (hAd θ)
    have h4 := (h₀ (B θ)).comp θ (hBd θ)
    exact (((h3.add h4).const_mul e₁).add ((h1.add h2).const_mul e₂)).congr_deriv (by ring)
  obtain ⟨η', hη', hηΔ'⟩ := cs_exists_sign Δσ
  have hg₁low : ∀ θ ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, E₀ / 2 * |Δσ| - M ^ 2 * δ * |Δτ| ≤
      η' * ((a - a') * (e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ)) +
        (b - b') * (e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (B θ))) := by
    intro θ hθ
    have hA := hAT θ hθ
    have hB := hBT θ hθ
    have hPlow : ∀ x ∈ T, E₀ - 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ ≤ e₁ * φ₁ x + e₂ * φ₂ x := by
      intro x hx
      have e : e₁ * φ₁ x + e₂ * φ₂ x = (e₁ ^ 2 + e₂ ^ 2) + (e₁ * (φ₁ x - φ₁ a) +
          e₂ * (φ₂ x - φ₂ a)) := by rw [he₁d, he₂d]; ring
      rw [e]
      have l1 := (lip1 x hx a ha).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hdiam x hx a ha) hM.le)
      have l2 := (lip2 x hx a ha).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hdiam x hx a ha) hM.le)
      have := cs_abs_lin_le (x := φ₁ x - φ₁ a) (y := φ₂ x - φ₂ a) he₁ he₂
      have : |e₁ * (φ₁ x - φ₁ a) + e₂ * (φ₂ x - φ₂ a)| ≤ 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ := by
        have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (add_le_add l1 l2) hM.le
        linarith
      linarith [(abs_le.mp this).1]
    have hPdiff : |(e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (B θ)) - (e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ))| ≤
        2 * M ^ 2 * δ := by
      have e : (e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (B θ)) - (e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ)) =
          e₁ * (φ₁ (B θ) - φ₁ (A θ)) + e₂ * (φ₂ (B θ) - φ₂ (A θ)) := by ring
      rw [e]
      have hτ := (hτθ θ hθ).2
      have l1 := (lip1 (B θ) hB (A θ) hA).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hτ hM.le)
      have l2 := (lip2 (B θ) hB (A θ) hA).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hτ hM.le)
      have := cs_abs_lin_le (x := φ₁ (B θ) - φ₁ (A θ)) (y := φ₂ (B θ) - φ₂ (A θ)) he₁ he₂
      have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (add_le_add l1 l2) hM.le
      linarith
    have e : η' * ((a - a') * (e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ)) +
        (b - b') * (e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (B θ))) =
        (η' * Δσ) / 2 * ((e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ)) +
        (e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (B θ))) + η' * (Δτ / 2) * ((e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) +
        e₂ * φ₂ (B θ)) - (e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ))) := by
      rw [hΔσ, hΔτ]; ring
    rw [e, hηΔ']
    have h1 := hPlow _ hA; have h2 := hPlow _ hB
    have hrest : |η' * (Δτ / 2) * ((e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (B θ)) -
        (e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ)))| ≤ M ^ 2 * δ * |Δτ| := by
      rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, hη', abs_div, abs_two]
      calc _ ≤ 1 * (|Δτ| / 2) * (2 * M ^ 2 * δ) := by gcongr
        _ = _ := by ring
    have h3 : |Δσ| / 2 * (2 * (E₀ / 2)) ≤ |Δσ| / 2 * ((e₁ * φ₁ (A θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (A θ)) +
        (e₁ * φ₁ (B θ) + e₂ * φ₂ (B θ))) := by gcongr; linarith
    linarith [(abs_le.mp hrest).1]
  have hf₁ := cs_le_sub_of_deriv (fun θ hθ => (hg₁ θ hθ).const_mul η') hg₁low
  -- evaluate the endpoints
  have hA1 : A 1 = a := by rw [hAe]; ring
  have hA0 : A 0 = a' := by rw [hAe]; ring
  have hB1 : B 1 = b := by rw [hBe]; ring
  have hB0 : B 0 = b' := by rw [hBe]; ring
  simp only [hA1, hA0, hB1, hB0] at hf₁ hf₂
  obtain ⟨F₀, hF₀⟩ : ∃ x, x = φ₀ a + φ₀ b - φ₀ a' - φ₀ b' := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨F₁, hF₁⟩ : ∃ x, x = φ₁ a + φ₁ b - φ₁ a' - φ₁ b' := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hf₂' : c * δ * |Δτ| / 8 - 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ * |Δσ| ≤ ε * η * (e₁ * F₁ + -e₂ * F₀) := by
    rw [hF₀, hF₁]; linarith [hf₂]
  have hf₁' : E₀ / 2 * |Δσ| - M ^ 2 * δ * |Δτ| ≤ η' * (e₁ * F₀ + e₂ * F₁) := by
    rw [hF₀, hF₁]; linarith [hf₁]
  clear hf₁ hf₂
  rw [← hF₀, ← hF₁, ← hΔσ, ← hΔτ]
  have hX1 := cs_abs_lin_le (x := F₀) (y := F₁) he₁ he₂
  have hX2 := cs_abs_lin_le (x := F₁) (y := F₀) he₁ (by rwa [abs_neg] : |-e₂| ≤ M)
  have hX1' : η' * (e₁ * F₀ + e₂ * F₁) ≤ M * (|F₀| + |F₁|) := by
    have := le_abs_self (η' * (e₁ * F₀ + e₂ * F₁))
    rw [abs_mul, hη', one_mul] at this; linarith
  have hX2' : ε * η * (e₁ * F₁ + -e₂ * F₀) ≤ M * (|F₀| + |F₁|) := by
    have := le_abs_self (ε * η * (e₁ * F₁ + -e₂ * F₀))
    rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, hη, hε, one_mul, one_mul] at this; linarith
  -- combine the two lower bounds
  obtain ⟨K, hK⟩ : ∃ K : ℝ, K = 16 * M ^ 2 / c := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hK0 : 0 ≤ K := by rw [hK]; positivity
  have hKc : K * c = 16 * M ^ 2 := by rw [hK]; field_simp
  have hK2 : K * (2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ) ≤ E₀ / 4 := by
    rw [hK, div_mul_eq_mul_div, div_le_iff₀ hc]; linarith
  have hA0' : 0 ≤ |Δσ| := abs_nonneg _
  have hB0' : 0 ≤ δ * |Δτ| := by positivity
  have h1 : E₀ / 2 * |Δσ| - M ^ 2 * δ * |Δτ| ≤ M * (|F₀| + |F₁|) := by linarith
  have h2 : c * δ * |Δτ| / 8 - 2 * M ^ 2 * ℓ * |Δσ| ≤ M * (|F₀| + |F₁|) := by linarith
  have h2' := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h2 hK0
  have hKc' : K * c * (δ * |Δτ|) = 16 * M ^ 2 * (δ * |Δτ|) := by rw [hKc]
  have hK2' := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hK2 hA0'
  have hm1 := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (min_le_left (E₀ / 4) (M ^ 2)) hA0'
  have hm2 := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (min_le_right (E₀ / 4) (M ^ 2)) hB0'
  have hcomb : min (E₀ / 4) (M ^ 2) * (|Δσ| + δ * |Δτ|) ≤ (1 + K) * M * (|F₀| + |F₁|) := by
    linarith
  have hpos : 0 < (1 + K) * M := by positivity
  rw [← hK, div_mul_eq_mul_div, div_le_iff₀ hpos]
  linarith


/-! ### Measure-theoretic tools: `TT*`, Schur's test and elementary integrals -/

/-- The `TT*` identity, in the form of an inequality for the squared `L²` norm. -/
theorem cs_TTstar {Z W : Type*} [MeasurableSpace Z] [MeasurableSpace W] {ρ : Measure Z}
    {ν : Measure W} [SFinite ρ] [SFinite ν] (f : Z → W → ℂ)
    (hint : Integrable (fun q : Z × (W × W) => f q.1 q.2.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (f q.1 q.2.2))
      (ρ.prod (ν.prod ν))) :
    ∫⁻ z, ‖∫ w, f z w ∂ν‖ₑ ^ 2 ∂ρ ≤
      ∫⁻ p : W × W, ‖∫ z, f z p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (f z p.2) ∂ρ‖ₑ ∂(ν.prod ν) := by
  have hH : ∀ z, ∫ p : W × W, f z p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (f z p.2) ∂(ν.prod ν) =
      ((‖∫ w, f z w ∂ν‖ ^ 2 : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
    intro z
    rw [integral_prod_mul (f := f z) (g := fun w => (starRingEnd ℂ) (f z w)), integral_conj,
      Complex.mul_conj, Complex.normSq_eq_norm_sq]
  have hHint := hint.integral_prod_left
  have hhint : Integrable (fun z => ‖∫ w, f z w ∂ν‖ ^ 2) ρ := by
    refine hHint.norm.congr (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)
    simp only
    rw [hH z, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
  calc ∫⁻ z, ‖∫ w, f z w ∂ν‖ₑ ^ 2 ∂ρ = ∫⁻ z, ENNReal.ofReal (‖∫ w, f z w ∂ν‖ ^ 2) ∂ρ := by
        congr 1; funext z; rw [ENNReal.ofReal_pow (norm_nonneg _), ofReal_norm]
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (∫ z, ‖∫ w, f z w ∂ν‖ ^ 2 ∂ρ) :=
        (ofReal_integral_eq_lintegral_ofReal hhint
          (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun _ => by positivity)).symm
    _ = ‖∫ z, ∫ p : W × W, f z p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (f z p.2) ∂(ν.prod ν) ∂ρ‖ₑ := by
        simp_rw [hH]
        rw [integral_complex_ofReal, ← ofReal_norm, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs,
          abs_of_nonneg (integral_nonneg fun _ => by positivity)]
    _ = ‖∫ p : W × W, ∫ z, f z p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (f z p.2) ∂ρ ∂(ν.prod ν)‖ₑ := by
        rw [integral_integral_swap (f := fun z (p : W × W) =>
          f z p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (f z p.2)) hint]
    _ ≤ _ := enorm_integral_le_lintegral_enorm _

theorem cs_amgm (x y : ℝ≥0∞) : x * y ≤ x ^ 2 + y ^ 2 := by
  rcases le_total x y with hxy | hxy
  · calc x * y ≤ y * y := by gcongr
      _ = y ^ 2 := (sq y).symm
      _ ≤ x ^ 2 + y ^ 2 := le_add_self
  · calc x * y ≤ x * x := by gcongr
      _ = x ^ 2 := (sq x).symm
      _ ≤ x ^ 2 + y ^ 2 := le_self_add

/-- **Schur's test** for a symmetric kernel. -/
theorem cs_schur {W : Type*} [MeasurableSpace W] {ν : Measure W} [SFinite ν]
    {h : W → ℝ≥0∞} (hh : Measurable h) {κ : W → W → ℝ≥0∞}
    (hκ : Measurable (Function.uncurry κ)) (hsym : ∀ w w', κ w w' = κ w' w) {A : ℝ≥0∞}
    (hA : ∀ w, ∫⁻ w', κ w w' ∂ν ≤ A) :
    ∫⁻ p : W × W, h p.1 * h p.2 * κ p.1 p.2 ∂(ν.prod ν) ≤ 2 * A * ∫⁻ w, h w ^ 2 ∂ν := by
  have hm1 : Measurable (fun p : W × W => h p.1 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2) :=
    ((hh.comp measurable_fst).pow_const 2).mul hκ
  have hm2 : Measurable (fun p : W × W => h p.2 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2) :=
    ((hh.comp measurable_snd).pow_const 2).mul hκ
  have h1 : ∫⁻ p : W × W, h p.1 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2 ∂(ν.prod ν) ≤ A * ∫⁻ w, h w ^ 2 ∂ν := by
    rw [lintegral_prod _ hm1.aemeasurable]
    calc ∫⁻ x, ∫⁻ y, h (x, y).1 ^ 2 * κ (x, y).1 (x, y).2 ∂ν ∂ν =
          ∫⁻ x, h x ^ 2 * ∫⁻ y, κ x y ∂ν ∂ν := by
          congr 1; funext x
          dsimp only
          exact lintegral_const_mul _ (show Measurable fun y => κ x y from
            hκ.comp measurable_prodMk_left)
      _ ≤ ∫⁻ x, h x ^ 2 * A ∂ν := lintegral_mono fun x => by gcongr; exact hA x
      _ = A * ∫⁻ w, h w ^ 2 ∂ν := by rw [lintegral_mul_const _ (hh.pow_const 2), mul_comm]
  have h2 : ∫⁻ p : W × W, h p.2 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2 ∂(ν.prod ν) =
      ∫⁻ p : W × W, h p.1 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2 ∂(ν.prod ν) := by
    rw [← lintegral_prod_swap]
    congr 1; funext p; simp [Prod.swap, hsym p.1 p.2]
  calc ∫⁻ p : W × W, h p.1 * h p.2 * κ p.1 p.2 ∂(ν.prod ν) ≤
        ∫⁻ p : W × W, (h p.1 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2 + h p.2 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2) ∂(ν.prod ν) :=
        lintegral_mono fun p => by rw [← add_mul]; gcongr; exact cs_amgm _ _
    _ = ∫⁻ p : W × W, h p.1 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2 ∂(ν.prod ν) +
          ∫⁻ p : W × W, h p.2 ^ 2 * κ p.1 p.2 ∂(ν.prod ν) := lintegral_add_left hm1 _
    _ ≤ A * ∫⁻ w, h w ^ 2 ∂ν + A * ∫⁻ w, h w ^ 2 ∂ν := by rw [h2]; gcongr
    _ = 2 * A * ∫⁻ w, h w ^ 2 ∂ν := by ring

theorem cs_set_abs_sub_le (x δ : ℝ) :
    {y : ℝ | |x - y| ≤ δ} = Icc (x - δ) (x + δ) := by
  ext y; simp only [mem_ofPred_eq, mem_Icc, abs_le]; constructor <;> intro h <;> constructor <;>
    linarith [h.1, h.2]

/-- The `L²` norm of `g ⊗ g` near the diagonal. -/
theorem cs_diag_bound {g : ℝ → ℂ} (hg : Measurable g) (δ : ℝ) :
    ∫⁻ w : ℝ × ℝ, {w : ℝ × ℝ | |w.1 - w.2| ≤ δ}.indicator
        (fun w => ‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 2 * ‖g w.2‖ₑ ^ 2) w ≤
      2 * ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ) * ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 4 := by
  set S : Set (ℝ × ℝ) := {w : ℝ × ℝ | |w.1 - w.2| ≤ δ}
  have hS : MeasurableSet S :=
    measurableSet_le (continuous_abs.comp (continuous_fst.sub continuous_snd)).measurable
      measurable_const
  have hgm : Measurable fun y => ‖g y‖ₑ := hg.enorm
  have hm1 : Measurable (S.indicator fun w : ℝ × ℝ => ‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 4) :=
    ((hgm.comp measurable_fst).pow_const 4).indicator hS
  have hm2 : Measurable (S.indicator fun w : ℝ × ℝ => ‖g w.2‖ₑ ^ 4) :=
    ((hgm.comp measurable_snd).pow_const 4).indicator hS
  have hfirst : ∫⁻ w : ℝ × ℝ, S.indicator (fun w => ‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 4) w =
      ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ) * ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 4 := by
    rw [Measure.volume_eq_prod, lintegral_prod _ hm1.aemeasurable]
    have : ∀ x : ℝ, ∫⁻ y, S.indicator (fun w : ℝ × ℝ => ‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 4) (x, y) =
        ‖g x‖ₑ ^ 4 * ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ) := by
      intro x
      have e : (fun y => S.indicator (fun w : ℝ × ℝ => ‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 4) (x, y)) =
          {y : ℝ | |x - y| ≤ δ}.indicator (fun _ => ‖g x‖ₑ ^ 4) := by
        funext y; simp [S, Set.indicator]
      have hmx : MeasurableSet {y : ℝ | |x - y| ≤ δ} := by
        rw [cs_set_abs_sub_le]; exact measurableSet_Icc
      rw [e, lintegral_indicator_const hmx, cs_set_abs_sub_le, Real.volume_Icc]
      congr 2; ring
    simp_rw [this]
    rw [lintegral_mul_const _ (hgm.pow_const 4), mul_comm]
  have hsecond : ∫⁻ w : ℝ × ℝ, S.indicator (fun w => ‖g w.2‖ₑ ^ 4) w =
      ∫⁻ w : ℝ × ℝ, S.indicator (fun w => ‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 4) w := by
    rw [Measure.volume_eq_prod, ← lintegral_prod_swap]
    congr 1; funext w
    simp only [S, Set.indicator, mem_ofPred_eq, Prod.fst_swap, Prod.snd_swap, abs_sub_comm]
  calc ∫⁻ w : ℝ × ℝ, S.indicator (fun w => ‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 2 * ‖g w.2‖ₑ ^ 2) w ≤
        ∫⁻ w : ℝ × ℝ, (S.indicator (fun w => ‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 4) w +
          S.indicator (fun w => ‖g w.2‖ₑ ^ 4) w) := by
        refine lintegral_mono fun w => ?_
        by_cases hw : w ∈ S
        · simp only [Set.indicator_of_mem hw]
          have := cs_amgm (‖g w.1‖ₑ ^ 2) (‖g w.2‖ₑ ^ 2)
          rw [← pow_mul, ← pow_mul] at this; exact this
        · simp [Set.indicator_of_notMem hw]
    _ = 2 * ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ) * ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 4 := by
        rw [lintegral_add_left hm1, hsecond, hfirst]; ring

theorem cs_integral_inv_one_add_sq {β : ℝ} (hβ : 0 < β) (c : ℝ) :
    ∫ v : ℝ, (1 + (β * (v - c)) ^ 2)⁻¹ = Real.pi / β := by
  rw [integral_sub_right_eq_self (fun v => (1 + (β * v) ^ 2)⁻¹) c,
    Measure.integral_comp_mul_left (fun v => (1 + v ^ 2)⁻¹) β, integral_univ_inv_one_add_sq,
    abs_inv, abs_of_pos hβ, smul_eq_mul]
  ring

theorem cs_integrable_inv_one_add_sq {β : ℝ} (hβ : 0 < β) (c : ℝ) :
    Integrable (fun v : ℝ => (1 + (β * (v - c)) ^ 2)⁻¹) :=
  (integrable_inv_one_add_sq.comp_mul_left' hβ.ne').comp_sub_right c

theorem cs_lintegral_inv_one_add_sq {β : ℝ} (hβ : 0 < β) (c : ℝ) :
    ∫⁻ v : ℝ, ENNReal.ofReal ((1 + (β * (v - c)) ^ 2)⁻¹) = ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / β) := by
  rw [← cs_integral_inv_one_add_sq hβ c, ofReal_integral_eq_lintegral_ofReal
    (cs_integrable_inv_one_add_sq hβ c) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun _ => by positivity)]

/-- The Schur integral of the anisotropic kernel. -/
theorem cs_aniso_integral {lam δ : ℝ} (hl : 0 < lam) (hδ : 0 < δ) (w : ℝ × ℝ) :
    ∫⁻ w' : ℝ × ℝ, ENNReal.ofReal ((1 + (lam * ((w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹ *
      (1 + (lam * δ * ((w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹) =
    ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / lam) * ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / (2 * lam * δ)) := by
  set σ := w.1 + w.2
  set τ := w.1 - w.2
  set f : ℝ → ℝ≥0∞ := fun t => ENNReal.ofReal ((1 + (lam * t) ^ 2)⁻¹) with hf
  set h : ℝ → ℝ≥0∞ := fun t => ENNReal.ofReal ((1 + (lam * δ * t) ^ 2)⁻¹) with hh
  have hfm : Measurable f := ENNReal.measurable_ofReal.comp (by fun_prop)
  have hhm : Measurable h := ENNReal.measurable_ofReal.comp (by fun_prop)
  have e1 : ∀ w' : ℝ × ℝ, ENNReal.ofReal ((1 + (lam * (σ - (w'.1 + w'.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹ *
      (1 + (lam * δ * (τ - (w'.1 - w'.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹) =
      f (σ - w'.1 - w'.2) * h (τ - w'.1 + w'.2) := by
    intro w'
    rw [ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity)]
    simp only [hf, hh]; congr 3 <;> ring
  simp_rw [e1]
  rw [Measure.volume_eq_prod, lintegral_prod _ (by
    exact ((hfm.comp (by fun_prop)).mul (hhm.comp (by fun_prop))).aemeasurable)]
  have e2 : ∀ x : ℝ, ∫⁻ y, f (σ - (x, y).1 - (x, y).2) * h (τ - (x, y).1 + (x, y).2) =
      ∫⁻ t, f t * h (τ + σ - 2 * x + t) := by
    intro x
    have := lintegral_sub_right_eq_self (μ := volume)
      (fun t => f (-t) * h (τ + σ - 2 * x + t)) (σ - x)
    have hfe : ∀ t, f (-t) = f t := fun t => by simp only [hf]; ring_nf
    simp only at this ⊢
    calc ∫⁻ y, f (σ - x - y) * h (τ - x + y) =
        ∫⁻ y, f (-(y - (σ - x))) * h (τ + σ - 2 * x + (y - (σ - x))) := by
          congr 1; funext y; congr 1 <;> congr 1 <;> ring
      _ = ∫⁻ t, f (-t) * h (τ + σ - 2 * x + t) := this
      _ = ∫⁻ t, f t * h (τ + σ - 2 * x + t) := by congr 1; funext t; rw [hfe]
  simp_rw [e2]
  rw [lintegral_lintegral_swap (by
    exact ((hfm.comp measurable_snd).mul (hhm.comp (by fun_prop))).aemeasurable)]
  have e3 : ∀ t : ℝ, ∫⁻ x, f t * h (τ + σ - 2 * x + t) = f t *
      ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / (2 * lam * δ)) := by
    intro t
    rw [lintegral_const_mul _ (show Measurable fun x => h (τ + σ - 2 * x + t) from
      hhm.comp (by fun_prop))]
    congr 1
    rw [← cs_lintegral_inv_one_add_sq (by positivity : 0 < 2 * lam * δ) ((τ + σ + t) / 2)]
    congr 1; funext x; simp only [hh]; congr 2; ring
  simp_rw [e3]
  rw [lintegral_mul_const _ hfm]
  congr 1
  rw [← cs_lintegral_inv_one_add_sq hl 0]
  simp [hf]

/-- The one-dimensional Schur integral. -/
theorem cs_iso_integral {lam : ℝ} (hl : 0 < lam) (y : ℝ) :
    ∫⁻ y' : ℝ, ENNReal.ofReal ((1 + (lam * (y - y')) ^ 2)⁻¹) = ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / lam) := by
  rw [← cs_lintegral_inv_one_add_sq hl y]
  congr 1; funext y'; congr 2; ring


/-! ### The operator and the `TT*` pipeline -/

/-- The oscillatory integral operator
`csOp Φ a λ g (x, u) = ∫ e^{iλuΦ(x-y)} a(x-y, u) g(y) dy`. -/
def csOp (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (g : ℝ → ℂ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=
  ∫ y, cexp (I * lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 - y)) * a (z.1 - y) z.2 * g y

/-- The kernel `e^{iλuΦ(x-y)} a(x-y, u)` of `csOp`. -/
def csKer (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) (y : ℝ) : ℂ :=
  cexp (I * lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 - y)) * a (z.1 - y) z.2

theorem csOp_eq (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (g : ℝ → ℂ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) :
    csOp Φ a lam g z = ∫ y, csKer Φ a lam z y * g y := rfl

theorem csKer_continuous {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) (lam : ℝ) :
    Continuous (fun p : (ℝ × ℝ) × ℝ => csKer Φ a lam p.1 p.2) := by
  unfold csKer
  have h2 : Continuous (fun p : (ℝ × ℝ) × ℝ => a (p.1.1 - p.2) p.1.2) :=
    ha.comp ((continuous_fst.fst.sub continuous_snd).prodMk continuous_fst.snd)
  have h1 : Continuous (fun p : (ℝ × ℝ) × ℝ => Φ (p.1.1 - p.2)) :=
    hΦ.comp (continuous_fst.fst.sub continuous_snd)
  fun_prop

theorem csKer_norm_le {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {Ma : ℝ}
    (hMa : ∀ s u, ‖a s u‖ ≤ Ma) (lam : ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) (y : ℝ) : ‖csKer Φ a lam z y‖ ≤ Ma := by
  unfold csKer
  rw [norm_mul, show I * (lam : ℂ) * (z.2 : ℂ) * (Φ (z.1 - y) : ℂ) =
    ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 - y) : ℝ) : ℂ) * I by push_cast; ring, Complex.norm_exp_ofReal_mul_I,
    one_mul]
  exact hMa _ _

theorem csKer_ne_zero {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {lam : ℝ} {z : ℝ × ℝ} {y : ℝ}
    (h : csKer Φ a lam z y ≠ 0) : a (z.1 - y) z.2 ≠ 0 := by
  intro h'; apply h; simp [csKer, h']

theorem cs_enorm_conj (z : ℂ) : ‖(starRingEnd ℂ) z‖ₑ = ‖z‖ₑ := by
  rw [← ofReal_norm, ← ofReal_norm, Complex.norm_conj]

theorem cs_norm_prod_le {E F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [NormedAddCommGroup F]
    {x : E × F} {R : ℝ} (h1 : ‖x.1‖ ≤ R) (h2 : ‖x.2‖ ≤ R) : ‖x‖ ≤ R :=
  (norm_prod_le_iff).mpr ⟨h1, h2⟩

/-- Integrability of the `TT*` integrand for bounded, compactly supported kernels. -/
theorem cs_TT_integrable {W : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup W] [MeasurableSpace W] [BorelSpace W]
    [ProperSpace W] {ν : Measure W} [IsFiniteMeasureOnCompacts ν] [SFinite ν]
    (F : ℝ × ℝ → W → ℂ) (hF : StronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry F)) {C R : ℝ}
    (hb : ∀ z w, ‖F z w‖ ≤ C) (hs : ∀ z w, F z w ≠ 0 → ‖z‖ ≤ R ∧ ‖w‖ ≤ R) :
    Integrable (fun q : (ℝ × ℝ) × (W × W) => F q.1 q.2.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (F q.1 q.2.2))
      ((volume : Measure (ℝ × ℝ)).prod (ν.prod ν)) := by
  have hC : 0 ≤ C := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hb 0 0)
  have hm : StronglyMeasurable (fun q : (ℝ × ℝ) × (W × W) =>
      F q.1 q.2.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (F q.1 q.2.2)) := by
    have h1 : StronglyMeasurable (fun q : (ℝ × ℝ) × (W × W) => F q.1 q.2.1) :=
      hF.comp_measurable (measurable_fst.prodMk measurable_snd.fst)
    have h2 : StronglyMeasurable (fun q : (ℝ × ℝ) × (W × W) => F q.1 q.2.2) :=
      hF.comp_measurable (measurable_fst.prodMk measurable_snd.snd)
    exact h1.mul (Complex.continuous_conj.comp_stronglyMeasurable h2)
  have hfin : ((volume : Measure (ℝ × ℝ)).prod (ν.prod ν))
      (Metric.closedBall (0 : (ℝ × ℝ) × (W × W)) R) < ⊤ := measure_closedBall_lt_top
  refine Integrable.mono' (g := (Metric.closedBall (0 : (ℝ × ℝ) × (W × W)) R).indicator
    (fun _ => C * C)) ((integrableOn_const hfin.ne).integrable_indicator measurableSet_closedBall)
    hm.aestronglyMeasurable (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun q => ?_)
  by_cases h : F q.1 q.2.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (F q.1 q.2.2) = 0
  · rw [h, norm_zero]; exact Set.indicator_nonneg (fun _ _ => mul_nonneg hC hC) _
  · have h1 : F q.1 q.2.1 ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by rw [h', zero_mul])
    have h2 : F q.1 q.2.2 ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by rw [h', map_zero, mul_zero])
    have hq : q ∈ Metric.closedBall (0 : (ℝ × ℝ) × (W × W)) R := by
      rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right]
      exact cs_norm_prod_le (hs _ _ h1).1 (cs_norm_prod_le (hs _ _ h1).2 (hs _ _ h2).2)
    rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hq, norm_mul, Complex.norm_conj]
    exact mul_le_mul (hb _ _) (hb _ _) (norm_nonneg _) hC

/-- The `TT*` + Schur pipeline: an `L²` bound for `G ↦ ∫ Kern(z,w) G(w) dw` from a symmetric
bound on the kernel of `T*T` on the support of `G`. -/
theorem cs_pipeline {W : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup W] [MeasurableSpace W] [BorelSpace W]
    [ProperSpace W] {ν : Measure W} [IsFiniteMeasureOnCompacts ν] [SFinite ν]
    (Kern : ℝ × ℝ → W → ℂ) (G : W → ℂ)
    (hm : StronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry fun z w => Kern z w * G w)) (hGm : Measurable G)
    {C R : ℝ} (hb : ∀ z w, ‖Kern z w * G w‖ ≤ C)
    (hs : ∀ z w, Kern z w * G w ≠ 0 → ‖z‖ ≤ R ∧ ‖w‖ ≤ R)
    {E : Set W} (hE : MeasurableSet E) (hGE : ∀ w ∉ E, G w = 0)
    (κ : W → W → ℝ≥0∞) (hκm : Measurable (Function.uncurry κ)) (hκs : ∀ w w', κ w w' = κ w' w)
    (hK : ∀ w ∈ E, ∀ w' ∈ E,
      ‖∫ z, Kern z w * (starRingEnd ℂ) (Kern z w')‖ₑ ≤ κ w w')
    {A : ℝ≥0∞} (hA : ∀ w ∈ E, ∫⁻ w' in E, κ w w' ∂ν ≤ A) :
    ∫⁻ z, ‖∫ w, Kern z w * G w ∂ν‖ₑ ^ 2 ≤ 2 * A * ∫⁻ w, ‖G w‖ₑ ^ 2 ∂ν := by
  have hint := cs_TT_integrable (ν := ν) (fun z w => Kern z w * G w) hm hb hs
  have h1 := cs_TTstar (ρ := (volume : Measure (ℝ × ℝ))) (fun z w => Kern z w * G w) hint
  set κ₁ : W → W → ℝ≥0∞ := fun w w' => (E ×ˢ E).indicator (Function.uncurry κ) (w, w')
  have hκ₁m : Measurable (Function.uncurry κ₁) := by
    have : Function.uncurry κ₁ = (E ×ˢ E).indicator (Function.uncurry κ) := by
      funext p; rfl
    rw [this]; exact hκm.indicator (hE.prod hE)
  have hκ₁s : ∀ w w', κ₁ w w' = κ₁ w' w := by
    intro w w'
    simp only [κ₁]
    by_cases h : w ∈ E ∧ w' ∈ E
    · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem (Set.mk_mem_prod h.1 h.2),
        Set.indicator_of_mem (Set.mk_mem_prod h.2 h.1)]
      exact hκs w w'
    · rw [Set.indicator_of_notMem (fun h' => h ⟨h'.1, h'.2⟩),
        Set.indicator_of_notMem (fun h' => h ⟨h'.2, h'.1⟩)]
  have hA₁ : ∀ w, ∫⁻ w', κ₁ w w' ∂ν ≤ A := by
    intro w
    by_cases hw : w ∈ E
    · have e : ∀ w', κ₁ w w' = E.indicator (κ w) w' := fun w' => by
        by_cases hw' : w' ∈ E
        · simp only [κ₁, Set.indicator_of_mem (Set.mk_mem_prod hw hw'),
            Set.indicator_of_mem hw', Function.uncurry_apply_pair]
        · simp only [κ₁, Set.indicator_of_notMem (fun (h : (w, w') ∈ E ×ˢ E) => hw' h.2),
            Set.indicator_of_notMem hw']
      simp_rw [e]
      rw [lintegral_indicator hE]
      exact hA w hw
    · have : ∀ w', κ₁ w w' = 0 := fun w' => by
        simp only [κ₁]; exact Set.indicator_of_notMem (fun h => hw h.1) _
      simp [this]
  have hpt : ∀ p : W × W, ‖∫ z, Kern z p.1 * G p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (Kern z p.2 * G p.2)‖ₑ ≤
      ‖G p.1‖ₑ * ‖G p.2‖ₑ * κ₁ p.1 p.2 := by
    intro p
    have e : (fun z => Kern z p.1 * G p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (Kern z p.2 * G p.2)) =
        fun z => (Kern z p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (Kern z p.2)) *
          (G p.1 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (G p.2)) := by
      funext z; rw [map_mul]; ring
    rw [e, integral_mul_const, enorm_mul, enorm_mul, cs_enorm_conj (G p.2), mul_comm]
    by_cases hp : p.1 ∈ E ∧ p.2 ∈ E
    · simp only [κ₁, Set.indicator_of_mem (Set.mk_mem_prod hp.1 hp.2)]
      gcongr
      exact hK p.1 hp.1 p.2 hp.2
    · rcases not_and_or.mp hp with h | h
      · simp [hGE _ h]
      · simp [hGE _ h]
  calc ∫⁻ z, ‖∫ w, Kern z w * G w ∂ν‖ₑ ^ 2 ≤ _ := h1
    _ ≤ ∫⁻ p : W × W, ‖G p.1‖ₑ * ‖G p.2‖ₑ * κ₁ p.1 p.2 ∂(ν.prod ν) := lintegral_mono hpt
    _ ≤ 2 * A * ∫⁻ w, ‖G w‖ₑ ^ 2 ∂ν := cs_schur hGm.enorm hκ₁m hκ₁s hA₁


/-! ### Auxiliary facts about the phase and the amplitude -/
theorem cs_iteratedDeriv_differentiable {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (j : ℕ) :
    Differentiable ℝ (iteratedDeriv j Φ) := by
  rw [iteratedDeriv_eq_iterate]
  exact (hΦ.iterate_deriv j).differentiable (by simp)

theorem cs_iteratedDeriv_shift_sum {m : ℕ} {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (ε c : Fin m → ℝ)
    (D : ℝ) : ∀ j : ℕ, iteratedDeriv j (fun r => (∑ k, ε k * Φ (r + c k)) / D) =
      fun r => (∑ k, ε k * iteratedDeriv j Φ (r + c k)) / D
  | 0 => by simp
  | j + 1 => by
    rw [iteratedDeriv_succ, cs_iteratedDeriv_shift_sum hΦ ε c D j]
    funext r
    have hd : ∀ k, HasDerivAt (fun r => ε k * iteratedDeriv j Φ (r + c k))
        (ε k * iteratedDeriv (j + 1) Φ (r + c k)) r := by
      intro k
      have h1 := cs_iteratedDeriv_differentiable hΦ j
      have := ((h1 (r + c k)).hasDerivAt.comp_add_const r (c k)).const_mul (ε k)
      rw [iteratedDeriv_succ]; exact this
    have hs : HasDerivAt (fun r => ∑ k, ε k * iteratedDeriv j Φ (r + c k))
        (∑ k, ε k * iteratedDeriv (j + 1) Φ (r + c k)) r := by
      have := HasDerivAt.sum (u := Finset.univ) (fun k _ => hd k)
      convert this using 1; funext r; simp [Finset.sum_apply]
    exact (hs.div_const D).deriv

/-- Uniform bounds for the derivatives of `Φ` up to order `7` on a compact interval. -/
theorem cs_deriv_bounds {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (p q : ℝ) :
    ∃ M > 0, ∀ k ≤ 7, ∀ x ∈ Icc p q, |iteratedDeriv k Φ x| ≤ M := by
  have hc : Continuous (fun x => ∑ k ∈ Finset.range 8, |iteratedDeriv k Φ x|) := by
    refine continuous_finsetSum _ fun k _ => ?_
    exact (cs_iteratedDeriv_differentiable hΦ k).continuous.abs
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := (isCompact_Icc (a := p) (b := q)).exists_bound_of_continuousOn hc.continuousOn
  refine ⟨max C 1, by positivity, fun k hk x hx => ?_⟩
  have h1 := hC x hx
  rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (Finset.sum_nonneg fun _ _ => abs_nonneg _)] at h1
  have h2 : |iteratedDeriv k Φ x| ≤ ∑ k ∈ Finset.range 8, |iteratedDeriv k Φ x| :=
    Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun k => |iteratedDeriv k Φ x|) (fun _ _ => abs_nonneg _)
      (Finset.mem_range.mpr (by omega))
  exact h2.trans (h1.trans (le_max_left _ _))

theorem cs_lower_lip {f f' : ℝ → ℝ} (hf : ∀ x, HasDerivAt f (f' x) x) {m α β : ℝ}
    (hm : ∀ x ∈ Icc α β, m ≤ |f' x|) {x y : ℝ} (hx : x ∈ Icc α β) (hy : y ∈ Icc α β) :
    m * |x - y| ≤ |f x - f y| := by
  rcases lt_trichotomy x y with hxy | hxy | hxy
  · obtain ⟨ξ, hξ, hξe⟩ := exists_hasDerivAt_eq_slope f f' hxy
      (fun t _ => (hf t).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt) (fun t _ => hf t)
    have hξI : ξ ∈ Icc α β := ⟨hx.1.trans hξ.1.le, hξ.2.le.trans hy.2⟩
    have := hm ξ hξI
    rw [hξe, abs_div, abs_of_pos (sub_pos.mpr hxy), le_div_iff₀ (sub_pos.mpr hxy)] at this
    rw [abs_sub_comm x y, abs_of_pos (sub_pos.mpr hxy), abs_sub_comm]; exact this
  · subst hxy; simp
  · obtain ⟨ξ, hξ, hξe⟩ := exists_hasDerivAt_eq_slope f f' hxy
      (fun t _ => (hf t).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt) (fun t _ => hf t)
    have hξI : ξ ∈ Icc α β := ⟨hy.1.trans hξ.1.le, hξ.2.le.trans hx.2⟩
    have := hm ξ hξI
    rw [hξe, abs_div, abs_of_pos (sub_pos.mpr hxy), le_div_iff₀ (sub_pos.mpr hxy)] at this
    rw [abs_of_pos (sub_pos.mpr hxy)]; exact this

theorem cs_tsupport_translate {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (v : ℝ × ℝ) :
    tsupport (fun z => f (z + v)) = (fun z => z + v) ⁻¹' tsupport f :=
  tsupport_comp_eq_preimage f (Homeomorph.addRight v)

theorem cs_tsupport_s {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {α β : ℝ} (hs : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β) :
    ∀ p ∈ tsupport (Function.uncurry a), p.1 ∈ Icc α β := by
  have : tsupport (Function.uncurry a) ⊆ {p : ℝ × ℝ | p.1 ∈ Icc α β} :=
    closure_minimal (fun p hp => hs p.1 p.2 hp)
      (isClosed_Icc.preimage continuous_fst)
  exact fun p hp => this hp

theorem cs_tsupport_u {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {c₀ : ℝ} (hu : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u|) :
    ∀ p ∈ tsupport (Function.uncurry a), c₀ ≤ |p.2| := by
  have : tsupport (Function.uncurry a) ⊆ {p : ℝ × ℝ | c₀ ≤ |p.2|} :=
    closure_minimal (fun p hp => hu p.1 p.2 hp)
      (isClosed_le continuous_const (continuous_abs.comp continuous_snd))
  exact fun p hp => this hp

theorem cs_mem_tsupport {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {z : ℝ × ℝ} (h : f z ≠ 0) : z ∈ tsupport f :=
  subset_tsupport f h

/-- Combining a trivial bound with a decay bound. -/
theorem cs_decay_combine {K C₀ C₁ t : ℝ} (ht : 0 ≤ t) (h0 : K ≤ C₀)
    (h1 : 0 < t → K ≤ C₁ / t ^ 4) (hC₀ : 0 ≤ C₀) :
    K ≤ 4 * max C₀ C₁ * ((1 + t ^ 2) ^ 2)⁻¹ := by
  have hpos : 0 < (1 + t ^ 2) ^ 2 := by positivity
  rw [← div_eq_mul_inv, le_div_iff₀ hpos]
  rcases le_or_gt t 1 with h | h
  · have h12 : 1 + t ^ 2 ≤ 2 := by nlinarith
    have : (1 + t ^ 2) ^ 2 ≤ 4 := by
      calc (1 + t ^ 2) ^ 2 ≤ 2 ^ 2 := pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity) h12 2
        _ = 4 := by norm_num
    have hK : K ≤ max C₀ C₁ := h0.trans (le_max_left _ _)
    rcases le_or_gt K 0 with hK0 | hK0
    · nlinarith [le_max_left C₀ C₁]
    · calc K * (1 + t ^ 2) ^ 2 ≤ max C₀ C₁ * 4 := mul_le_mul hK this hpos.le
            (hC₀.trans (le_max_left _ _))
        _ = _ := by ring
  · have htp : 0 < t := by linarith
    have hK := h1 htp
    have ht4 : 0 < t ^ 4 := by positivity
    rw [le_div_iff₀ ht4] at hK
    have h12 : 1 + t ^ 2 ≤ 2 * t ^ 2 := by nlinarith
    have : (1 + t ^ 2) ^ 2 ≤ 4 * t ^ 4 := by
      calc (1 + t ^ 2) ^ 2 ≤ (2 * t ^ 2) ^ 2 := pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity) h12 2
        _ = 4 * t ^ 4 := by ring
    rcases le_or_gt K 0 with hK0 | hK0
    · nlinarith [le_max_left C₀ C₁]
    · calc K * (1 + t ^ 2) ^ 2 ≤ K * (4 * t ^ 4) := by gcongr
        _ = 4 * (K * t ^ 4) := by ring
        _ ≤ 4 * C₁ := by linarith
        _ ≤ 4 * max C₀ C₁ := by gcongr; exact le_max_right _ _

theorem cs_conj_cexp (t : ℝ) : (starRingEnd ℂ) (cexp (I * (t : ℂ))) = cexp (-(I * (t : ℂ))) := by
  rw [← Complex.exp_conj]; congr 1; simp [map_mul, Complex.conj_I, Complex.conj_ofReal]

theorem cs_norm_csQ_ge (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : (ψ z.1) ^ 2 ≤ ‖csQ ψ z‖ := by
  have e : csQ ψ z = ((z.2 ^ 2 * deriv ψ z.1 ^ 2 + ψ z.1 ^ 2 : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
    simp only [csQ]; push_cast; ring
  rw [e, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
  nlinarith [sq_nonneg (z.2 * deriv ψ z.1)]

theorem cs_norm_csQ_ge' (ψ : ℝ → ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) {c₀ : ℝ} (hc : c₀ ^ 2 ≤ z.2 ^ 2) :
    min (c₀ ^ 2) 1 * (deriv ψ z.1 ^ 2 + ψ z.1 ^ 2) ≤ ‖csQ ψ z‖ := by
  have e : csQ ψ z = ((z.2 ^ 2 * deriv ψ z.1 ^ 2 + ψ z.1 ^ 2 : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
    simp only [csQ]; push_cast; ring
  rw [e, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
  have h1 : min (c₀ ^ 2) 1 * deriv ψ z.1 ^ 2 ≤ z.2 ^ 2 * deriv ψ z.1 ^ 2 :=
    mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right ((min_le_left _ _).trans hc) (sq_nonneg _)
  have h2 : min (c₀ ^ 2) 1 * ψ z.1 ^ 2 ≤ ψ z.1 ^ 2 := by
    have := min_le_right (c₀ ^ 2) 1
    nlinarith [sq_nonneg (ψ z.1)]
  linarith

theorem cs_amp_bound {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a))
    (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a)) :
    ∃ Ma, 0 ≤ Ma ∧ ∀ s u, ‖a s u‖ ≤ Ma := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := ha.continuous.bounded_above_of_compact_support ha_supp
  exact ⟨max C 0, le_max_right _ _, fun s u => (hC (s, u)).trans (le_max_left _ _)⟩

theorem cs_amp_ball {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a)) :
    ∃ R, 0 ≤ R ∧ tsupport (Function.uncurry a) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R := by
  obtain ⟨R, hR⟩ := (Metric.isBounded_iff_subset_closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ)).mp
    ha_supp.isCompact.isBounded
  exact ⟨max R 0, le_max_right _ _, hR.trans (Metric.closedBall_subset_closedBall
    (le_max_left _ _))⟩


theorem cs_norm_integral_le {f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} {C R : ℝ} (hC : 0 ≤ C) (hb : ∀ z, ‖f z‖ ≤ C)
    (hs : ∀ z, f z ≠ 0 → z ∈ Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R) :
    ‖∫ z, f z‖ ≤ C * (volume (Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R)).toReal := by
  have hint : Integrable ((Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R).indicator (fun _ => C)) :=
    (integrableOn_const measure_closedBall_lt_top.ne).integrable_indicator measurableSet_closedBall
  refine (norm_integral_le_of_norm_le hint (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)).trans ?_
  · by_cases h : f z = 0
    · rw [h, norm_zero]; exact Set.indicator_nonneg (fun _ _ => hC) _
    · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem (hs z h)]; exact hb z
  · rw [integral_indicator_const _ measurableSet_closedBall]
    simp [mul_comm, Measure.real]

theorem cs_conj_contDiff {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a)) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun p : ℝ × ℝ => (starRingEnd ℂ) (Function.uncurry a p)) := by
  have := Complex.conjCLE.contDiff.comp ha
  simpa [Function.comp_def] using this

theorem cs_conj_hasCompactSupport {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a)) :
    HasCompactSupport (fun p : ℝ × ℝ => (starRingEnd ℂ) (Function.uncurry a p)) :=
  ha_supp.comp_left (g := starRingEnd ℂ) (map_zero _)

theorem cs_mem_tsupport_shift {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {z : ℝ × ℝ} {c : ℝ}
    (h : z ∈ tsupport (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => (starRingEnd ℂ) (a (z.1 + c) z.2))) :
    z + (c, 0) ∈ tsupport (Function.uncurry a) := by
  have h1 : tsupport (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => (starRingEnd ℂ) (a (z.1 + c) z.2)) ⊆
      tsupport (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => Function.uncurry a (z + (c, 0))) := by
    have := tsupport_comp_subset (g := starRingEnd ℂ) (map_zero _)
      (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => Function.uncurry a (z + (c, 0)))
    have e : (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => (starRingEnd ℂ) (a (z.1 + c) z.2)) =
        (starRingEnd ℂ) ∘ (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => Function.uncurry a (z + (c, 0))) := by
      funext z; simp [Function.uncurry]
    rw [e]; exact this
  have := h1 h
  rw [cs_tsupport_translate] at this
  exact this

/-- **Kernel bound for the `L²` estimate.** -/
theorem cs_L2_kernel {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {α β : ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ)
    (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a))
    (hs : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β) (hΦ' : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, deriv Φ s ≠ 0) :
    ∃ C, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ lam, 0 < lam → ∀ y y' : ℝ,
      ‖∫ z, csKer Φ a lam z y * (starRingEnd ℂ) (csKer Φ a lam z y')‖ ≤
        C * ((1 + (lam * (y - y')) ^ 2) ^ 2)⁻¹ := by
  obtain ⟨Ma, hMa0, hMa⟩ := cs_amp_bound ha ha_supp
  obtain ⟨R, hR0, hR⟩ := cs_amp_ball ha_supp
  obtain ⟨M, hM0, hM⟩ := cs_deriv_bounds hΦ (α - 1) (β + 1)
  obtain ⟨c₁, hc₁, hc₁'⟩ : ∃ c₁ > 0, ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, c₁ ≤ |deriv Φ s| := by
    rcases (Icc α β).eq_empty_or_nonempty with h | h
    · exact ⟨1, one_pos, fun s hs => by rw [h] at hs; exact absurd hs (Set.notMem_empty s)⟩
    · have hcont : ContinuousOn (fun s => |deriv Φ s|) (Icc α β) :=
        ((hΦ.continuous_deriv (by simp)).abs).continuousOn
      obtain ⟨s₀, hs₀, hmin⟩ := isCompact_Icc.exists_isMinOn h hcont
      exact ⟨|deriv Φ s₀|, abs_pos.mpr (hΦ' s₀ hs₀), fun s hs => hmin hs⟩
  have hΦd : ∀ x, HasDerivAt Φ (deriv Φ x) x := fun x =>
    (hΦ.differentiable (by simp) x).hasDerivAt
  have hsupp := cs_tsupport_s hs
  -- the translated kernel
  have key_eq : ∀ (lam y y' : ℝ),
      ∫ z, csKer Φ a lam z y * (starRingEnd ℂ) (csKer Φ a lam z y') =
      ∫ z : ℝ × ℝ, cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * (Φ z.1 - Φ (z.1 + (y - y'))) : ℝ) : ℂ)) *
        (a z.1 z.2 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (a (z.1 + (y - y')) z.2)) := by
    intro lam y y'
    rw [← integral_add_right_eq_self _ ((y, 0) : ℝ × ℝ)]
    congr 1; funext z
    have e1 : (z + ((y, 0) : ℝ × ℝ)).1 - y = z.1 := by simp
    have e2 : (z + ((y, 0) : ℝ × ℝ)).1 - y' = z.1 + (y - y') := by simp; ring
    have e3 : (z + ((y, 0) : ℝ × ℝ)).2 = z.2 := by simp
    simp only [csKer, e1, e2, e3, map_mul]
    rw [show I * (lam : ℂ) * (z.2 : ℂ) * (Φ (z.1 + (y - y')) : ℂ) =
        I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 + (y - y')) : ℝ) : ℂ) by push_cast; ring, cs_conj_cexp,
      show I * (lam : ℂ) * (z.2 : ℂ) * (Φ z.1 : ℂ) = I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ) by
        push_cast; ring]
    have : cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * (Φ z.1 - Φ (z.1 + (y - y'))) : ℝ) : ℂ)) =
        cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ z.1 : ℝ) : ℂ)) *
          cexp (-(I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 + (y - y')) : ℝ) : ℂ))) := by
      rw [← Complex.exp_add]; congr 1; push_cast; ring
    rw [this]; ring
  -- the trivial bound
  set C₀ := Ma * Ma * (volume (Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R)).toReal
  have hC₀ : 0 ≤ C₀ := by positivity
  have htriv : ∀ (lam c : ℝ),
      ‖∫ z : ℝ × ℝ, cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * (Φ z.1 - Φ (z.1 + c)) : ℝ) : ℂ)) *
      (a z.1 z.2 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (a (z.1 + c) z.2))‖ ≤ C₀ := by
    intro lam c
    refine cs_norm_integral_le (mul_nonneg hMa0 hMa0) (fun z => ?_) (fun z hz => ?_)
    · rw [norm_mul, Complex.norm_exp_I_mul_ofReal, one_mul, norm_mul, Complex.norm_conj]
      exact mul_le_mul (hMa _ _) (hMa _ _) (norm_nonneg _) hMa0
    · have : a z.1 z.2 ≠ 0 := fun h => hz (by rw [h]; ring)
      exact hR (subset_tsupport _ this)
  -- the decay bound
  let ι := {p : ℝ × ℝ // 0 < p.1 ∧ p.2 ≠ 0}
  let ψ : ι → ℝ → ℝ := fun i r =>
    (∑ k : Fin 2, ![(1 : ℝ), -1] k * Φ (r + ![(0 : ℝ), i.1.2] k)) / |i.1.2|
  have hψe : ∀ i r, ψ i r = (Φ r - Φ (r + i.1.2)) / |i.1.2| := by
    intro i r; simp [ψ, Fin.sum_univ_two]; ring
  have hψs : ∀ i, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (ψ i) := fun i =>
    (ContDiff.sum fun _ _ => contDiff_const.mul
      (hΦ.comp (contDiff_id.add contDiff_const))).div_const
      _
  have hψd : ∀ i j r, iteratedDeriv j (ψ i) r =
      (iteratedDeriv j Φ r - iteratedDeriv j Φ (r + i.1.2)) / |i.1.2| := by
    intro i j r
    have := congrFun (cs_iteratedDeriv_shift_sum hΦ ![(1 : ℝ), -1] ![(0 : ℝ), i.1.2]
      |i.1.2| j) r
    simp only [ψ]; rw [this]; simp [Fin.sum_univ_two]; ring
  let U : ι → Set (ℝ × ℝ) := fun i => {z | |z.2| < R + 1 ∧ α - 1 < z.1 ∧ z.1 < β + 1 ∧
    α - 1 < z.1 + i.1.2 ∧ z.1 + i.1.2 < β + 1 ∧ c₁ ^ 2 / 2 < ‖csQ (ψ i) z‖}
  have hQc : ∀ i, Continuous (csQ (ψ i)) := fun i => by
    have h1 : Continuous (ψ i) := (hψs i).continuous
    have h2 : Continuous (deriv (ψ i)) := (hψs i).continuous_deriv (by simp)
    unfold csQ; fun_prop
  have hU : ∀ i, IsOpen (U i) := by
    intro i
    simp only [U, Set.ofPred_and]
    refine (isOpen_lt (by fun_prop) continuous_const).inter
      ((isOpen_lt continuous_const (by fun_prop)).inter ((isOpen_lt (by fun_prop)
        continuous_const).inter ((isOpen_lt continuous_const (by fun_prop)).inter
        ((isOpen_lt (by fun_prop) continuous_const).inter
          (isOpen_lt continuous_const (hQc i).norm)))))
  have hUR : ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, |z.2| ≤ R + 1 := fun i z hz => hz.1.le
  have hψb : ∃ C, ∀ i, ∀ j ≤ 5, ∀ z ∈ U i, |iteratedDeriv j (ψ i) z.1| ≤ C := by
    refine ⟨M, fun i j hj z hz => ?_⟩
    rw [hψd]
    have hc : 0 < |i.1.2| := abs_pos.mpr i.2.2
    rw [abs_div, abs_abs, div_le_iff₀ hc]
    have h1 : z.1 ∈ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := ⟨hz.2.1.le, hz.2.2.1.le⟩
    have h2 : z.1 + i.1.2 ∈ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := ⟨hz.2.2.2.1.le, hz.2.2.2.2.1.le⟩
    have := cs_lipschitz_of_deriv (convex_Icc _ _) (cs_iteratedDeriv_differentiable hΦ j)
      (fun x hx => by rw [← iteratedDeriv_succ]; exact hM (j + 1) (by omega) x hx) h1 h2
    calc _ ≤ M * |z.1 - (z.1 + i.1.2)| := this
      _ = M * |i.1.2| := by rw [show z.1 - (z.1 + i.1.2) = -i.1.2 by ring, abs_neg]
  have hq₀ : 0 < c₁ ^ 2 / 2 := by positivity
  have hQ : ∀ i, ∀ z ∈ U i, c₁ ^ 2 / 2 ≤ ‖csQ (ψ i) z‖ := fun i z hz => hz.2.2.2.2.2.le
  let B : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ := fun i z => a z.1 z.2 * (starRingEnd ℂ) (a (z.1 + i.1.2) z.2)
  have hB : csGood U 4 B := by
    have hB1 := csGood_translate (U := U) 4 (Function.uncurry a) (fun _ => (0 : ℝ × ℝ)) ha
      ha_supp
    have hB2 := csGood_translate (U := U) 4
      (fun p : ℝ × ℝ => (starRingEnd ℂ) (Function.uncurry a p)) (fun i => ((i.1.2 : ℝ), (0 : ℝ)))
      (cs_conj_contDiff ha) (cs_conj_hasCompactSupport ha_supp)
    refine csGood_congr hU 4 (fun i z _ => ?_) (csGood_mul hU 4 hB1 hB2)
    simp [B, Function.uncurry]
  have hBU : ∀ i, tsupport (B i) ⊆ U i := by
    intro i z hz
    have h1 : z ∈ tsupport (Function.uncurry a) := tsupport_mul_subset_left hz
    have h2 := cs_mem_tsupport_shift (tsupport_mul_subset_right hz)
    have hz1 := hsupp _ h1
    have hz2 := hsupp _ h2
    simp only [Prod.fst_add] at hz2
    have hzR : ‖z‖ ≤ R := by have := hR h1; rwa [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at this
    have hz2' : |z.2| ≤ R := (norm_snd_le z).trans hzR
    refine ⟨by linarith, by linarith [hz1.1], by linarith [hz1.2], by linarith [hz2.1],
      by linarith [hz2.2], ?_⟩
    have hlow := cs_lower_lip hΦd hc₁' hz1 hz2
    have hc : 0 < |i.1.2| := abs_pos.mpr i.2.2
    have hψz : c₁ ≤ |ψ i z.1| := by
      rw [hψe, abs_div, abs_abs, le_div_iff₀ hc]
      calc c₁ * |i.1.2| = c₁ * |z.1 - (z.1 + i.1.2)| := by
            rw [show z.1 - (z.1 + i.1.2) = -i.1.2 by ring, abs_neg]
        _ ≤ _ := hlow
    have : c₁ ^ 2 ≤ (ψ i z.1) ^ 2 := by
      rw [← sq_abs (ψ i z.1)]; exact pow_le_pow_left₀ hc₁.le hψz 2
    have := cs_norm_csQ_ge (ψ i) z
    linarith
  have hBR : ∀ i, tsupport (B i) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R := fun i z hz =>
    hR (tsupport_mul_subset_left hz)
  obtain ⟨C₁, hC₁⟩ := csKernel_decay U hU hUR (fun i => i.1.1 * |i.1.2|)
    (fun i => mul_pos i.2.1 (abs_pos.mpr i.2.2)) ψ hψs hψb hq₀ hQ B hB hBU hBR
  refine ⟨4 * max C₀ C₁, by positivity, fun lam hlam y y' => ?_⟩
  have ht : 0 ≤ lam * |y - y'| := by positivity
  have hfin := cs_decay_combine ht (K := ‖∫ z, csKer Φ a lam z y *
      (starRingEnd ℂ) (csKer Φ a lam z y')‖) (C₀ := C₀) (C₁ := C₁)
    (by rw [key_eq]; exact htriv lam (y - y')) (fun htp => by
      have hne : y - y' ≠ 0 := by
        intro h; rw [h, abs_zero, mul_zero] at htp; exact lt_irrefl _ htp
      have := hC₁ ⟨(lam, y - y'), hlam, hne⟩
      rw [key_eq]
      convert this using 2
      · congr 1; funext z
        simp only [csPh, B]
        congr 2
        rw [hψe]
        have hc : ((|y - y'| : ℝ) : ℂ) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast abs_ne_zero.mpr hne
        push_cast
        field_simp) hC₀
  rwa [mul_pow, sq_abs, ← mul_pow] at hfin


/-! ### The `L²` estimate -/

theorem cs_support_bound {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {lam R N : ℝ}
    (hR : tsupport (Function.uncurry a) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R) {g : ℝ → ℂ}
    (hg0 : ∀ y, N < |y| → g y = 0) {z : ℝ × ℝ} {y : ℝ} (h : csKer Φ a lam z y * g y ≠ 0) :
    ‖z‖ ≤ R + N ∧ |y| ≤ R + N ∧ |y| ≤ N ∧ |z.1 - y| ≤ R ∧ |z.2| ≤ R := by
  have hgy : g y ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by rw [h', mul_zero])
  have hk : csKer Φ a lam z y ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by rw [h', zero_mul])
  have hy : |y| ≤ N := by by_contra hc; exact hgy (hg0 y (lt_of_not_ge hc))
  have ha := csKer_ne_zero hk
  have hmem : ((z.1 - y, z.2) : ℝ × ℝ) ∈ Metric.closedBall 0 R :=
    hR (subset_tsupport (Function.uncurry a) ha)
  rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at hmem
  have h1 : |z.1 - y| ≤ R := (norm_fst_le _).trans hmem
  have h2 : |z.2| ≤ R := (norm_snd_le _).trans hmem
  have hR0 : 0 ≤ R := (abs_nonneg _).trans h2
  have hN0 : 0 ≤ N := (abs_nonneg _).trans hy
  refine ⟨cs_norm_prod_le ?_ ?_, by linarith, hy, h1, h2⟩
  · rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]
    calc |z.1| = |(z.1 - y) + y| := by ring_nf
      _ ≤ |z.1 - y| + |y| := abs_add_le _ _
      _ ≤ R + N := add_le_add h1 hy
  · rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]; linarith

theorem cs_kernel_stronglyMeasurable {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) (lam : ℝ) {g : ℝ → ℂ} (hg : StronglyMeasurable g) :
    StronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry fun (z : ℝ × ℝ) (y : ℝ) => csKer Φ a lam z y * g y) :=
  (csKer_continuous hΦ ha lam).stronglyMeasurable.mul (hg.comp_measurable measurable_snd)

theorem csOp_aestronglyMeasurable {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) (lam : ℝ) {g : ℝ → ℂ} (hg : StronglyMeasurable g) :
    AEStronglyMeasurable (csOp Φ a lam g) volume :=
  (StronglyMeasurable.integral_prod_right' (ν := (volume : Measure ℝ))
    (cs_kernel_stronglyMeasurable hΦ ha lam hg)).aestronglyMeasurable

/-- `L²` bound for bounded, compactly supported `g`. -/
theorem cs_L2_core {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {α β : ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ)
    (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a))
    (hs : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β) (hΦ' : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, deriv Φ s ≠ 0) :
    ∃ C, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ lam, 0 < lam → ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, StronglyMeasurable g → ∀ N : ℝ,
      (∀ y, ‖g y‖ ≤ N) → (∀ y, N < |y| → g y = 0) →
      ∫⁻ z, ‖csOp Φ a lam g z‖ₑ ^ 2 ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (C / lam) * ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 2 := by
  obtain ⟨K, hK0, hK⟩ := cs_L2_kernel hΦ ha ha_supp hs hΦ'
  obtain ⟨Ma, hMa0, hMa⟩ := cs_amp_bound ha ha_supp
  obtain ⟨R, hR0, hR⟩ := cs_amp_ball ha_supp
  refine ⟨2 * K * Real.pi, by positivity, fun lam hlam g hg N hgN hg0 => ?_⟩
  have hpipe := cs_pipeline (ν := (volume : Measure ℝ)) (csKer Φ a lam) g
    (cs_kernel_stronglyMeasurable hΦ.continuous ha.continuous lam hg) hg.measurable
    (C := Ma * N) (R := R + N)
    (fun z y => by
      rw [norm_mul]
      exact mul_le_mul (csKer_norm_le hMa lam z y) (hgN y) (norm_nonneg _) hMa0)
    (fun z y h => by
      obtain ⟨h1, h2, -⟩ := cs_support_bound hR hg0 h
      exact ⟨h1, by rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]; exact h2⟩)
    (E := univ) MeasurableSet.univ (fun w hw => absurd (mem_univ w) hw)
    (fun y y' => ENNReal.ofReal (K * (1 + (lam * (y - y')) ^ 2)⁻¹))
    (ENNReal.measurable_ofReal.comp (by fun_prop))
    (fun y y' => by congr 3; ring)
    (fun y _ y' _ => by
      rw [← ofReal_norm]
      refine ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal ((hK lam hlam y y').trans ?_)
      gcongr; nlinarith [sq_nonneg (lam * (y - y'))])
    (A := ENNReal.ofReal K * ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / lam))
    (fun y _ => by
      rw [Measure.restrict_univ]
      refine le_of_eq ?_
      simp_rw [ENNReal.ofReal_mul hK0]
      rw [lintegral_const_mul _ (show Measurable fun w' : ℝ =>
          ENNReal.ofReal (1 + (lam * (y - w')) ^ 2)⁻¹ from
          ENNReal.measurable_ofReal.comp (by fun_prop)),
        cs_iso_integral hlam y])
  have e : ENNReal.ofReal (2 * K * Real.pi / lam) =
      2 * (ENNReal.ofReal K * ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / lam)) := by
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_mul hK0, show (2 : ℝ≥0∞) = ENNReal.ofReal 2 by simp,
      ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by norm_num)]
    congr 1; ring
  rw [e]
  exact hpipe

/-- Passing from `p`-th power integrals to `eLpNorm`s. -/
theorem cs_eLpNorm_le_of_lintegral {X Y : Type*} [MeasurableSpace X] [MeasurableSpace Y]
    {μ : Measure X} {ν : Measure Y} {f : X → ℂ} {g : Y → ℂ} (hf : AEStronglyMeasurable f μ)
    (hg : AEStronglyMeasurable g ν) {p : ℕ} (hp : 0 < p) {c : ℝ} (hc : 0 ≤ c)
    (h : ∫⁻ x, ‖f x‖ₑ ^ p ∂μ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal c * ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ p ∂ν) :
    eLpNorm f p μ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (c ^ (1 / (p : ℝ))) * eLpNorm g p ν := by
  have hp0 : (p : ℝ≥0∞) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast hp.ne'
  rw [eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal hp0 (ENNReal.natCast_ne_top p) hf,
    eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal hp0 (ENNReal.natCast_ne_top p) hg]
  simp only [ENNReal.toReal_natCast, ENNReal.rpow_natCast]
  have hpos : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 1 / (p : ℝ) := by positivity
  rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_rpow_of_nonneg hc hpos, ← ENNReal.mul_rpow_of_nonneg _ _ hpos]
  exact ENNReal.rpow_le_rpow h hpos

/-- **Density**: a bound for bounded compactly supported functions extends to `L^p`. -/
theorem cs_density {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ)
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a))
    {lam : ℝ} {p : ℝ≥0∞} (hp1 : 1 ≤ p) {K : ℝ≥0∞}
    (hcore : ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, StronglyMeasurable g → ∀ N : ℝ, (∀ y, ‖g y‖ ≤ N) →
      (∀ y, N < |y| → g y = 0) → eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam g) p volume ≤ K * eLpNorm g p volume)
    (g : ℝ → ℂ) (hg : MemLp g p volume) :
    eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam g) p volume ≤ K * eLpNorm g p volume := by
  obtain ⟨R, hR0, hR⟩ := cs_amp_ball ha_supp
  obtain ⟨Ma, hMa0, hMa⟩ : ∃ Ma, 0 ≤ Ma ∧ ∀ s u, ‖a s u‖ ≤ Ma := by
    obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := ha.bounded_above_of_compact_support ha_supp
    exact ⟨max C 0, le_max_right _ _, fun s u => (hC (s, u)).trans (le_max_left _ _)⟩
  set g' := hg.aestronglyMeasurable.mk g
  have hg'm : StronglyMeasurable g' := hg.aestronglyMeasurable.stronglyMeasurable_mk
  have hgg' : g =ᵐ[volume] g' := hg.aestronglyMeasurable.ae_eq_mk
  have hop : csOp Φ a lam g = csOp Φ a lam g' := by
    funext z
    refine integral_congr_ae ?_
    filter_upwards [hgg'] with y hy
    rw [hy]
  have hnorm : eLpNorm g p volume = eLpNorm g' p volume := eLpNorm_congr_ae hgg'
  have hg' : MemLp g' p volume := hg.ae_eq hgg'
  rw [hop, hnorm]
  -- truncations
  set gn : ℕ → ℝ → ℂ := fun n => {y : ℝ | |y| ≤ n ∧ ‖g' y‖ ≤ n}.indicator g'
  have hS : ∀ n : ℕ, MeasurableSet {y : ℝ | |y| ≤ n ∧ ‖g' y‖ ≤ n} := fun n =>
    (measurableSet_le continuous_abs.measurable measurable_const).inter
      (measurableSet_le hg'm.measurable.norm measurable_const)
  have hgnm : ∀ n, StronglyMeasurable (gn n) := fun n => hg'm.indicator (hS n)
  have hgnb : ∀ n y, ‖gn n y‖ ≤ n := by
    intro n y
    by_cases h : y ∈ {y : ℝ | |y| ≤ n ∧ ‖g' y‖ ≤ n}
    · simp only [gn, Set.indicator_of_mem h]; exact h.2
    · simp [gn, Set.indicator_of_notMem h]
  have hgn0 : ∀ (n : ℕ) (y : ℝ), (n : ℝ) < |y| → gn n y = 0 := by
    intro n y hy
    exact Set.indicator_of_notMem (fun h => absurd h.1 (not_le.mpr hy)) _
  have hgnle : ∀ n y, ‖gn n y‖ ≤ ‖g' y‖ := fun n y => by
    simp only [gn]; exact norm_indicator_le_norm_self _ _
  have hbound : ∀ n, eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam (gn n)) p volume ≤ K * eLpNorm g' p volume := by
    intro n
    refine (hcore (gn n) (hgnm n) n (hgnb n) (hgn0 n)).trans ?_
    gcongr
    exact eLpNorm_mono (hgnm n).aestronglyMeasurable (fun y => hgnle n y)
  -- pointwise convergence
  have hlim : ∀ z, Tendsto (fun n => csOp Φ a lam (gn n) z) atTop (𝓝 (csOp Φ a lam g' z)) := by
    intro z
    have hloc : IntegrableOn g' (Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R)) volume :=
      (hg'.locallyIntegrable hp1).integrableOn_isCompact isCompact_Icc
    refine tendsto_integral_of_dominated_convergence
      (fun y => (Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R)).indicator (fun y => Ma * ‖g' y‖) y) (fun n => ?_)
      ((show IntegrableOn (fun y => Ma * ‖g' y‖) (Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R)) volume from
        hloc.norm.const_mul Ma).integrable_indicator measurableSet_Icc) (fun n => ?_) ?_
    · exact ((csKer_continuous hΦ ha lam).comp (continuous_const.prodMk continuous_id)
        |>.stronglyMeasurable.mul (hgnm n)).aestronglyMeasurable
    · refine Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_
      by_cases hy : y ∈ Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R)
      · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hy, norm_mul]
        exact mul_le_mul (csKer_norm_le hMa lam z y) (hgnle n y) (norm_nonneg _) hMa0
      · rw [Set.indicator_of_notMem hy]
        have : csKer Φ a lam z y = 0 := by
          by_contra hc
          have hmem := hR (subset_tsupport (Function.uncurry a)
            (show ((z.1 - y, z.2) : ℝ × ℝ) ∈ Function.support (Function.uncurry a) from
              csKer_ne_zero hc))
          rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at hmem
          have h1 : |z.1 - y| ≤ R := (norm_fst_le _).trans hmem
          apply hy; constructor <;> linarith [(abs_le.mp h1).1, (abs_le.mp h1).2]
        simp only [csKer] at this
        rw [this, zero_mul, norm_zero]
    · refine Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_
      refine tendsto_const_nhds.congr' ?_
      filter_upwards [Filter.eventually_ge_atTop (⌈max |y| ‖g' y‖⌉₊)] with n hn
      have hn' : max |y| ‖g' y‖ ≤ n := (Nat.le_ceil _).trans (by exact_mod_cast hn)
      have hmem : y ∈ {y : ℝ | |y| ≤ n ∧ ‖g' y‖ ≤ n} :=
        ⟨(le_max_left _ _).trans hn', (le_max_right _ _).trans hn'⟩
      simp only [gn, Set.indicator_of_mem hmem]
  have hfatou := Lp.eLpNorm_lim_le_liminf_eLpNorm (p := p)
    (fun n => csOp_aestronglyMeasurable hΦ ha lam (hgnm n)) (csOp Φ a lam g')
    (csOp_aestronglyMeasurable hΦ ha lam hg'm)
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hlim)
  exact hfatou.trans (Filter.liminf_le_of_frequently_le' (Filter.Frequently.of_forall hbound))

/-- **The `L²` estimate**: `‖T_λ g‖_{L²(ℝ²)} ≤ C λ^{-1/2} ‖g‖_{L²(ℝ)}` for `λ ≥ 1`. -/
theorem csOp_L2 {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {α β : ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ)
    (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a))
    (hs : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β) (hΦ' : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, deriv Φ s ≠ 0) :
    ∃ C, ∀ lam ≥ 1, ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, MemLp g 2 volume →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam g) 2 volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (C * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ))) * eLpNorm g 2 volume := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := cs_L2_core hΦ ha ha_supp hs hΦ'
  refine ⟨C ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ), fun lam hlam g hg => ?_⟩
  have hlam0 : 0 < lam := by linarith
  refine cs_density hΦ.continuous ha.continuous ha_supp (by norm_num) (fun g hgm N hgN hg0 => ?_)
    g hg
  have := cs_eLpNorm_le_of_lintegral (p := 2) (csOp_aestronglyMeasurable hΦ.continuous
    ha.continuous lam hgm) hgm.aestronglyMeasurable (by norm_num) (by positivity)
    (hC lam hlam0 g hgm N hgN hg0)
  convert this using 3
  rw [Real.div_rpow hC0 hlam0.le, Real.rpow_neg hlam0.le]
  norm_num [div_eq_mul_inv]


/-! ### The kernel of `T₂* T₂` for the squared operator -/

/-- The kernel of `T₂* T₂`, where `T₂ G (z) = ∫ e^{iλ u (Φ(x-y₁)+Φ(x-y₂))} a a G(y₁,y₂)`. -/
def csK2 (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=
  ∫ z, csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 *
    (starRingEnd ℂ) (csKer Φ b lam z w'.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w'.2)

theorem csKer_shift (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) (y y' : ℝ) :
    csKer Φ b lam (z + ((y, 0) : ℝ × ℝ)) y' =
      cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 + (y - y')) : ℝ) : ℂ)) * b (z.1 + (y - y')) z.2 := by
  have e2 : (z + ((y, 0) : ℝ × ℝ)).1 - y' = z.1 + (y - y') := by simp; ring
  have e3 : (z + ((y, 0) : ℝ × ℝ)).2 = z.2 := by simp
  simp only [csKer, e2, e3]
  congr 2; push_cast; ring

theorem csK2_eq (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) :
    csK2 Φ b lam w w' = ∫ z : ℝ × ℝ,
      cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * (Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) + Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w.2)) -
        Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) - Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2))) : ℝ) : ℂ)) *
      (b (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) z.2 * b (z.1 + (w.1 - w.2)) z.2 *
        (starRingEnd ℂ) (b (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) z.2) *
        (starRingEnd ℂ) (b (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2)) z.2)) := by
  unfold csK2
  rw [← integral_add_right_eq_self _ ((w.1, 0) : ℝ × ℝ)]
  congr 1; funext z
  simp only [csKer_shift, map_mul, cs_conj_cexp]
  have : cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * (Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) + Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w.2)) -
        Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) - Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2))) : ℝ) : ℂ)) =
      cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) : ℝ) : ℂ)) *
      cexp (I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w.2)) : ℝ) : ℂ)) *
      cexp (-(I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) : ℝ) : ℂ))) *
      cexp (-(I * ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2)) : ℝ) : ℂ))) := by
    rw [← Complex.exp_add, ← Complex.exp_add, ← Complex.exp_add]; congr 1; push_cast; ring
  rw [this]; ring

theorem csK2_triv {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {Mb R : ℝ} (hMb0 : 0 ≤ Mb)
    (hMb : ∀ s u, ‖b s u‖ ≤ Mb) (hR : tsupport (Function.uncurry b) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R)
    (lam : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) :
    ‖csK2 Φ b lam w w'‖ ≤ Mb ^ 4 * (volume (Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R)).toReal ∧
      (2 * R < |w.1 - w'.1| → csK2 Φ b lam w w' = 0) := by
  have hmem : ∀ s u, b s u ≠ 0 → |s| ≤ R ∧ |u| ≤ R := by
    intro s u h
    have := hR (subset_tsupport (Function.uncurry b) (show ((s, u) : ℝ × ℝ) ∈
      Function.support (Function.uncurry b) from h))
    rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at this
    exact ⟨(norm_fst_le _).trans this, (norm_snd_le _).trans this⟩
  rw [csK2_eq]
  constructor
  · refine cs_norm_integral_le (by positivity) (fun z => ?_) (fun z hz => ?_)
    · rw [norm_mul, Complex.norm_exp_I_mul_ofReal, one_mul, norm_mul, norm_mul, norm_mul,
        Complex.norm_conj, Complex.norm_conj]
      have h1 := hMb (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) z.2
      have h2 := hMb (z.1 + (w.1 - w.2)) z.2
      have h3 := hMb (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) z.2
      have h4 := hMb (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2)) z.2
      calc _ ≤ Mb * Mb * Mb * Mb := by gcongr
        _ = Mb ^ 4 := by ring
    · have h0 : b (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) z.2 ≠ 0 := fun h => hz (by rw [h]; ring)
      have := hmem _ _ h0
      simp only [sub_self, add_zero] at this
      rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right]
      exact cs_norm_prod_le (by rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]; exact this.1)
        (by rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]; exact this.2)
  · intro hw
    have : ∀ z : ℝ × ℝ, b (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) z.2 * b (z.1 + (w.1 - w.2)) z.2 *
        (starRingEnd ℂ) (b (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) z.2) *
        (starRingEnd ℂ) (b (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2)) z.2) = 0 := by
      intro z
      by_contra hc
      have h0 : b (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) z.2 ≠ 0 := fun h => hc (by rw [h]; ring)
      have h3 : b (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) z.2 ≠ 0 := fun h => hc (by rw [h]; simp)
      have hA := (hmem _ _ h0).1
      have hB := (hmem _ _ h3).1
      simp only [sub_self, add_zero] at hA
      have : |w.1 - w'.1| ≤ 2 * R := by
        calc |w.1 - w'.1| = |(z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) - z.1| := by ring_nf
          _ ≤ |z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)| + |z.1| := abs_sub _ _
          _ ≤ 2 * R := by linarith
      linarith
    simp only [this, mul_zero, integral_zero]

/-- The constants depending only on `Φ` and `[α, β]` for the geometric lemma. -/
theorem cs_geom_constants {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) {α β c : ℝ} (hαβ : α < β)
    (hc : 0 < c)
    (hND : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, ∀ t ∈ Icc α β,
      c * |s - t| ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s|) :
    ∃ M > 0, (∀ k ≤ 7, ∀ x ∈ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1), |iteratedDeriv k Φ x| ≤ M) ∧
      ∃ E₀ > 0, ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, E₀ ≤ deriv Φ s ^ 2 + deriv (deriv Φ) s ^ 2 := by
  obtain ⟨M, hM0, hM⟩ := cs_deriv_bounds hΦ (α - 1) (β + 1)
  have hβα : 0 < β - α := sub_pos.mpr hαβ
  refine ⟨M, hM0, hM, (c * (β - α) / (2 * M)) ^ 2 / 2, by positivity, fun s hs => ?_⟩
  have hI : Icc α β ⊆ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := Icc_subset_Icc (by linarith) (by linarith)
  have h1 : ∀ x ∈ Icc α β, |deriv Φ x| ≤ M := fun x hx => by
    have := hM 1 (by norm_num) x (hI hx); rwa [iteratedDeriv_one] at this
  have h2 : ∀ x ∈ Icc α β, |deriv (deriv Φ) x| ≤ M := fun x hx => by
    have := hM 2 (by norm_num) x (hI hx)
    rwa [iteratedDeriv_succ, iteratedDeriv_one] at this
  -- choose the farther endpoint
  obtain ⟨t, ht, hst⟩ : ∃ t ∈ Icc α β, (β - α) / 2 ≤ |s - t| := by
    by_cases h : s - α ≤ β - s
    · refine ⟨β, ⟨hαβ.le, le_rfl⟩, ?_⟩
      rw [abs_sub_comm, abs_of_nonneg (by linarith [hs.2])]; linarith
    · refine ⟨α, ⟨le_rfl, hαβ.le⟩, ?_⟩
      rw [abs_of_nonneg (by linarith [hs.1])]; linarith
  have key := hND s hs t ht
  have hb : |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s| ≤
      M * (|deriv Φ s| + |deriv (deriv Φ) s|) := by
    calc _ ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t| + |deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s| := abs_sub _ _
      _ = |deriv (deriv Φ) s| * |deriv Φ t| + |deriv (deriv Φ) t| * |deriv Φ s| := by
          rw [abs_mul, abs_mul]
      _ ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s| * M + M * |deriv Φ s| := by
          gcongr
          · exact h1 t ht
          · exact h2 t ht
      _ = _ := by ring
  have hlow : c * (β - α) / (2 * M) ≤ |deriv Φ s| + |deriv (deriv Φ) s| := by
    rw [div_le_iff₀ (by positivity)]
    have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hst hc.le
    nlinarith
  have hsq : (|deriv Φ s| + |deriv (deriv Φ) s|) ^ 2 ≤
      2 * (deriv Φ s ^ 2 + deriv (deriv Φ) s ^ 2) := by
    have := sq_nonneg (|deriv Φ s| - |deriv (deriv Φ) s|)
    rw [← sq_abs (deriv Φ s), ← sq_abs (deriv (deriv Φ) s)]
    nlinarith
  have : (c * (β - α) / (2 * M)) ^ 2 ≤ (|deriv Φ s| + |deriv (deriv Φ) s|) ^ 2 :=
    pow_le_pow_left₀ (by have h' : 0 < β - α := sub_pos.mpr hαβ; positivity) hlow 2
  linarith


theorem cs_tsupport_mem {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {S : Set ℝ} (hS : IsClosed S)
    (hs : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ S) : ∀ p ∈ tsupport (Function.uncurry a), p.1 ∈ S := by
  have : tsupport (Function.uncurry a) ⊆ {p : ℝ × ℝ | p.1 ∈ S} :=
    closure_minimal (fun p hp => hs p.1 p.2 hp) (hS.preimage continuous_fst)
  exact fun p hp => this hp

theorem cs_mem_tsupport_shift' {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {z : ℝ × ℝ} {c : ℝ}
    (h : z ∈ tsupport (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => a (z.1 + c) z.2)) :
    z + (c, 0) ∈ tsupport (Function.uncurry a) := by
  have e : (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => a (z.1 + c) z.2) =
      (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => Function.uncurry a (z + (c, 0))) := by
    funext z; simp [Function.uncurry]
  rw [e, cs_tsupport_translate] at h
  exact h

theorem cs_iteratedDeriv_two (f : ℝ → ℝ) : iteratedDeriv 2 f = deriv (deriv f) := by
  rw [iteratedDeriv_succ, iteratedDeriv_one]

theorem cs_iteratedDeriv_three (f : ℝ → ℝ) :
    iteratedDeriv 3 f = deriv (deriv (deriv f)) := by
  rw [iteratedDeriv_succ, cs_iteratedDeriv_two]

/-- The anisotropic distance `|Δσ| + δ |Δτ|` between `w` and `w'`. -/
def csDv (δ : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ :=
  |(w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2)| + δ * |(w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2)|

/-- The four shifts `x - y₁, x - y₂, x - y₁', x - y₂'` relative to `x - y₁`. -/
def csCv (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) : Fin 4 → ℝ := ![w.1 - w.1, w.1 - w.2, w.1 - w'.1, w.1 - w'.2]

/-- The signs of the four phase terms. -/
def csEv : Fin 4 → ℝ := ![1, 1, -1, -1]

/-- The normalized phase difference of the squared operator. -/
def csPsi4 (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (δ : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) (r : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  (∑ k, csEv k * Φ (r + csCv w w' k)) / csDv δ w w'

theorem csPsi4_iteratedDeriv {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (δ : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ)
    (j : ℕ) (r : ℝ) : iteratedDeriv j (csPsi4 Φ δ w w') r =
      (iteratedDeriv j Φ (r + (w.1 - w.1)) + iteratedDeriv j Φ (r + (w.1 - w.2)) -
        iteratedDeriv j Φ (r + (w.1 - w'.1)) - iteratedDeriv j Φ (r + (w.1 - w'.2))) /
        csDv δ w w' := by
  have := congrFun (cs_iteratedDeriv_shift_sum hΦ csEv (csCv w w') (csDv δ w w') j) r
  have e : csPsi4 Φ δ w w' = fun r => (∑ k, csEv k * Φ (r + csCv w w' k)) / csDv δ w w' := rfl
  rw [e, this]
  simp [csEv, csCv, Fin.sum_univ_four]
  ring

theorem csPsi4_eq {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (δ : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) (r : ℝ) :
    csPsi4 Φ δ w w' r = (Φ (r + (w.1 - w.1)) + Φ (r + (w.1 - w.2)) -
        Φ (r + (w.1 - w'.1)) - Φ (r + (w.1 - w'.2))) / csDv δ w w' := by
  have := csPsi4_iteratedDeriv hΦ δ w w' 0 r
  simpa using this

theorem csPsi4_deriv {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (δ : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) (r : ℝ) :
    deriv (csPsi4 Φ δ w w') r = (deriv Φ (r + (w.1 - w.1)) + deriv Φ (r + (w.1 - w.2)) -
        deriv Φ (r + (w.1 - w'.1)) - deriv Φ (r + (w.1 - w'.2))) / csDv δ w w' := by
  have := csPsi4_iteratedDeriv hΦ δ w w' 1 r
  simpa [iteratedDeriv_one] using this

theorem csPsi4_contDiff {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (δ : ℝ) (w w' : ℝ × ℝ) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (csPsi4 Φ δ w w') :=
  (ContDiff.sum fun _ _ => contDiff_const.mul (hΦ.comp (contDiff_id.add contDiff_const))).div_const
    _

/-- **Kernel bound for the squared operator**: for `w, w'` with `|y₁ - y₂| ≈ δ` (with the same
sign), the kernel of `T₂* T₂` decays anisotropically. -/
theorem cs_L4_kernel {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) {α β c : ℝ} (hαβ : α < β) (hc : 0 < c)
    (hND : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, ∀ t ∈ Icc α β,
      c * |s - t| ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s|) :
    ∃ ℓ₀ > 0, ∀ (b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (p ℓ c₀ : ℝ), 0 ≤ ℓ → ℓ ≤ ℓ₀ → 0 < c₀ →
      ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry b) → HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry b) →
      (∀ s u, b s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β ∩ Icc p (p + ℓ)) → (∀ s u, b s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u|) →
      ∃ C, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ lam, 0 < lam → ∀ δ, 0 < δ → ∀ w w' : ℝ × ℝ,
        δ / 2 ≤ |w.1 - w.2| → |w.1 - w.2| ≤ δ → δ / 2 ≤ |w'.1 - w'.2| → |w'.1 - w'.2| ≤ δ →
        0 < (w.1 - w.2) * (w'.1 - w'.2) →
        ‖csK2 Φ b lam w w'‖ ≤ C * ((1 + (lam * ((w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹ *
          (1 + (lam * δ * ((w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹) := by
  obtain ⟨M, hM0, hM, E₀, hE₀, hE⟩ := cs_geom_constants hΦ hαβ hc hND
  refine ⟨min (E₀ / (4 * M ^ 2)) (min (c / (4 * M ^ 2)) (c * E₀ / (128 * M ^ 4))),
    by positivity, ?_⟩
  intro b p ℓ c₀ hℓ0 hℓ hc₀ hb hb_supp hsb hub
  have hℓ1 : 4 * M ^ 2 * ℓ ≤ E₀ := by
    have := hℓ.trans (min_le_left _ _)
    rw [le_div_iff₀ (by positivity)] at this; linarith
  have hℓ2 : 4 * M ^ 2 * ℓ ≤ c := by
    have := hℓ.trans ((min_le_right _ _).trans (min_le_left _ _))
    rw [le_div_iff₀ (by positivity)] at this; linarith
  have hℓ3 : 128 * M ^ 4 * ℓ ≤ c * E₀ := by
    have := hℓ.trans ((min_le_right _ _).trans (min_le_right _ _))
    rw [le_div_iff₀ (by positivity)] at this; linarith
  obtain ⟨Mb, hMb0, hMb⟩ := cs_amp_bound hb hb_supp
  obtain ⟨R, hR0, hR⟩ := cs_amp_ball hb_supp
  -- derivatives of `Φ`
  have hΦ1 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (deriv Φ) := (contDiff_infty_iff_deriv.mp hΦ).2
  have hΦ2 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (deriv (deriv Φ)) := (contDiff_infty_iff_deriv.mp hΦ1).2
  have h₀ : ∀ x, HasDerivAt Φ (deriv Φ x) x := fun x =>
    (hΦ.differentiable (by simp) x).hasDerivAt
  have h₁ : ∀ x, HasDerivAt (deriv Φ) (deriv (deriv Φ) x) x := fun x =>
    (hΦ1.differentiable (by simp) x).hasDerivAt
  have h₂ : ∀ x, HasDerivAt (deriv (deriv Φ)) (deriv (deriv (deriv Φ)) x) x := fun x =>
    (hΦ2.differentiable (by simp) x).hasDerivAt
  set T : Set ℝ := Icc α β ∩ Icc p (p + ℓ) with hTdef
  have hT : Convex ℝ T := (convex_Icc _ _).inter (convex_Icc _ _)
  have hTc : IsClosed T := isClosed_Icc.inter isClosed_Icc
  have hTI : T ⊆ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := fun x hx =>
    ⟨by linarith [hx.1.1], by linarith [hx.1.2]⟩
  have hM1 : ∀ x ∈ T, |deriv Φ x| ≤ M := fun x hx => by
    have := hM 1 (by norm_num) x (hTI hx); rwa [iteratedDeriv_one] at this
  have hM2 : ∀ x ∈ T, |deriv (deriv Φ) x| ≤ M := fun x hx => by
    have := hM 2 (by norm_num) x (hTI hx); rwa [cs_iteratedDeriv_two] at this
  have hM3 : ∀ x ∈ T, |deriv (deriv (deriv Φ)) x| ≤ M := fun x hx => by
    have := hM 3 (by norm_num) x (hTI hx); rwa [cs_iteratedDeriv_three] at this
  have hNDT : ∀ s ∈ T, ∀ t ∈ T,
      c * |s - t| ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s| :=
    fun s hs t ht => hND s hs.1 t ht.1
  have hET : ∀ s ∈ T, E₀ ≤ deriv Φ s ^ 2 + deriv (deriv Φ) s ^ 2 := fun s hs => hE s hs.1
  have hdiam : ∀ x ∈ T, ∀ y ∈ T, |x - y| ≤ ℓ := fun x hx y hy => by
    rw [abs_le]; constructor <;> linarith [hx.2.1, hx.2.2, hy.2.1, hy.2.2]
  obtain ⟨κ₀, hκ₀e⟩ : ∃ κ, κ = min (E₀ / 4) (M ^ 2) / ((1 + 16 * M ^ 2 / c) * M) :=
    ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hκ₀ : 0 < κ₀ := by rw [hκ₀e]; positivity
  obtain ⟨q₀, hq₀e⟩ : ∃ q, q = min (c₀ ^ 2) 1 * (κ₀ ^ 2 / 2) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hq₀ : 0 < q₀ / 2 := by rw [hq₀e]; positivity
  have hsuppT := cs_tsupport_mem hTc hsb
  have hsuppu := cs_tsupport_u hub
  -- the index type
  let ι := {q : ℝ × ℝ × (ℝ × ℝ) × (ℝ × ℝ) // 0 < q.1 ∧ 0 < q.2.1 ∧
    (q.2.1 / 2 ≤ |q.2.2.1.1 - q.2.2.1.2| ∧ |q.2.2.1.1 - q.2.2.1.2| ≤ q.2.1) ∧
    (q.2.1 / 2 ≤ |q.2.2.2.1 - q.2.2.2.2| ∧ |q.2.2.2.1 - q.2.2.2.2| ≤ q.2.1) ∧
    0 < (q.2.2.1.1 - q.2.2.1.2) * (q.2.2.2.1 - q.2.2.2.2) ∧ 0 < csDv q.2.1 q.2.2.1 q.2.2.2}
  let ψ : ι → ℝ → ℝ := fun q => csPsi4 Φ q.1.2.1 q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2
  let U : ι → Set (ℝ × ℝ) := fun q => {z : ℝ × ℝ | |z.2| < R + 1} ∩
    (⋂ k : Fin 4, (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => z.1 + csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 k) ⁻¹' Ioo (α - 1) (β + 1)) ∩
    {z | q₀ / 2 < ‖csQ (ψ q) z‖}
  have hψs : ∀ q, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (ψ q) := fun q => csPsi4_contDiff hΦ _ _ _
  have hQc : ∀ q, Continuous (csQ (ψ q)) := fun q => by
    have h1 : Continuous (ψ q) := (hψs q).continuous
    have h2 : Continuous (deriv (ψ q)) := (hψs q).continuous_deriv (by simp)
    unfold csQ; fun_prop
  have hU : ∀ q, IsOpen (U q) := fun q =>
    ((isOpen_lt (by fun_prop) continuous_const).inter (isOpen_iInter_of_finite fun k =>
      isOpen_Ioo.preimage (by fun_prop))).inter (isOpen_lt continuous_const (hQc q).norm)
  have hUmem : ∀ q, ∀ z ∈ U q, ∀ k : Fin 4,
      z.1 + csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 k ∈ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := by
    intro q z hz k
    have := Set.mem_iInter.mp hz.1.2 k
    exact ⟨this.1.le, this.2.le⟩
  have hUR : ∀ q, ∀ z ∈ U q, |z.2| ≤ R + 1 := fun q z hz => hz.1.1.le
  have hQ : ∀ q, ∀ z ∈ U q, q₀ / 2 ≤ ‖csQ (ψ q) z‖ := fun q z hz => hz.2.le
  -- derivative bounds for the normalized phase
  have hψb : ∃ C, ∀ q, ∀ j ≤ 5, ∀ z ∈ U q, |iteratedDeriv j (ψ q) z.1| ≤ C := by
    refine ⟨M, fun q j hj z hz => ?_⟩
    obtain ⟨⟨lam, δ, w, w'⟩, hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩ := q
    simp only at hlam hδ hw1 hw2 hw1' hw2' hsg hD
    have hk := hUmem _ z hz
    have hk0 : z.1 + (w.1 - w.1) ∈ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := hk 0
    have hk1 : z.1 + (w.1 - w.2) ∈ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := hk 1
    have hk2 : z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1) ∈ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := hk 2
    have hk3 : z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2) ∈ Icc (α - 1) (β + 1) := hk 3
    simp only [ψ]
    rw [csPsi4_iteratedDeriv hΦ, abs_div, abs_of_pos hD, div_le_iff₀ hD]
    have eb : z.1 + (w.1 - w.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) = w.1 - w.2 := by ring
    have eb' : z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) = w'.1 - w'.2 := by ring
    have hup := cs_upper (f := iteratedDeriv j Φ) (convex_Icc (α - 1) (β + 1))
      (cs_iteratedDeriv_differentiable hΦ j)
      (by rw [← iteratedDeriv_succ]; exact cs_iteratedDeriv_differentiable hΦ (j + 1))
      (M₁ := M) (M₂ := M)
      (fun x hx => by rw [← iteratedDeriv_succ]; exact hM (j + 1) (by omega) x hx)
      (fun x hx => by
        rw [← iteratedDeriv_succ, ← iteratedDeriv_succ]; exact hM (j + 2) (by omega) x hx)
      hk0 hk1 hk2 hk3 (δ := δ) (by rw [eb]; exact hw2) (by rw [eb']; exact hw2')
    have e1 : z.1 + (w.1 - w.1) + (z.1 + (w.1 - w.2)) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1) +
        (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2))) = -((w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2)) := by ring
    have e2 : z.1 + (w.1 - w.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2) -
        (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1))) = (w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2) := by ring
    rw [e1, e2, abs_neg] at hup
    calc _ ≤ _ := hup
      _ = M * csDv δ w w' := by simp only [csDv]; ring
  -- the amplitudes
  let B : ι → ℝ × ℝ → ℂ := fun q z =>
    b (z.1 + csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 0) z.2 * b (z.1 + csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 1) z.2 *
      (starRingEnd ℂ) (b (z.1 + csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 2) z.2) *
      (starRingEnd ℂ) (b (z.1 + csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 3) z.2)
  have hB : csGood U 4 B := by
    have hc1 := cs_conj_contDiff hb
    have hc2 := cs_conj_hasCompactSupport hb_supp
    have t0 := csGood_translate (U := U) 4 (Function.uncurry b)
      (fun q => ((csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 0 : ℝ), (0 : ℝ))) hb hb_supp
    have t1 := csGood_translate (U := U) 4 (Function.uncurry b)
      (fun q => ((csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 1 : ℝ), (0 : ℝ))) hb hb_supp
    have t2 := csGood_translate (U := U) 4 _
      (fun q => ((csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 2 : ℝ), (0 : ℝ))) hc1 hc2
    have t3 := csGood_translate (U := U) 4 _
      (fun q => ((csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 3 : ℝ), (0 : ℝ))) hc1 hc2
    refine csGood_congr hU 4 (fun q z _ => ?_)
      (csGood_mul hU 4 (csGood_mul hU 4 (csGood_mul hU 4 t0 t1) t2) t3)
    simp [B, Function.uncurry]
  have hBsupp : ∀ q, ∀ z ∈ tsupport (B q), ∀ k : Fin 4,
      z.1 + csCv q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2 k ∈ T ∧ c₀ ≤ |z.2| ∧ |z.2| ≤ R := by
    intro q z hz k
    have hz012 := tsupport_mul_subset_left hz
    have hz3 := tsupport_mul_subset_right hz
    have hz01 := tsupport_mul_subset_left hz012
    have hz2 := tsupport_mul_subset_right hz012
    have hz0 := tsupport_mul_subset_left hz01
    have hz1 := tsupport_mul_subset_right hz01
    have m0 := cs_mem_tsupport_shift' hz0
    have m1 := cs_mem_tsupport_shift' hz1
    have m2 := cs_mem_tsupport_shift hz2
    have m3 := cs_mem_tsupport_shift hz3
    have hu := hsuppu _ m0
    have hRz := hR m0
    rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at hRz
    have hu' : |z.2| ≤ R := by
      have := (norm_snd_le _).trans hRz; simpa using this
    simp only [Prod.snd_add, add_zero] at hu
    refine ⟨?_, hu, hu'⟩
    fin_cases k
    · simpa using hsuppT _ m0
    · simpa using hsuppT _ m1
    · simpa using hsuppT _ m2
    · simpa using hsuppT _ m3
  have hBU : ∀ q, tsupport (B q) ⊆ U q := by
    intro q z hz
    obtain ⟨⟨lam, δ, w, w'⟩, hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩ := q
    simp only at hlam hδ hw1 hw2 hw1' hw2' hsg hD
    have hs := hBsupp _ z hz
    refine ⟨⟨(show |z.2| < R + 1 by linarith [(hs 0).2.2]), Set.mem_iInter.mpr fun k => ?_⟩, ?_⟩
    · have hx := (hs k).1
      rw [hTdef] at hx
      exact ⟨by linarith [hx.1.1], by linarith [hx.1.2]⟩
    · have m0 : z.1 + (w.1 - w.1) ∈ T := (hs 0).1
      have m1 : z.1 + (w.1 - w.2) ∈ T := (hs 1).1
      have m2 : z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1) ∈ T := (hs 2).1
      have m3 : z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2) ∈ T := (hs 3).1
      have hgeo := cs_geom_lower h₀ h₁ h₂ hT hM0 hc hM1 hM2 hM3 hNDT hET hdiam hℓ1 hℓ2 hℓ3
        m0 m1 m2 m3 (δ := δ)
        (by rw [show z.1 + (w.1 - w.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) = w.1 - w.2 by ring]; exact hw1)
        (by rw [show z.1 + (w.1 - w.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) = w.1 - w.2 by ring]; exact hw2)
        (by rw [show z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) = w'.1 - w'.2 by ring]
            exact hw1')
        (by rw [show z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) = w'.1 - w'.2 by ring]
            exact hw2')
        (by rw [show z.1 + (w.1 - w.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) = w.1 - w.2 by ring,
              show z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1)) = w'.1 - w'.2 by ring]
            exact hsg)
      have e1 : z.1 + (w.1 - w.1) + (z.1 + (w.1 - w.2)) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1) +
          (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2))) = -((w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2)) := by ring
      have e2 : z.1 + (w.1 - w.2) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w.1)) - (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.2) -
          (z.1 + (w.1 - w'.1))) = (w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2) := by ring
      rw [e1, e2, abs_neg, ← hκ₀e] at hgeo
      have hgeo' : κ₀ ≤ |ψ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩ z.1| +
          |deriv (ψ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩) z.1| := by
        simp only [ψ]
        rw [csPsi4_eq hΦ, csPsi4_deriv hΦ, abs_div, abs_div, abs_of_pos hD, ← add_div,
          le_div_iff₀ hD]
        exact hgeo
      have hsq : κ₀ ^ 2 / 2 ≤ deriv (ψ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩,
          hsg, hD⟩) z.1 ^ 2 + ψ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩
          z.1 ^ 2 := by
        set x := ψ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩ z.1
        set y := deriv (ψ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩) z.1
        have h1 : κ₀ ^ 2 ≤ (|x| + |y|) ^ 2 := pow_le_pow_left₀ hκ₀.le hgeo' 2
        have h2 : (|x| + |y|) ^ 2 ≤ 2 * (y ^ 2 + x ^ 2) := by
          have := sq_nonneg (|x| - |y|)
          rw [← sq_abs x, ← sq_abs y]; nlinarith
        linarith
      have hu2 : c₀ ^ 2 ≤ z.2 ^ 2 := by
        rw [← sq_abs z.2]; exact pow_le_pow_left₀ hc₀.le (hs 0).2.1 2
      have := cs_norm_csQ_ge' (ψ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩)
        z hu2
      have hq : q₀ ≤ ‖csQ (ψ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩)
          z‖ := by
        rw [hq₀e]
        exact (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hsq (by positivity)).trans this
      change q₀ / 2 < _
      have : 0 < q₀ := by linarith
      linarith
  have hBR : ∀ q, tsupport (B q) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R := by
    intro q z hz
    have hz0 := tsupport_mul_subset_left (tsupport_mul_subset_left
      (tsupport_mul_subset_left hz))
    have := hR (cs_mem_tsupport_shift' hz0)
    simpa [csCv, Prod.mk_zero_zero] using this
  obtain ⟨C₁, hC₁⟩ := csKernel_decay U hU hUR (fun q => q.1.1 * csDv q.1.2.1 q.1.2.2.1 q.1.2.2.2)
    (fun q => mul_pos q.2.1 q.2.2.2.2.2.2) ψ hψs hψb hq₀ hQ B hB hBU hBR
  -- the trivial bound
  set C₀ := Mb ^ 4 * (volume (Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R)).toReal
  have hC₀ : 0 ≤ C₀ := by positivity
  refine ⟨4 * max C₀ C₁, by positivity, fun lam hlam δ hδ w w' hw1 hw2 hw1' hw2' hsg => ?_⟩
  have ht : 0 ≤ lam * csDv δ w w' := by
    have : 0 ≤ csDv δ w w' := by unfold csDv; positivity
    positivity
  have hfin := cs_decay_combine ht (K := ‖csK2 Φ b lam w w'‖) (C₀ := C₀) (C₁ := C₁)
    (csK2_triv hMb0 hMb hR lam w w').1 (fun htp => by
      have hD : 0 < csDv δ w w' := by
        by_contra h
        have : csDv δ w w' = 0 := le_antisymm (not_lt.mp h) (by unfold csDv; positivity)
        rw [this, mul_zero] at htp; exact lt_irrefl _ htp
      have := hC₁ ⟨(lam, δ, w, w'), hlam, hδ, ⟨hw1, hw2⟩, ⟨hw1', hw2'⟩, hsg, hD⟩
      rw [csK2_eq]
      convert this using 2
      · congr 1; funext z
        simp only [csPh, B, ψ]
        congr 2
        · rw [csPsi4_eq hΦ]
          have hc : ((csDv δ w w' : ℝ) : ℂ) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast hD.ne'
          push_cast
          field_simp) hC₀
  refine hfin.trans ?_
  gcongr
  rw [← mul_inv]
  apply inv_anti₀ (by positivity)
  have hX : (lam * ((w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2))) ^ 2 ≤ (lam * csDv δ w w') ^ 2 := by
    rw [← sq_abs, abs_mul, abs_of_pos hlam]
    apply pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity)
    unfold csDv
    have : 0 ≤ δ * |(w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2)| := by positivity
    nlinarith
  have hY : (lam * δ * ((w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2))) ^ 2 ≤ (lam * csDv δ w w') ^ 2 := by
    rw [← sq_abs, abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_of_pos hlam, abs_of_pos hδ]
    apply pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity)
    unfold csDv
    have : 0 ≤ |(w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2)| := abs_nonneg _
    nlinarith
  calc (1 + (lam * ((w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2))) ^ 2) *
        (1 + (lam * δ * ((w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2))) ^ 2) ≤
        (1 + (lam * csDv δ w w') ^ 2) * (1 + (lam * csDv δ w w') ^ 2) := by gcongr
    _ = (1 + (lam * csDv δ w w') ^ 2) ^ 2 := by ring


/-! ### Pieces of the squared operator -/

/-- The squared operator `T₂ G (z) = ∫ e^{iλu(Φ(x-y₁)+Φ(x-y₂))} a(x-y₁,u) a(x-y₂,u) G(y₁,y₂)`. -/
def csOp2 (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (G : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=
  ∫ w, csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * G w

theorem csOp_sq (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (g : ℝ → ℂ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) :
    csOp Φ b lam g z ^ 2 = csOp2 Φ b lam (fun w => g w.1 * g w.2) z := by
  have h := integral_prod_mul (μ := (volume : Measure ℝ)) (ν := (volume : Measure ℝ))
    (fun y => csKer Φ b lam z y * g y) (fun y => csKer Φ b lam z y * g y)
  rw [← Measure.volume_eq_prod] at h
  calc csOp Φ b lam g z ^ 2 = (∫ y, csKer Φ b lam z y * g y) * ∫ y, csKer Φ b lam z y * g y := by
        rw [sq]; rfl
    _ = _ := h.symm
    _ = csOp2 Φ b lam (fun w => g w.1 * g w.2) z := by
        unfold csOp2; congr 1; funext w; ring

theorem csKer_continuous_comp {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) (lam : ℝ) {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X]
    {f : X → ℝ × ℝ} {g : X → ℝ} (hf : Continuous f) (hg : Continuous g) :
    Continuous (fun x => csKer Φ a lam (f x) (g x)) :=
  (csKer_continuous hΦ ha lam).comp (hf.prodMk hg)

theorem csOp2_stronglyMeasurable {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (hb : Continuous (Function.uncurry b)) (lam : ℝ) {G : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ}
    (hG : StronglyMeasurable G) :
    StronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry fun (z : ℝ × ℝ) (w : ℝ × ℝ) =>
      csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * G w) := by
  have h1 := csKer_continuous_comp hΦ hb lam (X := (ℝ × ℝ) × (ℝ × ℝ)) continuous_fst
    continuous_snd.fst
  have h2 := csKer_continuous_comp hΦ hb lam (X := (ℝ × ℝ) × (ℝ × ℝ)) continuous_fst
    continuous_snd.snd
  exact StronglyMeasurable.mul (h1.mul h2).stronglyMeasurable
    (hG.comp_measurable measurable_snd)

theorem csOp2_aestronglyMeasurable {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (hb : Continuous (Function.uncurry b)) (lam : ℝ) {G : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ}
    (hG : StronglyMeasurable G) : AEStronglyMeasurable (csOp2 Φ b lam G) volume :=
  (StronglyMeasurable.integral_prod_right' (ν := (volume : Measure (ℝ × ℝ)))
    (csOp2_stronglyMeasurable hΦ hb lam hG)).aestronglyMeasurable

theorem cs_tensor_stronglyMeasurable {g : ℝ → ℂ} (hg : StronglyMeasurable g) :
    StronglyMeasurable (fun w : ℝ × ℝ => g w.1 * g w.2) :=
  (hg.comp_measurable measurable_fst).mul (hg.comp_measurable measurable_snd)

/-- The `L²` bound for one piece `G = 1_E (g ⊗ g)` of the squared operator. -/
theorem cs_piece {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (hb : Continuous (Function.uncurry b)) {Mb R : ℝ} (hMb0 : 0 ≤ Mb)
    (hMb : ∀ s u, ‖b s u‖ ≤ Mb) (hR : tsupport (Function.uncurry b) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R)
    (lam : ℝ) {g : ℝ → ℂ} (hg : StronglyMeasurable g) {N : ℝ} (hgN : ∀ y, ‖g y‖ ≤ N)
    (hg0 : ∀ y, N < |y| → g y = 0) {E : Set (ℝ × ℝ)} (hE : MeasurableSet E) {δ : ℝ}
    (hEδ : ∀ w ∈ E, |w.1 - w.2| ≤ δ) (κ : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ × ℝ → ℝ≥0∞)
    (hκm : Measurable (Function.uncurry κ)) (hκs : ∀ w w', κ w w' = κ w' w)
    (hK : ∀ w ∈ E, ∀ w' ∈ E, ‖csK2 Φ b lam w w'‖ₑ ≤ κ w w') {A : ℝ≥0∞}
    (hA : ∀ w ∈ E, ∫⁻ w' in E, κ w w' ≤ A) :
    ∫⁻ z, ‖csOp2 Φ b lam (E.indicator fun w => g w.1 * g w.2) z‖ₑ ^ 2 ≤
      2 * A * (2 * ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ) * ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 4) := by
  have hN : 0 ≤ N := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hgN 0)
  set G : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ := E.indicator fun w => g w.1 * g w.2 with hGdef
  have hGm : StronglyMeasurable G := (cs_tensor_stronglyMeasurable hg).indicator hE
  have hpipe := cs_pipeline (ν := (volume : Measure (ℝ × ℝ)))
    (fun z w => csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2) G
    (csOp2_stronglyMeasurable hΦ hb lam hGm) hGm.measurable (C := Mb * Mb * (N * N))
    (R := R + N)
    (fun z w => by
      rw [norm_mul, norm_mul]
      have h1 : ‖G w‖ ≤ N * N := by
        by_cases hw : w ∈ E
        · rw [hGdef, Set.indicator_of_mem hw, norm_mul]
          exact mul_le_mul (hgN _) (hgN _) (norm_nonneg _) hN
        · rw [hGdef, Set.indicator_of_notMem hw, norm_zero]; positivity
      exact mul_le_mul (mul_le_mul (csKer_norm_le hMb lam z w.1) (csKer_norm_le hMb lam z w.2)
        (norm_nonneg _) hMb0) h1 (norm_nonneg _) (by positivity))
    (fun z w h => by
      have hGw : G w ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by rw [h', mul_zero])
      have hwE : w ∈ E := by
        by_contra hc; exact hGw (by rw [hGdef, Set.indicator_of_notMem hc])
      have hgg : g w.1 * g w.2 ≠ 0 := by rwa [hGdef, Set.indicator_of_mem hwE] at hGw
      have hk1 : csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * g w.1 ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by
        have : csKer Φ b lam z w.1 = 0 ∨ g w.1 = 0 := mul_eq_zero.mp h'
        rcases this with h'' | h''
        · rw [h'']; ring
        · exact absurd (by rw [h'', zero_mul]) hgg)
      have hk2 : csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * g w.2 ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by
        have : csKer Φ b lam z w.2 = 0 ∨ g w.2 = 0 := mul_eq_zero.mp h'
        rcases this with h'' | h''
        · rw [h'']; ring
        · exact absurd (by rw [h'', mul_zero]) hgg)
      obtain ⟨hz, hy1, -⟩ := cs_support_bound hR hg0 hk1
      obtain ⟨-, hy2, -⟩ := cs_support_bound hR hg0 hk2
      exact ⟨hz, cs_norm_prod_le (by rwa [Real.norm_eq_abs]) (by rwa [Real.norm_eq_abs])⟩)
    hE (fun w hw => Set.indicator_of_notMem hw _) κ hκm hκs
    (fun w hw w' hw' => by
      have := hK w hw w' hw'
      exact this) hA
  have hG2 : ∫⁻ w, ‖G w‖ₑ ^ 2 ≤ 2 * ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ) * ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 4 := by
    refine le_trans (lintegral_mono fun w => ?_) (cs_diag_bound hg.measurable δ)
    by_cases hw : w ∈ E
    · rw [hGdef, Set.indicator_of_mem hw, Set.indicator_of_mem (show w ∈ {w : ℝ × ℝ |
        |w.1 - w.2| ≤ δ} from hEδ w hw), enorm_mul, mul_pow]
    · rw [hGdef, Set.indicator_of_notMem hw]; simp
  calc _ ≤ 2 * A * ∫⁻ w, ‖G w‖ₑ ^ 2 := hpipe
    _ ≤ _ := by gcongr

/-- The far piece vanishes: the amplitude forces `|y₁ - y₂| ≤ ℓ`. -/
theorem cs_far_zero {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {p ℓ : ℝ}
    (hs : ∀ s u, b s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc p (p + ℓ)) (lam : ℝ) (G : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ)
    (z : ℝ × ℝ) : csOp2 Φ b lam ({w : ℝ × ℝ | ℓ < |w.1 - w.2|}.indicator G) z = 0 := by
  unfold csOp2
  have : ∀ w : ℝ × ℝ, csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 *
      {w : ℝ × ℝ | ℓ < |w.1 - w.2|}.indicator G w = 0 := by
    intro w
    by_cases hw : ℓ < |w.1 - w.2|
    · by_cases h1 : csKer Φ b lam z w.1 = 0
      · rw [h1]; ring
      by_cases h2 : csKer Φ b lam z w.2 = 0
      · rw [h2]; ring
      have m1 := hs _ _ (csKer_ne_zero h1)
      have m2 := hs _ _ (csKer_ne_zero h2)
      exfalso
      have : |w.1 - w.2| ≤ ℓ := by
        rw [abs_le]; constructor <;> linarith [m1.1, m1.2, m2.1, m2.2]
      linarith
    · rw [Set.indicator_of_notMem (show w ∉ {w : ℝ × ℝ | ℓ < |w.1 - w.2|} from hw)]; ring
  simp [this]

/-- The volume of a strip in `ℝ²`. -/
theorem cs_volume_strip (c ρ δ : ℝ) :
    volume {w' : ℝ × ℝ | |c - w'.1| ≤ ρ ∧ |w'.1 - w'.2| ≤ δ} ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal (2 * ρ) * ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ) := by
  have hm : MeasurableSet {w' : ℝ × ℝ | |c - w'.1| ≤ ρ ∧ |w'.1 - w'.2| ≤ δ} :=
    (measurableSet_le (f := fun w' : ℝ × ℝ => |c - w'.1|) (by fun_prop) measurable_const).inter
      (measurableSet_le (f := fun w' : ℝ × ℝ => |w'.1 - w'.2|) (by fun_prop) measurable_const)
  rw [Measure.volume_eq_prod, Measure.prod_apply hm]
  have : ∀ x : ℝ, volume (Prod.mk x ⁻¹' {w' : ℝ × ℝ | |c - w'.1| ≤ ρ ∧ |w'.1 - w'.2| ≤ δ}) ≤
      (Icc (c - ρ) (c + ρ)).indicator (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ)) x := by
    intro x
    by_cases hx : |c - x| ≤ ρ
    · have hx' : x ∈ Icc (c - ρ) (c + ρ) := by
        rw [abs_le] at hx; constructor <;> linarith [hx.1, hx.2]
      rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hx']
      have e : Prod.mk x ⁻¹' {w' : ℝ × ℝ | |c - w'.1| ≤ ρ ∧ |w'.1 - w'.2| ≤ δ} =
          Icc (x - δ) (x + δ) := by
        ext y; simp only [Set.mem_preimage, mem_ofPred_eq, mem_Icc, abs_le]
        constructor
        · intro h; constructor <;> linarith [h.2.1, h.2.2]
        · intro h; refine ⟨(abs_le.mp hx), ?_, ?_⟩ <;> linarith [h.1, h.2]
      rw [e, Real.volume_Icc]; apply le_of_eq; congr 1; ring
    · have e : Prod.mk x ⁻¹' {w' : ℝ × ℝ | |c - w'.1| ≤ ρ ∧ |w'.1 - w'.2| ≤ δ} = ∅ := by
        ext y; simp only [Set.mem_preimage, mem_ofPred_eq, Set.mem_empty_iff_false, iff_false]
        exact fun h => hx h.1
      rw [e, measure_empty]; exact zero_le
  calc ∫⁻ x, volume (Prod.mk x ⁻¹' {w' : ℝ × ℝ | |c - w'.1| ≤ ρ ∧ |w'.1 - w'.2| ≤ δ}) ≤
        ∫⁻ x, (Icc (c - ρ) (c + ρ)).indicator (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ)) x :=
        lintegral_mono this
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ) * volume (Icc (c - ρ) (c + ρ)) :=
        lintegral_indicator_const measurableSet_Icc _
    _ = _ := by rw [Real.volume_Icc, mul_comm]; congr 2; ring

/-- The telescoping partition of unity in `|y₁ - y₂|`. -/
theorem cs_partition {ℓ : ℝ} (hℓ : 0 < ℓ) (M : ℕ) (d : ℝ) :
    (if ℓ < |d| then (1 : ℂ) else 0) + (if |d| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ (M + 1) then (1 : ℂ) else 0) +
      ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1),
        ((if ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) < d ∧ d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m then (1 : ℂ) else 0) +
          (if ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) < -d ∧ -d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m then (1 : ℂ) else 0)) = 1 := by
  have hstep : ∀ m : ℕ, ((if ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) < d ∧ d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m then (1 : ℂ) else 0) +
      (if ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) < -d ∧ -d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m then (1 : ℂ) else 0)) =
      (if |d| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m then (1 : ℂ) else 0) -
        (if |d| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) then (1 : ℂ) else 0) := by
    intro m
    have hpos : 0 < ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) := by positivity
    have hle : ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m := by
      gcongr
      · norm_num
      · omega
    rcases le_or_gt 0 d with hd | hd
    · rw [abs_of_nonneg hd]
      have hn : ¬ (ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) < -d ∧ -d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m) := fun h => by linarith [h.1]
      rw [ite_eq_right hn]
      by_cases h1 : d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1)
      · rw [ite_eq_right (fun h => by linarith [h.1]), ite_eq_left (h1.trans hle),
          ite_eq_left h1]; ring
      · by_cases h2 : d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m
        · rw [ite_eq_left ⟨lt_of_not_ge h1, h2⟩, ite_eq_left h2, ite_eq_right h1]; ring
        · rw [ite_eq_right (fun h => h2 h.2), ite_eq_right h2, ite_eq_right h1]; ring
    · rw [abs_of_neg hd]
      have hn : ¬ (ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) < d ∧ d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m) := fun h => by linarith [h.1]
      rw [ite_eq_right hn]
      by_cases h1 : -d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1)
      · rw [ite_eq_right (fun h => by linarith [h.1]), ite_eq_left (h1.trans hle),
          ite_eq_left h1]; ring
      · by_cases h2 : -d ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m
        · rw [ite_eq_left ⟨lt_of_not_ge h1, h2⟩, ite_eq_left h2, ite_eq_right h1]; ring
        · rw [ite_eq_right (fun h => h2 h.2), ite_eq_right h2, ite_eq_right h1]; ring
  simp_rw [hstep]
  rw [Finset.sum_range_sub' (fun m => if |d| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m then (1 : ℂ) else 0)]
  simp only [pow_zero, div_one]
  by_cases h : ℓ < |d|
  · rw [ite_eq_left h, ite_eq_right (not_le.mpr h)]
    have : ¬ |d| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ (M + 1) := fun h' => by
      have : ℓ / 2 ^ (M + 1) ≤ ℓ := div_le_self hℓ.le (one_le_pow₀ (by norm_num))
      linarith
    rw [ite_eq_right this]; ring
  · rw [ite_eq_right h, ite_eq_left (not_lt.mp h)]; ring


theorem cs_eLpNorm_two_le {F : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (hF : AEStronglyMeasurable F volume) {c : ℝ}
    (hc : 0 ≤ c) {X : ℝ≥0∞} (h : ∫⁻ z, ‖F z‖ₑ ^ 2 ≤ ENNReal.ofReal c * X) :
    eLpNorm F 2 volume ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (Real.sqrt c) * X ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) := by
  rw [eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal (by norm_num) (by norm_num) hF]
  simp only [ENNReal.toReal_ofNat]
  have e : ∀ z, ‖F z‖ₑ ^ (2 : ℝ) = ‖F z‖ₑ ^ (2 : ℕ) := fun z => by
    rw [← ENNReal.rpow_natCast]; norm_num
  simp_rw [e]
  rw [Real.sqrt_eq_rpow, ← ENNReal.ofReal_rpow_of_nonneg hc (by norm_num),
    ← ENNReal.mul_rpow_of_nonneg _ _ (by norm_num)]
  exact ENNReal.rpow_le_rpow h (by norm_num)

theorem cs_op2_integrable {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (hb : Continuous (Function.uncurry b)) {Mb : ℝ} (hMb0 : 0 ≤ Mb)
    (hMb : ∀ s u, ‖b s u‖ ≤ Mb) (lam : ℝ) (z : ℝ × ℝ) {G : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ}
    (hG : StronglyMeasurable G) {K N : ℝ} (hGK : ∀ w, ‖G w‖ ≤ K)
    (hGN : ∀ w, G w ≠ 0 → ‖w‖ ≤ N) :
    Integrable (fun w : ℝ × ℝ => csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * G w) := by
  have hK : 0 ≤ K := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hGK 0)
  have h1 := csKer_continuous_comp hΦ hb lam (X := ℝ × ℝ) (f := fun _ => z) continuous_const
    continuous_fst
  have h2 := csKer_continuous_comp hΦ hb lam (X := ℝ × ℝ) (f := fun _ => z) continuous_const
    continuous_snd
  refine Integrable.mono' (g := (Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) N).indicator
    (fun _ => Mb * Mb * K)) ((integrableOn_const measure_closedBall_lt_top.ne).integrable_indicator
    measurableSet_closedBall) ((h1.mul h2).stronglyMeasurable.mul hG).aestronglyMeasurable
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun w => ?_)
  by_cases hw : G w = 0
  · rw [hw, mul_zero, norm_zero]
    exact Set.indicator_nonneg (fun _ _ => by positivity) _
  · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem (by rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right]; exact hGN w hw),
      norm_mul, norm_mul]
    exact mul_le_mul (mul_le_mul (csKer_norm_le hMb lam z w.1) (csKer_norm_le hMb lam z w.2)
      (norm_nonneg _) hMb0) (hGK w) (norm_nonneg _) (by positivity)

theorem cs_indicator_tensor_bound {g : ℝ → ℂ} {N : ℝ} (hgN : ∀ y, ‖g y‖ ≤ N)
    (hg0 : ∀ y, N < |y| → g y = 0) (E : Set (ℝ × ℝ)) :
    (∀ w, ‖E.indicator (fun w => g w.1 * g w.2) w‖ ≤ N * N) ∧
      (∀ w, E.indicator (fun w => g w.1 * g w.2) w ≠ 0 → ‖w‖ ≤ N) := by
  have hN : 0 ≤ N := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hgN 0)
  constructor
  · intro w
    by_cases hw : w ∈ E
    · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hw, norm_mul]
      exact mul_le_mul (hgN _) (hgN _) (norm_nonneg _) hN
    · rw [Set.indicator_of_notMem hw, norm_zero]; positivity
  · intro w hw
    have hwE : w ∈ E := by by_contra h; exact hw (Set.indicator_of_notMem h _)
    rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hwE] at hw
    have h1 : g w.1 ≠ 0 := fun h => hw (by rw [h, zero_mul])
    have h2 : g w.2 ≠ 0 := fun h => hw (by rw [h, mul_zero])
    have b1 : |w.1| ≤ N := by by_contra hc; exact h1 (hg0 _ (lt_of_not_ge hc))
    have b2 : |w.2| ≤ N := by by_contra hc; exact h2 (hg0 _ (lt_of_not_ge hc))
    exact cs_norm_prod_le (by rwa [Real.norm_eq_abs]) (by rwa [Real.norm_eq_abs])

/-- The number of dyadic scales: `2^(M+1) > λ` and `M ≤ 1 + log₂ λ`. -/
theorem cs_log_count {lam : ℝ} (hlam : 2 ≤ lam) :
    lam < 2 ^ (Nat.log 2 ⌈lam⌉₊ + 1) ∧
      (2 * (Nat.log 2 ⌈lam⌉₊ : ℝ) + 4) ≤ 8 / Real.log 2 * Real.log lam := by
  have hl0 : 0 < lam := by linarith
  have hceil : ⌈lam⌉₊ ≠ 0 := by
    have : 0 < ⌈lam⌉₊ := Nat.ceil_pos.mpr hl0
    omega
  constructor
  · have h1 := Nat.lt_pow_succ_log_self (b := 2) (by norm_num) ⌈lam⌉₊
    have h2 : lam ≤ ⌈lam⌉₊ := Nat.le_ceil lam
    calc lam ≤ ⌈lam⌉₊ := h2
      _ < ((2 ^ (Nat.log 2 ⌈lam⌉₊).succ : ℕ) : ℝ) := by exact_mod_cast h1
      _ = 2 ^ (Nat.log 2 ⌈lam⌉₊ + 1) := by push_cast; rfl
  · set M := Nat.log 2 ⌈lam⌉₊
    have h1 : (2 : ℝ) ^ M ≤ 2 * lam := by
      have := Nat.pow_log_le_self 2 hceil
      have h3 : (⌈lam⌉₊ : ℝ) < lam + 1 := Nat.ceil_lt_add_one hl0.le
      calc (2 : ℝ) ^ M = ((2 ^ M : ℕ) : ℝ) := by push_cast; rfl
        _ ≤ ⌈lam⌉₊ := by exact_mod_cast this
        _ ≤ 2 * lam := by linarith
    have hlog2 : 0 < Real.log 2 := Real.log_pos (by norm_num)
    have h4 : (M : ℝ) * Real.log 2 ≤ Real.log 2 + Real.log lam := by
      rw [← Real.log_pow, ← Real.log_mul (by norm_num) hl0.ne']
      exact Real.log_le_log (by positivity) h1
    have h5 : Real.log 2 ≤ Real.log lam := Real.log_le_log (by norm_num) hlam
    rw [div_mul_eq_mul_div, le_div_iff₀ hlog2]
    nlinarith

/-- **Localized `L⁴` core estimate** for bounded compactly supported `g`, in the form
`‖(T g)²‖₂ ≲ λ⁻¹ log λ ‖g‖₄²`. -/
theorem cs_L4_local {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) {α β c : ℝ} (hαβ : α < β) (hc : 0 < c)
    (hND : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, ∀ t ∈ Icc α β,
      c * |s - t| ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s|) :
    ∃ ℓ₀ > 0, ∀ (b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (p ℓ c₀ : ℝ), 0 < ℓ → ℓ ≤ ℓ₀ → ℓ ≤ 1 → 0 < c₀ →
      ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry b) → HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry b) →
      (∀ s u, b s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β ∩ Icc p (p + ℓ)) → (∀ s u, b s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u|) →
      ∃ C, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ lam, 2 ≤ lam → ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, StronglyMeasurable g → ∀ N : ℝ,
        (∀ y, ‖g y‖ ≤ N) → (∀ y, N < |y| → g y = 0) →
        eLpNorm (fun z => csOp Φ b lam g z ^ 2) 2 volume ≤
          ENNReal.ofReal (C * Real.log lam / lam) * (∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 4) ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) := by
  obtain ⟨ℓ₀, hℓ₀, hker⟩ := cs_L4_kernel hΦ hαβ hc hND
  refine ⟨ℓ₀, hℓ₀, ?_⟩
  intro b p ℓ c₀ hℓ hℓℓ₀ hℓ1 hc₀ hb hb_supp hsb hub
  obtain ⟨C₁, hC₁0, hC₁⟩ := hker b p ℓ c₀ hℓ.le hℓℓ₀ hc₀ hb hb_supp hsb hub
  obtain ⟨Mb, hMb0, hMb⟩ := cs_amp_bound hb hb_supp
  obtain ⟨R, hR0, hR⟩ := cs_amp_ball hb_supp
  have hbc : Continuous (Function.uncurry b) := hb.continuous
  have hΦc : Continuous Φ := hΦ.continuous
  set C₀ := Mb ^ 4 * (volume (Metric.closedBall (0 : ℝ × ℝ) R)).toReal
  have hC₀ : 0 ≤ C₀ := by positivity
  set K₁ := max (4 * C₁ * Real.pi ^ 2) (64 * C₀ * R)
  have hK₁ : 0 ≤ K₁ := le_max_of_le_right (by positivity)
  refine ⟨8 / Real.log 2 * Real.sqrt K₁, by
    have := Real.log_pos (by norm_num : (1 : ℝ) < 2); positivity, ?_⟩
  intro lam hlam g hg N hgN hg0
  have hl0 : 0 < lam := by linarith
  obtain ⟨hM1, hM2⟩ := cs_log_count hlam
  set M := Nat.log 2 ⌈lam⌉₊
  set X := ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 4
  set f : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ := fun w => g w.1 * g w.2 with hfdef
  -- the pieces
  let Pp : ℕ → Set (ℝ × ℝ) := fun m =>
    {w | ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) < w.1 - w.2 ∧ w.1 - w.2 ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m}
  let Pm : ℕ → Set (ℝ × ℝ) := fun m =>
    {w | ℓ / 2 ^ (m + 1) < -(w.1 - w.2) ∧ -(w.1 - w.2) ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m}
  let Pr : Set (ℝ × ℝ) := {w | |w.1 - w.2| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ (M + 1)}
  let Pf : Set (ℝ × ℝ) := {w | ℓ < |w.1 - w.2|}
  have hmeas_d : Measurable (fun w : ℝ × ℝ => w.1 - w.2) := by fun_prop
  have hPp : ∀ m, MeasurableSet (Pp m) := fun m =>
    (measurableSet_lt measurable_const hmeas_d).inter (measurableSet_le hmeas_d measurable_const)
  have hPm : ∀ m, MeasurableSet (Pm m) := fun m =>
    (measurableSet_lt measurable_const hmeas_d.neg).inter
      (measurableSet_le hmeas_d.neg measurable_const)
  have hPr : MeasurableSet Pr := measurableSet_le hmeas_d.abs measurable_const
  -- decomposition of `g ⊗ g`
  have hPf : MeasurableSet Pf := measurableSet_lt measurable_const hmeas_d.abs
  -- decomposition of `g ⊗ g`
  have hdec : ∀ w, f w = Pf.indicator f w + Pr.indicator f w +
      ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1), ((Pp m).indicator f w + (Pm m).indicator f w) := by
    intro w
    have := cs_partition hℓ M (w.1 - w.2)
    simp only [Set.indicator_apply, Pf, Pr, Pp, Pm, mem_ofPred_eq]
    conv_lhs => rw [← one_mul (f w), ← this]
    simp only [add_mul, Finset.sum_mul, ite_mul, one_mul, zero_mul]
  have hfm : StronglyMeasurable f := cs_tensor_stronglyMeasurable hg
  have hint : ∀ E : Set (ℝ × ℝ), MeasurableSet E → ∀ z : ℝ × ℝ,
      Integrable (fun w : ℝ × ℝ => csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 *
        E.indicator f w) := fun E hE z =>
    cs_op2_integrable hΦc hbc hMb0 hMb lam z (hfm.indicator hE)
      (cs_indicator_tensor_bound hgN hg0 E).1 (cs_indicator_tensor_bound hgN hg0 E).2
  -- the square as a sum of pieces
  have hsq : (fun z => csOp Φ b lam g z ^ 2) =
      (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam (Pf.indicator f) z) + (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam (Pr.indicator f) z) +
      ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1), ((fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam ((Pp m).indicator f) z) +
        (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam ((Pm m).indicator f) z)) := by
    funext z
    rw [csOp_sq]
    simp only [Pi.add_apply, Finset.sum_apply]
    unfold csOp2
    have e : (fun w : ℝ × ℝ => csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * f w) =
        fun w => csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * Pf.indicator f w +
          csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * Pr.indicator f w +
          ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1),
            (csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * (Pp m).indicator f w +
              csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2 * (Pm m).indicator f w) := by
      funext w
      rw [hdec w, mul_add, mul_add, Finset.mul_sum]
      simp only [mul_add]
    rw [show (fun w : ℝ × ℝ => g w.1 * g w.2) = f from rfl, e]
    set K : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ := fun w => csKer Φ b lam z w.1 * csKer Φ b lam z w.2
    have hI : ∀ E : Set (ℝ × ℝ), MeasurableSet E →
        Integrable (fun w => K w * E.indicator f w) := fun E hE => hint E hE z
    have hIS : Integrable (fun w => ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1),
        (K w * (Pp m).indicator f w + K w * (Pm m).indicator f w)) :=
      integrable_finsetSum _ fun m _ => (show Integrable (fun w =>
        K w * (Pp m).indicator f w + K w * (Pm m).indicator f w) from
        (hI _ (hPp m)).add (hI _ (hPm m)))
    have h1 : ∫ w, (K w * Pf.indicator f w + K w * Pr.indicator f w +
        ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1), (K w * (Pp m).indicator f w + K w * (Pm m).indicator f w)) =
        (∫ w, (K w * Pf.indicator f w + K w * Pr.indicator f w)) +
          ∫ w, ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1),
            (K w * (Pp m).indicator f w + K w * (Pm m).indicator f w) :=
      integral_add (show Integrable (fun w => K w * Pf.indicator f w + K w * Pr.indicator f w)
        from (hI _ hPf).add (hI _ hPr)) hIS
    have h2 : ∫ w, (K w * Pf.indicator f w + K w * Pr.indicator f w) =
        (∫ w, K w * Pf.indicator f w) + ∫ w, K w * Pr.indicator f w :=
      integral_add (hI _ hPf) (hI _ hPr)
    have h3 : ∫ w, ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1),
        (K w * (Pp m).indicator f w + K w * (Pm m).indicator f w) =
        ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1), ∫ w,
          (K w * (Pp m).indicator f w + K w * (Pm m).indicator f w) :=
      integral_finsetSum _ fun m _ => (show Integrable (fun w =>
        K w * (Pp m).indicator f w + K w * (Pm m).indicator f w) from
        (hI _ (hPp m)).add (hI _ (hPm m)))
    rw [h1, h2, h3]
    congr 1
    refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun m _ => ?_
    exact integral_add (hI _ (hPp m)) (hI _ (hPm m))
  -- the far piece vanishes
  have hfar : (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam (Pf.indicator f) z) = 0 := by
    funext z
    exact cs_far_zero (fun s u h => (hsb s u h).2) lam f z
  -- the bound for one piece
  obtain ⟨B, hBdef⟩ : ∃ B, B = ENNReal.ofReal (Real.sqrt K₁ / lam) * X ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) :=
    ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hpieceB : ∀ E : Set (ℝ × ℝ), MeasurableSet E → ∀ c' : ℝ, 0 ≤ c' → c' ≤ K₁ →
      ∫⁻ z, ‖csOp2 Φ b lam (E.indicator f) z‖ₑ ^ 2 ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (c' / lam ^ 2) * X →
      eLpNorm (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam (E.indicator f) z) 2 volume ≤ B := by
    intro E hE c' hc' hcK h
    refine (cs_eLpNorm_two_le (csOp2_aestronglyMeasurable hΦc hbc lam (hfm.indicator hE))
      (by positivity) h).trans ?_
    rw [hBdef]; gcongr
    rw [Real.sqrt_div' _ (by positivity), Real.sqrt_sq hl0.le]
    gcongr
  -- the dyadic pieces
  have hdyad : ∀ (m : ℕ) (E : Set (ℝ × ℝ)), MeasurableSet E →
      (∀ w ∈ E, ℓ / 2 ^ m / 2 ≤ |w.1 - w.2| ∧ |w.1 - w.2| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m) →
      (∀ w ∈ E, ∀ w' ∈ E, 0 < (w.1 - w.2) * (w'.1 - w'.2)) →
      eLpNorm (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam (E.indicator f) z) 2 volume ≤ B := by
    intro m E hE hEδ hEs
    set δ := ℓ / 2 ^ m
    have hδ : 0 < δ := by positivity
    have hpc := cs_piece hΦc hbc hMb0 hMb hR lam hg hgN hg0 hE (δ := δ)
      (fun w hw => (hEδ w hw).2)
      (fun w w' => ENNReal.ofReal (C₁ * ((1 + (lam * ((w.1 + w.2) - (w'.1 + w'.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹ *
        (1 + (lam * δ * ((w.1 - w.2) - (w'.1 - w'.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹)))
      (ENNReal.measurable_ofReal.comp (by fun_prop))
      (fun w w' => by congr 2; congr 1 <;> congr 2 <;> ring)
      (fun w hw w' hw' => by
        rw [← ofReal_norm]
        exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (hC₁ lam hl0 δ hδ w w' (hEδ w hw).1 (hEδ w hw).2
          (hEδ w' hw').1 (hEδ w' hw').2 (hEs w hw w' hw')))
      (A := ENNReal.ofReal C₁ * (ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / lam) *
        ENNReal.ofReal (Real.pi / (2 * lam * δ))))
      (fun w _ => by
        refine (setLIntegral_le_lintegral _ _).trans (le_of_eq ?_)
        simp_rw [ENNReal.ofReal_mul hC₁0]
        rw [lintegral_const_mul _ (show Measurable fun x : ℝ × ℝ => ENNReal.ofReal
          ((1 + (lam * (w.1 + w.2 - (x.1 + x.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹ *
            (1 + (lam * δ * (w.1 - w.2 - (x.1 - x.2))) ^ 2)⁻¹) from
          ENNReal.measurable_ofReal.comp (by fun_prop)),
          cs_aniso_integral hl0 hδ w])
    refine hpieceB E hE (4 * C₁ * Real.pi ^ 2) (by positivity) (le_max_left _ _)
      (hpc.trans (le_of_eq ?_))
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity), ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul hC₁0,
      show (2 : ℝ≥0∞) = ENNReal.ofReal 2 by simp, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by norm_num),
      ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by norm_num), ← mul_assoc, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity)]
    congr 2
    field_simp
    ring
  -- the remainder piece
  have hrem : eLpNorm (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam (Pr.indicator f) z) 2 volume ≤ B := by
    set δ := ℓ / 2 ^ (M + 1)
    have hδ : 0 < δ := by positivity
    have hδl : δ ≤ 1 / lam := by
      rw [div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) hl0]
      calc ℓ * lam ≤ 1 * lam := by gcongr
        _ ≤ 1 * 2 ^ (M + 1) := by linarith
    set S : Set ((ℝ × ℝ) × (ℝ × ℝ)) := {q | |q.1.1 - q.2.1| ≤ 2 * R}
    have hS : MeasurableSet S := measurableSet_le (by fun_prop) measurable_const
    have hpc := cs_piece hΦc hbc hMb0 hMb hR lam hg hgN hg0 hPr (δ := δ)
      (fun w hw => hw)
      (fun w w' => S.indicator (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal C₀) (w, w'))
      (by
        have : Function.uncurry (fun w w' : ℝ × ℝ => S.indicator (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal C₀)
            (w, w')) = S.indicator (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal C₀) := by funext q; rfl
        rw [this]; exact measurable_const.indicator hS)
      (fun w w' => by
        simp only [S, Set.indicator_apply, mem_ofPred_eq, abs_sub_comm w.1 w'.1])
      (fun w _ w' _ => by
        by_cases h : |w.1 - w'.1| ≤ 2 * R
        · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem (show (w, w') ∈ S from h), ← ofReal_norm]
          exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (csK2_triv hMb0 hMb hR lam w w').1
        · rw [(csK2_triv hMb0 hMb hR lam w w').2 (lt_of_not_ge h)]; simp)
      (A := ENNReal.ofReal C₀ * (ENNReal.ofReal (2 * (2 * R)) * ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ)))
      (fun w _ => by
        have e : (fun w' => S.indicator (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal C₀) (w, w')) =
            {w' : ℝ × ℝ | |w.1 - w'.1| ≤ 2 * R}.indicator (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal C₀) := by
          funext w'; simp only [S, Set.indicator_apply, mem_ofPred_eq]
        rw [e, lintegral_indicator_const (measurableSet_le (by fun_prop) measurable_const),
          Measure.restrict_apply (measurableSet_le (by fun_prop) measurable_const)]
        gcongr
        refine (measure_mono ?_).trans (cs_volume_strip w.1 (2 * R) δ)
        intro w' hw'
        exact ⟨hw'.1, hw'.2⟩)
    refine hpieceB Pr hPr (64 * C₀ * R * (δ * lam) ^ 2) (by positivity) ?_ (hpc.trans ?_)
    · refine le_trans ?_ (le_max_right _ _)
      have : (δ * lam) ^ 2 ≤ 1 := by
        have h1 : δ * lam ≤ 1 := by
          rw [le_div_iff₀ hl0] at hδl; linarith
        have h0 : 0 ≤ δ * lam := by positivity
        nlinarith
      calc 64 * C₀ * R * (δ * lam) ^ 2 ≤ 64 * C₀ * R * 1 := by gcongr
        _ = 64 * C₀ * R := by ring
    · apply le_of_eq
      rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity), ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul hC₀,
        show (2 : ℝ≥0∞) = ENNReal.ofReal 2 by simp, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by norm_num),
        ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by norm_num), ← mul_assoc, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity)]
      congr 2
      field_simp
      ring
  -- summing up
  have hPpδ : ∀ m, ∀ w ∈ Pp m, ℓ / 2 ^ m / 2 ≤ |w.1 - w.2| ∧ |w.1 - w.2| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m := by
    intro m w hw
    have hpos : 0 < w.1 - w.2 := lt_trans (by positivity) hw.1
    rw [abs_of_pos hpos, div_div, ← pow_succ]
    exact ⟨hw.1.le, hw.2⟩
  have hPmδ : ∀ m, ∀ w ∈ Pm m, ℓ / 2 ^ m / 2 ≤ |w.1 - w.2| ∧ |w.1 - w.2| ≤ ℓ / 2 ^ m := by
    intro m w hw
    have hpos : 0 < -(w.1 - w.2) := lt_trans (by positivity) hw.1
    rw [abs_of_neg (by linarith), div_div, ← pow_succ]
    exact ⟨hw.1.le, hw.2⟩
  have hPps : ∀ m, ∀ w ∈ Pp m, ∀ w' ∈ Pp m, 0 < (w.1 - w.2) * (w'.1 - w'.2) := by
    intro m w hw w' hw'
    exact mul_pos (lt_trans (by positivity) hw.1) (lt_trans (by positivity) hw'.1)
  have hPms : ∀ m, ∀ w ∈ Pm m, ∀ w' ∈ Pm m, 0 < (w.1 - w.2) * (w'.1 - w'.2) := by
    intro m w hw w' hw'
    have h1 : 0 < -(w.1 - w.2) := lt_trans (by positivity) hw.1
    have h2 : 0 < -(w'.1 - w'.2) := lt_trans (by positivity) hw'.1
    nlinarith
  rw [hsq, hfar]
  calc eLpNorm (0 + (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam (Pr.indicator f) z) +
        ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1), ((fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam ((Pp m).indicator f) z) +
          (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam ((Pm m).indicator f) z))) 2 volume ≤
        eLpNorm (0 + (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam (Pr.indicator f) z)) 2 volume +
          eLpNorm (∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1),
            ((fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam ((Pp m).indicator f) z) +
              (fun z => csOp2 Φ b lam ((Pm m).indicator f) z))) 2 volume :=
        eLpNorm_add_le (by norm_num)
    _ ≤ B + ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (M + 1), (B + B) := by
        gcongr
        · rw [zero_add]; exact hrem
        · refine (eLpNorm_sum_le (by norm_num)).trans (Finset.sum_le_sum fun m _ => ?_)
          refine (eLpNorm_add_le (by norm_num)).trans ?_
          gcongr
          · exact hdyad m (Pp m) (hPp m) (hPpδ m) (hPps m)
          · exact hdyad m (Pm m) (hPm m) (hPmδ m) (hPms m)
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (2 * M + 3) * B := by
        rw [Finset.sum_const, Finset.card_range, nsmul_eq_mul]
        have : ENNReal.ofReal (2 * M + 3) = 1 + ((M + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ≥0∞) * 2 := by
          rw [ENNReal.ofReal_add (by positivity) (by norm_num), ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by norm_num)]
          push_cast
          rw [ENNReal.ofReal_natCast]
          simp only [ENNReal.ofReal_ofNat]
          ring
        rw [this]; ring
    _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (8 / Real.log 2 * Real.sqrt K₁ * Real.log lam / lam) *
          X ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) := by
        rw [hBdef]
        rw [← mul_assoc, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity)]
        gcongr
        rw [mul_div_assoc', show 8 / Real.log 2 * Real.sqrt K₁ * Real.log lam =
          (8 / Real.log 2 * Real.log lam) * Real.sqrt K₁ by ring]
        gcongr
        linarith


/-! ### The `L⁴` estimate -/

theorem cs_eLpNorm_four_of_sq {F : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ} (hF : AEStronglyMeasurable F volume)
    {g : ℝ → ℂ} (hg : AEStronglyMeasurable g volume) {K : ℝ} (hK : 0 ≤ K)
    (h : eLpNorm (fun z => F z ^ 2) 2 volume ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal K * (∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ 4) ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ)) :
    eLpNorm F 4 volume ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (K ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ)) * eLpNorm g 4 volume := by
  have hF2 : AEStronglyMeasurable (fun z => F z ^ 2) volume := hF.pow 2
  rw [eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal (by norm_num) (by norm_num) hF2] at h
  rw [eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal (by norm_num) (by norm_num) hF,
    eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal (by norm_num) (by norm_num) hg]
  simp only [ENNReal.toReal_ofNat] at h ⊢
  have e2 : ∀ z, ‖F z ^ 2‖ₑ ^ (2 : ℝ) = ‖F z‖ₑ ^ (4 : ℕ) := fun z => by
    rw [enorm_pow, ← ENNReal.rpow_natCast, ← ENNReal.rpow_natCast, ← ENNReal.rpow_mul]
    norm_num
  have e4 : ∀ z, ‖F z‖ₑ ^ (4 : ℝ) = ‖F z‖ₑ ^ (4 : ℕ) := fun z => by
    rw [← ENNReal.rpow_natCast]; norm_num
  have e4' : ∀ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ (4 : ℝ) = ‖g y‖ₑ ^ (4 : ℕ) := fun y => by
    rw [← ENNReal.rpow_natCast]; norm_num
  simp_rw [e2] at h
  simp_rw [e4, e4']
  set I := ∫⁻ z, ‖F z‖ₑ ^ (4 : ℕ)
  set X := ∫⁻ y, ‖g y‖ₑ ^ (4 : ℕ)
  have h' := ENNReal.rpow_le_rpow h (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 1 / 2)
  rw [← ENNReal.rpow_mul, ENNReal.mul_rpow_of_nonneg _ _ (by norm_num), ← ENNReal.rpow_mul,
    ENNReal.ofReal_rpow_of_nonneg hK (by norm_num)] at h'
  convert h' using 3 <;> norm_num

/-- `L⁴` bound for amplitudes with small `s`-support. -/
theorem cs_L4_local' {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) {α β c : ℝ} (hαβ : α < β) (hc : 0 < c)
    (hND : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, ∀ t ∈ Icc α β,
      c * |s - t| ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s|) :
    ∃ ℓ₀ > 0, ∀ (b : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (p ℓ c₀ : ℝ), 0 < ℓ → ℓ ≤ ℓ₀ → ℓ ≤ 1 → 0 < c₀ →
      ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry b) → HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry b) →
      (∀ s u, b s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β ∩ Icc p (p + ℓ)) → (∀ s u, b s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u|) →
      ∃ C, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ lam, 2 ≤ lam → ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, MemLp g 4 volume →
        eLpNorm (csOp Φ b lam g) 4 volume ≤
          ENNReal.ofReal (C * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) * Real.log lam ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ)) *
            eLpNorm g 4 volume := by
  obtain ⟨ℓ₀, hℓ₀, hloc⟩ := cs_L4_local hΦ hαβ hc hND
  refine ⟨ℓ₀, hℓ₀, fun b p ℓ c₀ hℓ hℓℓ₀ hℓ1 hc₀ hb hb_supp hsb hub => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := hloc b p ℓ c₀ hℓ hℓℓ₀ hℓ1 hc₀ hb hb_supp hsb hub
  refine ⟨C ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ), by positivity, fun lam hlam g hg => ?_⟩
  have hl0 : 0 < lam := by linarith
  have hlog : 0 ≤ Real.log lam := Real.log_nonneg (by linarith)
  refine cs_density hΦ.continuous hb.continuous hb_supp (by norm_num) (fun g hgm N hgN hg0 => ?_)
    g hg
  have := cs_eLpNorm_four_of_sq (csOp_aestronglyMeasurable hΦ.continuous hb.continuous lam hgm)
    hgm.aestronglyMeasurable (by positivity) (hC lam hlam g hgm N hgN hg0)
  refine this.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
  congr 2
  rw [Real.div_rpow (by positivity) hl0.le, Real.mul_rpow hC0 hlog, Real.rpow_neg hl0.le]
  ring

/-- The smooth bump `χ(t) = h(t + 1) - h(t)` (with `h` the smooth transition function),
supported in `[-1, 1]`; its integer translates sum to `1` on bounded intervals. -/
def csChi (t : ℝ) : ℝ := Real.smoothTransition (t + 1) - Real.smoothTransition t

theorem csChi_contDiff : ContDiff ℝ ∞ csChi := by
  unfold csChi
  have h : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Real.smoothTransition := Real.smoothTransition.contDiff
  exact (h.comp (contDiff_id.add contDiff_const)).sub h

theorem csChi_eq_zero {t : ℝ} (ht : csChi t ≠ 0) : -1 < t ∧ t < 1 := by
  constructor
  · by_contra h
    apply ht
    simp only [csChi]
    rw [Real.smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by linarith),
      Real.smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by linarith)]
    simp
  · by_contra h
    apply ht
    simp only [csChi]
    rw [Real.smoothTransition.one_of_one_le (by linarith),
      Real.smoothTransition.one_of_one_le (by linarith)]
    simp

theorem csChi_sum {K : ℕ} {t : ℝ} (ht0 : 0 ≤ t) (htK : t ≤ K) :
    ∑ k ∈ Finset.range (K + 1), csChi (t - k) = 1 := by
  have : ∀ k : ℕ, csChi (t - k) = Real.smoothTransition (t - k + 1) -
      Real.smoothTransition (t - (k + 1 : ℕ) + 1) := by
    intro k; simp only [csChi]; push_cast; ring_nf
  simp_rw [this]
  rw [Finset.sum_range_sub' (fun k : ℕ => Real.smoothTransition (t - k + 1))]
  simp only [Nat.cast_zero, sub_zero]
  rw [Real.smoothTransition.one_of_one_le (by linarith),
    Real.smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by push_cast; linarith)]
  ring

/-- **The `L⁴` estimate of Carleson–Sjölin type**. -/
theorem csOp_L4 {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {α β c c₀ : ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ)
    (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a))
    (hαβ : α < β) (hc : 0 < c) (hc₀ : 0 < c₀)
    (hs : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β) (hu : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u|)
    (hND : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, ∀ t ∈ Icc α β,
      c * |s - t| ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s|) :
    ∃ C, ∀ lam ≥ 2, ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, MemLp g 4 volume →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam g) 4 volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (C * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) * Real.log lam ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ)) *
          eLpNorm g 4 volume := by
  obtain ⟨ℓ₀, hℓ₀, hloc⟩ := cs_L4_local' hΦ hαβ hc hND
  set ε := min ℓ₀ 1 / 2 with hεdef
  have hε : 0 < ε := by positivity
  set K := ⌈(β - α) / ε⌉₊
  -- the localized amplitudes
  let ak : ℕ → ℝ → ℝ → ℂ := fun k s u => a s u * ((csChi ((s - α) / ε - k) : ℝ) : ℂ)
  have hak_cd : ∀ k, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry (ak k)) := by
    intro k
    have h1 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun p : ℝ × ℝ => ((csChi ((p.1 - α) / ε - k) : ℝ) : ℂ)) :=
      Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.comp (csChi_contDiff.comp
        (((contDiff_fst.sub contDiff_const).div_const _).sub contDiff_const))
    exact ha.mul h1
  have hak_cs : ∀ k, HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry (ak k)) := fun k =>
    ha_supp.mul_right
  have hak_s : ∀ k : ℕ, ∀ s u, ak k s u ≠ 0 →
      s ∈ Icc α β ∩ Icc (α + (k - 1) * ε) (α + (k - 1) * ε + 2 * ε) := by
    intro k s u h
    have h1 : a s u ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by simp [ak, h'])
    have h2 : csChi ((s - α) / ε - k) ≠ 0 := fun h' => h (by simp [ak, h'])
    obtain ⟨l, r⟩ := csChi_eq_zero h2
    refine ⟨hs s u h1, ?_, ?_⟩
    · have : (k : ℝ) - 1 < (s - α) / ε := by linarith
      rw [lt_div_iff₀ hε] at this; linarith
    · have : (s - α) / ε < k + 1 := by linarith
      rw [div_lt_iff₀ hε] at this; linarith
  have hak_u : ∀ k : ℕ, ∀ s u, ak k s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u| := by
    intro k s u h
    exact hu s u (fun h' => h (by simp [ak, h']))
  have hsum : ∀ s u, a s u = ∑ k ∈ Finset.range (K + 1), ak k s u := by
    intro s u
    by_cases h : a s u = 0
    · simp [ak, h]
    · have hsI := hs s u h
      simp only [ak, ← Finset.mul_sum]
      have h0 : 0 ≤ (s - α) / ε := div_nonneg (by linarith [hsI.1]) hε.le
      have hK : (s - α) / ε ≤ K := by
        calc (s - α) / ε ≤ (β - α) / ε := by gcongr; linarith [hsI.2]
          _ ≤ K := Nat.le_ceil _
      rw [← Complex.ofReal_sum, csChi_sum h0 hK]
      simp
  -- the local estimates
  have h2ε : 2 * ε = min ℓ₀ 1 := by rw [hεdef]; ring
  have hk : ∀ k : ℕ, ∃ C, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ lam, 2 ≤ lam → ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, MemLp g 4 volume →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ (ak k) lam g) 4 volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (C * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) * Real.log lam ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ)) *
          eLpNorm g 4 volume := by
    intro k
    exact hloc (ak k) (α + (k - 1) * ε) (2 * ε) c₀ (by positivity)
      (by rw [h2ε]; exact min_le_left _ _) (by rw [h2ε]; exact min_le_right _ _) hc₀
      (hak_cd k) (hak_cs k) (hak_s k) (hak_u k)
  choose Ck hCk0 hCk using hk
  refine ⟨∑ k ∈ Finset.range (K + 1), Ck k, fun lam hlam g hg => ?_⟩
  have hl0 : 0 < lam := by linarith
  -- the operator is the sum of the localized operators
  obtain ⟨R, hR0, hR⟩ := cs_amp_ball ha_supp
  have hloc_int : ∀ (k : ℕ) (z : ℝ × ℝ), Integrable (fun y => cexp (I * lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 - y)) *
      ak k (z.1 - y) z.2 * g y) := by
    intro k z
    obtain ⟨Ma, hMa0, hMa⟩ := cs_amp_bound (hak_cd k) (hak_cs k)
    have hgi : IntegrableOn g (Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R)) volume :=
      (hg.locallyIntegrable (by norm_num)).integrableOn_isCompact isCompact_Icc
    refine Integrable.mono' ((show IntegrableOn (fun y => Ma * ‖g y‖) (Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R))
      volume from hgi.norm.const_mul Ma).integrable_indicator measurableSet_Icc)
      ?_ (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_)
    · have hc1 : Continuous (fun y : ℝ =>
          cexp (I * lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 - y)) * ak k (z.1 - y) z.2) :=
        (csKer_continuous hΦ.continuous (hak_cd k).continuous lam).comp
          (continuous_const.prodMk continuous_id)
      exact hc1.aestronglyMeasurable.mul hg.aestronglyMeasurable
    · by_cases hy : y ∈ Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R)
      · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hy, norm_mul, norm_mul, show I * (lam : ℂ) * (z.2 : ℂ) *
          (Φ (z.1 - y) : ℂ) = ((lam * z.2 * Φ (z.1 - y) : ℝ) : ℂ) * I by push_cast; ring,
          Complex.norm_exp_ofReal_mul_I, one_mul]
        exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hMa _ _) (norm_nonneg _)
      · rw [Set.indicator_of_notMem hy]
        have : ak k (z.1 - y) z.2 = 0 := by
          by_contra hne
          have h1 : a (z.1 - y) z.2 ≠ 0 := fun h' => hne (by simp [ak, h'])
          have hmem := hR (subset_tsupport (Function.uncurry a)
            (show ((z.1 - y, z.2) : ℝ × ℝ) ∈ Function.support (Function.uncurry a) from h1))
          rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at hmem
          have := (norm_fst_le _).trans hmem
          simp only [Real.norm_eq_abs] at this
          apply hy; constructor <;> linarith [(abs_le.mp this).1, (abs_le.mp this).2]
        rw [this, mul_zero, zero_mul, norm_zero]
  have hop : csOp Φ a lam g = ∑ k ∈ Finset.range (K + 1), csOp Φ (ak k) lam g := by
    funext z
    rw [Finset.sum_apply]
    unfold csOp
    rw [← integral_finsetSum _ fun k _ => hloc_int k z]
    congr 1; funext y
    rw [hsum, Finset.mul_sum, Finset.sum_mul]
  rw [hop]
  refine (eLpNorm_sum_le (by norm_num)).trans ?_
  calc ∑ k ∈ Finset.range (K + 1), eLpNorm (csOp Φ (ak k) lam g) 4 volume ≤
        ∑ k ∈ Finset.range (K + 1), ENNReal.ofReal (Ck k * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) *
          Real.log lam ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ)) * eLpNorm g 4 volume :=
        Finset.sum_le_sum fun k _ => hCk k lam hlam g hg
    _ = _ := by
        rw [← Finset.sum_mul, ← ENNReal.ofReal_sum_of_nonneg (fun k _ => by
          have := hCk0 k
          have : 0 ≤ Real.log lam := Real.log_nonneg (by linarith)
          positivity), Finset.sum_mul, Finset.sum_mul]


/-! ### Interpolated `L^q` estimates -/

theorem cs_integrable_of_bdd {g : ℝ → ℂ} (hg : StronglyMeasurable g) {N : ℝ}
    (hgN : ∀ y, ‖g y‖ ≤ N) (hg0 : ∀ y, N < |y| → g y = 0) : Integrable g := by
  refine Integrable.mono' (g := (Icc (-N) N).indicator fun _ => N)
    ((integrableOn_const (by simp)).integrable_indicator measurableSet_Icc)
    hg.aestronglyMeasurable (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_)
  by_cases hy : y ∈ Icc (-N) N
  · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hy]; exact hgN y
  · rw [Set.indicator_of_notMem hy]
    have : N < |y| := by
      by_contra h
      exact hy (abs_le.mp (not_lt.mp h))
    rw [hg0 y this, norm_zero]

theorem csKer_integrable_mul {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ) {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ}
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) {Ma : ℝ} (hMa : ∀ s u, ‖a s u‖ ≤ Ma) (lam : ℝ)
    (z : ℝ × ℝ) {f : ℝ → ℂ} (hf : Integrable f) :
    Integrable (fun y => csKer Φ a lam z y * f y) :=
  hf.bdd_mul (((csKer_continuous hΦ ha lam).comp
    (continuous_const.prodMk continuous_id)).aestronglyMeasurable)
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => csKer_norm_le hMa lam z y)

/-- Density from simple functions to bounded compactly supported functions. -/
theorem cs_density_simple {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ)
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a))
    {lam : ℝ} {p : ℝ≥0∞} {K : ℝ≥0∞}
    (hsimple : ∀ f : SimpleFunc ℝ ℂ, Integrable f →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam f) p volume ≤ K * eLpNorm f p volume)
    (g : ℝ → ℂ) (hg : StronglyMeasurable g) (N : ℝ) (hgN : ∀ y, ‖g y‖ ≤ N)
    (hg0 : ∀ y, N < |y| → g y = 0) :
    eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam g) p volume ≤ 2 * K * eLpNorm g p volume := by
  obtain ⟨Ma, hMa0, hMa⟩ : ∃ Ma, 0 ≤ Ma ∧ ∀ s u, ‖a s u‖ ≤ Ma := by
    obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := ha.bounded_above_of_compact_support ha_supp
    exact ⟨max C 0, le_max_right _ _, fun s u => (hC (s, u)).trans (le_max_left _ _)⟩
  have hgi := cs_integrable_of_bdd hg hgN hg0
  set s : ℕ → SimpleFunc ℝ ℂ := fun n =>
    SimpleFunc.approxOn g hg.measurable univ 0 (mem_univ 0) n
  have hsi : ∀ n, Integrable (s n) := fun n =>
    SimpleFunc.integrable_approxOn hg.measurable hgi (mem_univ 0) (integrable_zero _ _ _) n
  have hsle : ∀ n y, ‖s n y‖ ≤ ‖(2 : ℂ) * g y‖ := by
    intro n y
    have := SimpleFunc.norm_approxOn_zero_le hg.measurable (mem_univ (0 : ℂ)) y n
    rw [norm_mul, show ‖(2 : ℂ)‖ = 2 by simp]
    linarith
  have hlim : ∀ y, Tendsto (fun n => s n y) atTop (𝓝 (g y)) := fun y =>
    SimpleFunc.tendsto_approxOn hg.measurable (mem_univ 0) (by simp)
  have hTlim : ∀ z, Tendsto (fun n => csOp Φ a lam (s n) z) atTop (𝓝 (csOp Φ a lam g z)) := by
    intro z
    refine tendsto_integral_of_dominated_convergence (fun y => Ma * ‖(2 : ℂ) * g y‖)
      (fun n => ?_) ((hgi.const_mul 2).norm.const_mul Ma) (fun n => ?_) ?_
    · exact ((csKer_continuous hΦ ha lam).comp (continuous_const.prodMk continuous_id)
        |>.stronglyMeasurable.mul (s n).stronglyMeasurable).aestronglyMeasurable
    · refine Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_
      rw [norm_mul]
      exact mul_le_mul (csKer_norm_le hMa lam z y) (hsle n y) (norm_nonneg _) hMa0
    · refine Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_
      exact ((hlim y).const_mul (csKer Φ a lam z y))
  have hfatou := Lp.eLpNorm_lim_le_liminf_eLpNorm (p := p)
    (fun n => csOp_aestronglyMeasurable hΦ ha lam (s n).stronglyMeasurable) (csOp Φ a lam g)
    (csOp_aestronglyMeasurable hΦ ha lam hg) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hTlim)
  refine hfatou.trans (Filter.liminf_le_of_frequently_le' (Filter.Frequently.of_forall fun n => ?_))
  refine (hsimple (s n) (hsi n)).trans ?_
  have h2 : eLpNorm (s n) p volume ≤ eLpNorm (fun y => (2 : ℂ) * g y) p volume :=
    eLpNorm_mono (s n).stronglyMeasurable.aestronglyMeasurable (hsle n)
  have h3 : eLpNorm (fun y => (2 : ℂ) * g y) p volume = 2 * eLpNorm g p volume := by
    have e : (fun y => (2 : ℂ) * g y) = (2 : ℂ) • g := rfl
    rw [e, eLpNorm_const_smul]
    congr 1
    rw [← ofReal_norm, show ‖(2 : ℂ)‖ = 2 by simp]; simp
  calc K * eLpNorm (s n) p volume ≤ K * (2 * eLpNorm g p volume) := by
        gcongr; rw [← h3]; exact h2
    _ = 2 * K * eLpNorm g p volume := by ring

/-- The trivial `L^∞` bound. -/
theorem cs_Linfty {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ)
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a)) :
    ∃ C, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ lam : ℝ, ∀ f : ℝ → ℂ, StronglyMeasurable f →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam f) ⊤ volume ≤ ENNReal.ofReal C * eLpNorm f ⊤ volume := by
  obtain ⟨Ma, hMa0, hMa⟩ : ∃ Ma, 0 ≤ Ma ∧ ∀ s u, ‖a s u‖ ≤ Ma := by
    obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := ha.bounded_above_of_compact_support ha_supp
    exact ⟨max C 0, le_max_right _ _, fun s u => (hC (s, u)).trans (le_max_left _ _)⟩
  obtain ⟨R, hR0, hR⟩ := cs_amp_ball ha_supp
  refine ⟨Ma * (2 * R), by positivity, fun lam f hf => ?_⟩
  rw [eLpNorm_exponent_top (csOp_aestronglyMeasurable hΦ ha lam hf),
    eLpNorm_exponent_top hf.aestronglyMeasurable]
  refine eLpNormEssSup_le_of_ae_enorm_bound (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)
  rw [csOp_eq]
  refine (enorm_integral_le_lintegral_enorm _).trans ?_
  calc ∫⁻ y, ‖csKer Φ a lam z y * f y‖ₑ ≤
      ∫⁻ y, (Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R)).indicator
        (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal Ma * eLpNormEssSup f volume) y := by
        refine lintegral_mono_ae ?_
        filter_upwards [ae_le_eLpNormEssSup (μ := volume) (f := f)] with y hy
        by_cases hyI : y ∈ Icc (z.1 - R) (z.1 + R)
        · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hyI, enorm_mul]
          gcongr
          rw [← ofReal_norm]; exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (csKer_norm_le hMa lam z y)
        · rw [Set.indicator_of_notMem hyI]
          have : csKer Φ a lam z y = 0 := by
            by_contra hc
            have hmem := hR (subset_tsupport (Function.uncurry a)
              (show ((z.1 - y, z.2) : ℝ × ℝ) ∈ Function.support (Function.uncurry a) from
                csKer_ne_zero hc))
            rw [Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right] at hmem
            have h1 : |z.1 - y| ≤ R := (norm_fst_le _).trans hmem
            apply hyI; constructor <;> linarith [(abs_le.mp h1).1, (abs_le.mp h1).2]
          rw [this, zero_mul, enorm_zero]
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal Ma * eLpNormEssSup f volume * ENNReal.ofReal (2 * R) := by
        rw [lintegral_indicator_const measurableSet_Icc, Real.volume_Icc]
        congr 2; ring
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (Ma * (2 * R)) * eLpNormEssSup f volume := by
        rw [ENNReal.ofReal_mul hMa0]; ring

theorem csOp_add_simple {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} (hΦ : Continuous Φ)
    (ha : Continuous (Function.uncurry a)) {Ma : ℝ} (hMa : ∀ s u, ‖a s u‖ ≤ Ma) (lam : ℝ)
    (f g : SimpleFunc ℝ ℂ) (hf : Integrable f) (hg : Integrable g) :
    csOp Φ a lam (f + g) = csOp Φ a lam f + csOp Φ a lam g := by
  funext z
  simp only [Pi.add_apply, csOp_eq, mul_add]
  exact integral_add (csKer_integrable_mul hΦ ha hMa lam z hf)
    (csKer_integrable_mul hΦ ha hMa lam z hg)

theorem csOp_smul_simple (Φ : ℝ → ℝ) (a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ) (lam : ℝ) (c : ℂ)
    (f : SimpleFunc ℝ ℂ) : csOp Φ a lam (c • f) = c • csOp Φ a lam f := by
  funext z
  simp only [Pi.smul_apply, csOp_eq, smul_eq_mul]
  rw [← integral_const_mul]
  congr 1; funext y; ring

theorem cs_exponent_identity {q p₀ θ : ℝ} (hq : 0 < q) (hp₀ : 0 < p₀) (hθ : θ ∈ Ioo 0 1)
    {p₁inv : ℝ} (hp₁ : 0 ≤ p₁inv) (h : 1 / q = (1 - θ) / p₀ + θ * p₁inv) :
    (ENNReal.ofReal q)⁻¹ = ENNReal.ofReal (1 - θ) * (ENNReal.ofReal p₀)⁻¹ +
      ENNReal.ofReal θ * ENNReal.ofReal p₁inv := by
  rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_inv_of_pos hq, ← ENNReal.ofReal_inv_of_pos hp₀,
    ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by linarith [hθ.2]), ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul hθ.1.le,
    ← ENNReal.ofReal_add (by have := hθ.2; positivity) (by have := hθ.1; positivity)]
  congr 1
  rw [inv_eq_one_div, h]; ring

/-- **Interpolated estimate for `2 < q < 4`**: `‖T_λ g‖_q ≲ λ^{-1/2} (log λ)^{1-2/q} ‖g‖_q`. -/
theorem csOp_Lq_mid {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {α β c c₀ : ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ)
    (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a))
    (hαβ : α < β) (hc : 0 < c) (hc₀ : 0 < c₀)
    (hs : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β) (hu : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u|)
    (hΦ' : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, deriv Φ s ≠ 0)
    (hND : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, ∀ t ∈ Icc α β,
      c * |s - t| ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s|)
    {q : ℝ} (hq2 : 2 < q) (hq4 : q < 4) :
    ∃ C, ∀ lam ≥ 2, ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, MemLp g (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam g) (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (C * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) * Real.log lam ^ (1 - 2 / q)) *
          eLpNorm g (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume := by
  obtain ⟨C₂, hC₂⟩ := csOp_L2 hΦ ha ha_supp hs hΦ'
  obtain ⟨C₄, hC₄⟩ := csOp_L4 hΦ ha ha_supp hαβ hc hc₀ hs hu hND
  obtain ⟨Ma, hMa0, hMa⟩ := cs_amp_bound ha ha_supp
  set θ := 2 - 4 / q with hθdef
  have hq0 : 0 < q := by linarith
  have hθ : θ ∈ Ioo (0 : ℝ) 1 := by
    constructor
    · rw [hθdef, sub_pos, div_lt_iff₀ hq0]; linarith
    · rw [hθdef, sub_lt_iff_lt_add, ← sub_lt_iff_lt_add', lt_div_iff₀ hq0]; linarith
  set A := (|C₂| + 1) ^ (1 - θ) * (|C₄| + 1) ^ θ
  refine ⟨2 * A, fun lam hlam g hg => ?_⟩
  have hl0 : 0 < lam := by linarith
  have hlog : 0 < Real.log lam := Real.log_pos (by linarith)
  set M₀ := (|C₂| + 1) * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ))
  set M₁ := (|C₄| + 1) * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) * Real.log lam ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ)
  have hM₀ : 0 < M₀ := by positivity
  have hM₁ : 0 < M₁ := by positivity
  have hq' : 1 ≤ ENNReal.ofReal q := by
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_one]; exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (by linarith)
  have hRT := riesz_thorin (μ := (volume : Measure ℝ)) (ν := (volume : Measure (ℝ × ℝ)))
    (p₀ := 2) (p₁ := 4) (p := ENNReal.ofReal q) (q₀ := 2) (q₁ := 4) (q := ENNReal.ofReal q)
    (θ := θ) (M₀ := M₀) (M₁ := M₁)
    (fun f => csOp Φ a lam f) (by norm_num) (by norm_num) (by norm_num) (by norm_num) hθ
    (by
      have := cs_exponent_identity hq0 (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 2) hθ
        (p₁inv := 1 / 4) (by norm_num) (by rw [hθdef]; field_simp; ring)
      simpa using this)
    (by
      have := cs_exponent_identity hq0 (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 2) hθ
        (p₁inv := 1 / 4) (by norm_num) (by rw [hθdef]; field_simp; ring)
      simpa using this)
    (fun f g hf hg => csOp_add_simple hΦ.continuous ha.continuous hMa lam f g hf hg)
    (fun c f _ => csOp_smul_simple Φ a lam c f)
    (fun f _ => (StronglyMeasurable.integral_prod_right' (ν := (volume : Measure ℝ))
      (cs_kernel_stronglyMeasurable hΦ.continuous ha.continuous lam
        f.stronglyMeasurable)).measurable)
    hM₀ hM₁
    (fun f hf => by
      refine (hC₂ lam (by linarith) f ((SimpleFunc.memLp_iff_integrable (by norm_num)
        (by norm_num)).mpr hf)).trans ?_
      gcongr
      have := abs_nonneg C₂
      have : C₂ ≤ |C₂| + 1 := by linarith [le_abs_self C₂]
      exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right this (by positivity))
    (fun f hf => by
      refine (hC₄ lam hlam f ((SimpleFunc.memLp_iff_integrable (by norm_num)
        (by norm_num)).mpr hf)).trans ?_
      gcongr
      have : C₄ ≤ |C₄| + 1 := by linarith [le_abs_self C₄]
      exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right this (by positivity))
        (by positivity))
  have hval : Real.rpow M₀ (1 - θ) * Real.rpow M₁ θ =
      A * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) * Real.log lam ^ (1 - 2 / q) := by
    simp only [M₀, M₁, A, Real.rpow_eq_pow]
    rw [Real.mul_rpow (by positivity) (by positivity),
      Real.mul_rpow (by positivity) (by positivity),
      Real.mul_rpow (by positivity) (by positivity),
      ← Real.rpow_mul hl0.le, ← Real.rpow_mul hl0.le, ← Real.rpow_mul hlog.le]
    have e1 : lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ) * (1 - θ)) * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ) * θ) =
        lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) := by
      rw [← Real.rpow_add hl0]; congr 1; ring
    have e2 : 1 / 2 * θ = 1 - 2 / q := by rw [hθdef]; ring
    rw [e2]
    calc _ = (|C₂| + 1) ^ (1 - θ) * (|C₄| + 1) ^ θ *
          (lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ) * (1 - θ)) * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ) * θ)) *
          Real.log lam ^ (1 - 2 / q) := by ring
      _ = _ := by rw [e1]
  have hsimple : ∀ f : SimpleFunc ℝ ℂ, Integrable f →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam f) (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (A * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) * Real.log lam ^ (1 - 2 / q)) *
          eLpNorm f (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume := fun f hf => by
    rw [← hval]; exact (hRT f hf).2
  refine cs_density hΦ.continuous ha.continuous ha_supp hq' (fun g hgm N hgN hg0 => ?_) g hg
  refine (cs_density_simple hΦ.continuous ha.continuous ha_supp hsimple g hgm N hgN hg0).trans
    (le_of_eq ?_)
  rw [show (2 : ℝ≥0∞) = ENNReal.ofReal 2 by simp, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by norm_num)]
  congr 2; ring

/-- **Interpolated estimate for `4 < q < ∞`**: `‖T_λ g‖_q ≲ λ^{-2/q} (log λ)^{2/q} ‖g‖_q`. -/
theorem csOp_Lq_high {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {a : ℝ → ℝ → ℂ} {α β c c₀ : ℝ} (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ)
    (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (Function.uncurry a)) (ha_supp : HasCompactSupport (Function.uncurry a))
    (hαβ : α < β) (hc : 0 < c) (hc₀ : 0 < c₀)
    (hs : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → s ∈ Icc α β) (hu : ∀ s u, a s u ≠ 0 → c₀ ≤ |u|)
    (hND : ∀ s ∈ Icc α β, ∀ t ∈ Icc α β,
      c * |s - t| ≤ |deriv (deriv Φ) s * deriv Φ t - deriv (deriv Φ) t * deriv Φ s|)
    {q : ℝ} (hq : 4 < q) :
    ∃ C, ∀ lam ≥ 2, ∀ g : ℝ → ℂ, MemLp g (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam g) (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (C * lam ^ (-(2 / q)) * Real.log lam ^ (2 / q)) *
          eLpNorm g (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume := by
  obtain ⟨C₄, hC₄⟩ := csOp_L4 hΦ ha ha_supp hαβ hc hc₀ hs hu hND
  obtain ⟨Ma, hMa0, hMa⟩ := cs_amp_bound ha ha_supp
  obtain ⟨Cinf, hCinf0, hCinf⟩ := cs_Linfty hΦ.continuous ha.continuous ha_supp
  set θ := 1 - 4 / q with hθdef
  have hq0 : 0 < q := by linarith
  have hθ : θ ∈ Ioo (0 : ℝ) 1 := by
    constructor
    · rw [hθdef, sub_pos, div_lt_iff₀ hq0]; linarith
    · rw [hθdef]; have : 0 < 4 / q := by positivity
      linarith
  set A := (|C₄| + 1) ^ (1 - θ) * (Cinf + 1) ^ θ
  refine ⟨2 * A, fun lam hlam g hg => ?_⟩
  have hl0 : 0 < lam := by linarith
  have hlog : 0 < Real.log lam := Real.log_pos (by linarith)
  set M₀ := (|C₄| + 1) * lam ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) * Real.log lam ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ)
  set M₁ := Cinf + 1
  have hM₀ : 0 < M₀ := by positivity
  have hM₁ : 0 < M₁ := by positivity
  have hq' : 1 ≤ ENNReal.ofReal q := by
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_one]; exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (by linarith)
  have hexp : (ENNReal.ofReal q)⁻¹ = ENNReal.ofReal (1 - θ) * (4 : ℝ≥0∞)⁻¹ +
      ENNReal.ofReal θ * (⊤ : ℝ≥0∞)⁻¹ := by
    have := cs_exponent_identity hq0 (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 4) hθ (p₁inv := 0) le_rfl
      (by rw [hθdef]; field_simp; ring)
    simpa using this
  have hRT := riesz_thorin (μ := (volume : Measure ℝ)) (ν := (volume : Measure (ℝ × ℝ)))
    (p₀ := 4) (p₁ := ⊤) (p := ENNReal.ofReal q) (q₀ := 4) (q₁ := ⊤) (q := ENNReal.ofReal q)
    (θ := θ) (M₀ := M₀) (M₁ := M₁)
    (fun f => csOp Φ a lam f) (by norm_num) le_top (by norm_num) le_top hθ hexp hexp
    (fun f g hf hg => csOp_add_simple hΦ.continuous ha.continuous hMa lam f g hf hg)
    (fun c f _ => csOp_smul_simple Φ a lam c f)
    (fun f _ => (StronglyMeasurable.integral_prod_right' (ν := (volume : Measure ℝ))
      (cs_kernel_stronglyMeasurable hΦ.continuous ha.continuous lam
        f.stronglyMeasurable)).measurable)
    hM₀ hM₁
    (fun f hf => by
      refine (hC₄ lam hlam f ((SimpleFunc.memLp_iff_integrable (by norm_num)
        (by norm_num)).mpr hf)).trans ?_
      gcongr
      have : C₄ ≤ |C₄| + 1 := by linarith [le_abs_self C₄]
      exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right this (by positivity))
        (by positivity))
    (fun f _ => by
      refine (hCinf lam f f.stronglyMeasurable).trans ?_
      gcongr
      simp only [M₁]; linarith)
  have hval : Real.rpow M₀ (1 - θ) * Real.rpow M₁ θ =
      A * lam ^ (-(2 / q)) * Real.log lam ^ (2 / q) := by
    simp only [M₀, M₁, A, Real.rpow_eq_pow]
    rw [Real.mul_rpow (by positivity) (by positivity),
      Real.mul_rpow (by positivity) (by positivity), ← Real.rpow_mul hl0.le,
      ← Real.rpow_mul hlog.le]
    have e1 : -(1 / 2 : ℝ) * (1 - θ) = -(2 / q) := by rw [hθdef]; ring
    have e2 : 1 / 2 * (1 - θ) = 2 / q := by rw [hθdef]; ring
    rw [e1, e2]; ring
  have hsimple : ∀ f : SimpleFunc ℝ ℂ, Integrable f →
      eLpNorm (csOp Φ a lam f) (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (A * lam ^ (-(2 / q)) * Real.log lam ^ (2 / q)) *
          eLpNorm f (ENNReal.ofReal q) volume := fun f hf => by
    rw [← hval]; exact (hRT f hf).2
  refine cs_density hΦ.continuous ha.continuous ha_supp hq' (fun g hgm N hgN hg0 => ?_) g hg
  refine (cs_density_simple hΦ.continuous ha.continuous ha_supp hsimple g hgm N hgN hg0).trans
    (le_of_eq ?_)
  rw [show (2 : ℝ≥0∞) = ENNReal.ofReal 2 by simp, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by norm_num)]
  congr 2; ring


end

